 provide creative, casual videos they could embed into their content. Combining animation and casually recorded videos, we created a series of unique company culture videos to highlight Trupanion’s vision.'),(9681,2369,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(9682,2369,'results',''),(9683,2369,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(9684,2369,'challenge_title','Communicating Compassionate Company Culture To New Hires'),(9685,2369,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(9686,2369,'challenge_columns','0'),(9687,2369,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(9688,2369,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(9689,2369,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(9690,2369,'solution_columns','0'),(9691,2369,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(9692,2369,'results_title',''),(9693,2369,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(9694,2369,'results_columns','0'),(9695,2369,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(9696,2369,'solution_image','2368'),(9697,2369,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(9698,2369,'solution_image_position','0'),(9699,2369,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(9700,2370,'client_name','Trupanion'),(9701,2370,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(9702,2370,'client_logo','2362'),(9703,2370,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(9704,2370,'client_intro','Founded in 1998 with pets and pet lovers in mind, Trupanion has seen massive growth in the pet insurance industry\r\n\r\nWith the mission of helping pet lovers budget and care for their pets, Trupanion has helped pets in the US, Canada, Australia, and Puerto Rico\r\n\r\nBased in Seattle, WA, Trupanion offers cat and dog insurance, helping pets live longer, happier lives'),(9705,2370,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(9706,2370,'challenge','Trupanion came to us with the challenge of creating employee onb