ed with the company vision. They wanted interactive video e-learning that was creative and expressed their love of animals in a casual, compassionate environment.\r\n\r\nThe main concepts Trupanion wanted to get across to their new employees were the problem that the company was solving (helping pet owners afford care for their beloved pets), identifying how each employee’s role contributes to Trupanion’s mission and recognizing how the company measures success in its employees. They wanted to communicate these messages in an effective and creative way to keep employees engaged and aligned with their mission.'),(9869,2375,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(9870,2375,'solution','Since the main goal of this project was to be able to effectively communicate the company’s commitment to their values, we wanted to provide creative, casual videos they could embed into their content. Combining animation and casually recorded videos, we created a series of unique company culture videos to highlight Trupanion’s vision.'),(9871,2375,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(9872,2375,'results',''),(9873,2375,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(9874,2375,'challenge_title','Communicating Compassionate Company Culture To New Hires'),(9875,2375,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(9876,2375,'challenge_columns','1'),(9877,2375,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(9878,2375,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(9879,2375,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(9880,2375,'solution_columns','0'),(9881,2375,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(9882,2375,'results_title',''),(9883,2375,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(9884,2375,'results_columns','0'),(9885,2375,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(9886,2375,'solution_image','2368'),(9887,2375,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(9888,2375,'solution_image_position','0'),(9889,2375,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(9890,2375,'related_projects','a:1:{i:0;s:4:\"2202\";}'),(9891,2375,'_related_projects','field_ninjatheme_cs_related_projects'),(9892,2375,'linked_project','2145'),(9893,2375,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(9894,2375,'project_section_title',''),(9895,2375,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(9896,2375,'project_section_text',''),(9897,2375,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(9900,2376,'footnotes',''),(9902,2376,'show_title',''),(9903,2376,'_show_title','field_6988f024f2096'),(9904,2376,'cs_archive_description','Microlearning is a revolutionary learning solution that caters to the diminishing attention span of the average human. With short-form video entertainment and condensed copy scattered across the internet, knowledge consumers no longer have the time or will to sit through umpteen hours of boring, motionless training modules – either in person or online.\r\n\r\nMicrolearning breaks down complex content into smaller, easily-digestible chunks and delivers them to learners using visually entertaining graphics, engaging voiceover, and impressive animation.\r\n\r\nMicrolearning is the perfect method for learning leaders searching for a training solution for employees on rotating shift work, those with non-traditional positions, students with flexible schedules, and executives with highly-demanding jobs. Smaller sessions fit into everyone’s busy schedule AND boast dramatically higher retention and implementation rates in today’s digitally-focused world.'),(9905,2376,'_cs_archive_description','field_ninjatheme_cs_archive_description'),(9906,2376,'cs_archive_image_position','1'),(9907,2376,'_cs_archive_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_archive_image_position'),(9908,2376,'cs_archive_posts_per_page','9'),(9909,2376,'_cs_archive_posts_per_page','field_ninjatheme_cs_archive_posts_per_page'),(9910,2377,'_edit_lock','1780270228:5'),(9911,2378,'_edit_lock','1780270286:5'),(9912,2379,'_edit_lock','1780270151:5'),(9913,2380,'_edit_lock','1780270307:5'),(9914,2381,'_edit_lock','1780270443:5'),(9915,2382,'_edit_lock','1780270645:5'),(9916,2405,'_edit_lock','1780270852:5'),(9917,2406,'_edit_lock','1780283380:5'),(9918,2406,'_oembed_b38517f4dbdaea3378c51da10d11a3fa','<iframe title=\"LA CAIDA DE EDGAR 4K FULL HD CINE CAM\" width=\"579\" height=\"326\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/An_e4zia7cM?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(9919,2406,'_oembed_time_b38517f4dbdaea3378c51da10d11a3fa','1780270920'),(9920,2406,'_edit_last','5'),(9921,2407,'_wp_attached_file','2026/05/case-study-bespoke-elearning-instructional.avif'),(9922,2407,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:684;s:6:\"height\";i:385;s:4:\"file\";s:55:\"2026/05/case-study-bespoke-elearning-instructional.avif\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:59934;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:55:\"case-study-bespoke-elearning-instructional-300x169.avif\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/avif\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:13317;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:55:\"case-study-bespoke-elearning-instructional-150x150.avif\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/avif\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6611;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(9923,2406,'rank_math_seo_score','21'),(9924,2406,'rank_math_contentai_score','a:5:{s:8:\"keywords\";s:5:\"74.51\";s:9:\"wordCount\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"linkCount\";s:1:\"0\";s:12:\"headingCount\";s:1:\"0\";s:10:\"mediaCount\";s:1:\"0\";}'),(9925,2406,'_thumbnail_id','2407'),(9926,2406,'client_name','The Nature Conservancy'),(9927,2406,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(9928,2406,'client_logo','2415'),(9929,2406,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(9930,2406,'client_intro','<p>The Nature Conservancy has been working with communities since 1951 to protect land and rivers worldwide.</p>\n<p>Their mission is to protect these natural areas and resources on which all life depends.</p>\n<p>With 400+ scientists on staff, they have become one of the most effective environmental nonprofits in the world.</p>'),(9931,2406,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(9932,2406,'challenge_title','The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities'),(9933,2406,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(9934,2406,'challenge_columns','0'),(9935,2406,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(9936,2406,'challenge','<p>In the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn\'t just a weather pattern; for many, it\'s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn\'t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.</p>\n<p>The problem with most \"off-the-shelf\" solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just dataâ€”they required a bridge.</p>'),(9937,2406,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(9938,2406,'solution_title','How Ninja Tropic Dismantled Barriers Through Bespoke eLearning Instructional Design'),(9939,2406,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(9940,2406,'solution_columns','0'),(9941,2406,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(9942,2406,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic\'s approach to bespoke eLearning instructional design begins with a fundamental truth: if the learner doesn\'t feel seen, they won\'t learn. We didn\'t just translate words; we translated intent.</p>\n<h3>1. The Bilingual Blueprint</h3>\n<p>One of the primary friction points for the Phoenix community was language. Ninja Tropic didn\'t treat Spanish as an afterthought or a \"Subtitle-only\" feature.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We consulted deeply on the production of the film and finalized scripts to ensure the Spanish-speaking participants felt like the primary audience, not a translation.</li>\n<li>Some lessons were delivered with closed captions, while others were built entirely in Spanish to ensure total inclusivity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Cognitive Load and Minimalist Animation</h3>\n<p>When you are teaching complex topics like urban heat mitigation and policy advocacy, the \"firehose\" effect is real. To combat this, Ninja Tropic utilized a minimalist animation style.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Focus on Clarity:</strong> By stripping away visual clutter, we allowed the learner to focus on the \"High-Value Information\".</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced Retention:</strong> Scientific studies show that minimalist visuals reduce cognitive load, leading to significantly higher retention of technical sustainability data.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. The Hybrid Media Strategy</h3>\n<p>We combined the human element of live-action video with the analytical power of animated simulations.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Live-Action:</strong> Built trust and rapport, showing real people in real Phoenix environments.</li>\n<li><strong>Simulations:</strong> Used animated demonstrations to show how heat moves through a city and how specific interventions (like tree canopies or cool roofs) alter that flow.</li>\n</ul>'),(9943,2406,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(9944,2406,'solution_image',''),(9945,2406,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(9946,2406,'solution_image_position','0'),(9947,2406,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(9948,2406,'results_title','The \"Aftermath\" of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact'),(9949,2406,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(9950,2406,'results_columns','0'),(9951,2406,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(9952,2406,'results','<p>The effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn\'t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.</p>\n<h3>1. Participant Confidence</h3>\n<p>The Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy\'s participants. These residents didn\'t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood\'s health.</p>\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\n<p>The project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case studyâ€”proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.</p>\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\n<p>Because the solution was built with a \"Bespoke\" but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.</p>'),(9953,2406,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(9954,2406,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(9955,2406,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(9956,2406,'project_section_text',''),(9957,2406,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(9958,2406,'linked_project','2091'),(9959,2406,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(9960,2406,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(9961,2408,'client_name','Phoenix Cooling'),(9962,2408,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(9963,2408,'client_logo',''),(9964,2408,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(9965,2408,'client_intro','<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.'),(9966,2408,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(9967,2408,'challenge_title',''),(9968,2408,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(9969,2408,'challenge_columns','0'),(9970,2408,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(9971,2408,'challenge',''),(9972,2408,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(9973,2408,'solution_title',''),(9974,2408,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(9975,2408,'solution_columns','0'),(9976,2408,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(9977,2408,'solution',''),(9978,2408,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(9979,2408,'solution_image',''),(9980,2408,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(9981,2408,'solution_image_position','0'),(9982,2408,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(9983,2408,'results_title',''),(9984,2408,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(9985,2408,'results_columns','0'),(9986,2408,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(9987,2408,'results',''),(9988,2408,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(9989,2408,'project_section_title',''),(9990,2408,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(9991,2408,'project_section_text',''),(9992,2408,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(9993,2408,'linked_project',''),(9994,2408,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(9995,2409,'client_name','Phoenix Cooling'),(9996,2409,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(9997,2409,'client_logo',''),(9998,2409,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(9999,2409,'client_intro','<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.'),(10000,2409,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10001,2409,'challenge_title',''),(10002,2409,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10003,2409,'challenge_columns','0'),(10004,2409,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10005,2409,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h1><b>Executive Summary: Results at a Glance</b></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h1><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10006,2409,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10007,2409,'solution_title',''),(10008,2409,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10009,2409,'solution_columns','0'),(10010,2409,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10011,2409,'solution',''),(10012,2409,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10013,2409,'solution_image',''),(10014,2409,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10015,2409,'solution_image_position','0'),(10016,2409,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10017,2409,'results_title',''),(10018,2409,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10019,2409,'results_columns','0'),(10020,2409,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10021,2409,'results',''),(10022,2409,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10023,2409,'project_section_title',''),(10024,2409,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10025,2409,'project_section_text',''),(10026,2409,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10027,2409,'linked_project',''),(10028,2409,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10029,2410,'client_name','Phoenix Cooling'),(10030,2410,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10031,2410,'client_logo',''),(10032,2410,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10033,2410,'client_intro','<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.'),(10034,2410,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10035,2410,'challenge_title',''),(10036,2410,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10037,2410,'challenge_columns','0'),(10038,2410,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10039,2410,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h1><b>Executive Summary: Results at a Glance</b></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h1><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10040,2410,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10041,2410,'solution_title',''),(10042,2410,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10043,2410,'solution_columns','1'),(10044,2410,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10045,2410,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2> 1. Participant Confidence</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2>2. Professional Recognition</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2>3. Scalability</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10046,2410,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10047,2410,'solution_image',''),(10048,2410,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10049,2410,'solution_image_position','0'),(10050,2410,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10051,2410,'results_title',''),(10052,2410,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10053,2410,'results_columns','0'),(10054,2410,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10055,2410,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h1><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h2><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10056,2410,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10057,2410,'project_section_title',''),(10058,2410,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10059,2410,'project_section_text',''),(10060,2410,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10061,2410,'linked_project',''),(10062,2410,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10063,2406,'_oembed_f11aa2bb6c00bdf3a0288d06b924dacc','<iframe title=\"Interactive Sustainability Training for Urban Heat Leadership Academy by Ninja Tropic\" width=\"564\" height=\"317\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8PMxZzi26Hc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(10064,2406,'_oembed_time_f11aa2bb6c00bdf3a0288d06b924dacc','1780272594'),(10065,2411,'client_name','Phoenix Cooling'),(10066,2411,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10067,2411,'client_logo',''),(10068,2411,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10069,2411,'client_intro','<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PMxZzi26Hc'),(10070,2411,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10071,2411,'challenge_title','Executive Summary: Results at a Glance'),(10072,2411,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10073,2411,'challenge_columns','0'),(10074,2411,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10075,2411,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10076,2411,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10077,2411,'solution_title',''),(10078,2411,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10079,2411,'solution_columns','1'),(10080,2411,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10081,2411,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10082,2411,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10083,2411,'solution_image',''),(10084,2411,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10085,2411,'solution_image_position','0'),(10086,2411,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10087,2411,'results_title',''),(10088,2411,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10089,2411,'results_columns','0'),(10090,2411,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10091,2411,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10092,2411,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10093,2411,'project_section_title',''),(10094,2411,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10095,2411,'project_section_text',''),(10096,2411,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10097,2411,'linked_project',''),(10098,2411,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10099,2406,'_oembed_e4dbb3b1ef98dae28fa07bace1cc4b10','<iframe title=\"Interactive Sustainability Training for Urban Heat Leadership Academy by Ninja Tropic\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8PMxZzi26Hc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(10100,2406,'_oembed_time_e4dbb3b1ef98dae28fa07bace1cc4b10','1780273057'),(10101,2412,'client_name','Phoenix Cooling'),(10102,2412,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10103,2412,'client_logo',''),(10104,2412,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10105,2412,'client_intro','<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PMxZzi26Hc'),(10106,2412,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10107,2412,'challenge_title','Executive Summary: Results at a Glance'),(10108,2412,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10109,2412,'challenge_columns','0'),(10110,2412,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10111,2412,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10112,2412,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10113,2412,'solution_title',''),(10114,2412,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10115,2412,'solution_columns','1'),(10116,2412,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10117,2412,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10118,2412,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10119,2412,'solution_image',''),(10120,2412,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10121,2412,'solution_image_position','0'),(10122,2412,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10123,2412,'results_title',''),(10124,2412,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10125,2412,'results_columns','1'),(10126,2412,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10127,2412,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10128,2412,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10129,2412,'project_section_title',''),(10130,2412,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10131,2412,'project_section_text',''),(10132,2412,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10133,2412,'linked_project',''),(10134,2412,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10135,2406,'_oembed_77101b018726a9702af89412e58ec6d0','<iframe title=\"Interactive Sustainability Training for Urban Heat Leadership Academy by Ninja Tropic\" width=\"982\" height=\"552\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8PMxZzi26Hc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),(10136,2406,'_oembed_time_77101b018726a9702af89412e58ec6d0','1780283124'),(10137,2413,'client_name','The Nature Conservancy'),(10138,2413,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10139,2413,'client_logo',''),(10140,2413,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10141,2413,'client_intro','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">The Nature Conservancy has been working with communities since 1951 to protect land and rivers worldwide</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap\"><span class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et-animated\"></span></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">Their mission is to protect these natural areas and resources on which all life depends</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap\"><span class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et-animated\"></span></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">With 400+ scientists on staff, they have become one of the most effective environmental nonprofits in the world</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PMxZzi26Hc'),(10142,2413,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10143,2413,'challenge_title','Executive Summary: Results at a Glance'),(10144,2413,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10145,2413,'challenge_columns','0'),(10146,2413,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10147,2413,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10148,2413,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10149,2413,'solution_title',''),(10150,2413,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10151,2413,'solution_columns','1'),(10152,2413,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10153,2413,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10154,2413,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10155,2413,'solution_image',''),(10156,2413,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10157,2413,'solution_image_position','0'),(10158,2413,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10159,2413,'results_title',''),(10160,2413,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10161,2413,'results_columns','1'),(10162,2413,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10163,2413,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h3>\r\n<img src=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-5.png\" alt=\"Phoenix Cooling: How The Nature Conservancy Scaled Social Justice Through Bespoke eLearning Instructional Design - Microlearning\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10164,2413,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10165,2413,'project_section_title',''),(10166,2413,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10167,2413,'project_section_text',''),(10168,2413,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10169,2413,'linked_project',''),(10170,2413,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10171,2414,'_wp_attached_file','2026/05/image-5.png'),(10172,2414,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1368;s:6:\"height\";i:770;s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"2026/05/image-5.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:317496;s:5:\"sizes\";a:5:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"image-5-300x169.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:26720;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:20:\"image-5-1024x576.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:173352;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"image-5-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14822;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"image-5-768x432.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:432;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:111499;}s:14:\"post-thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:20:\"image-5-1200x675.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:1200;s:6:\"height\";i:675;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:221622;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10173,2415,'_wp_attached_file','2026/05/TNCLogoPrimary_RGB-1-2.png'),(10174,2415,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:584;s:6:\"height\";i:168;s:4:\"file\";s:34:\"2026/05/TNCLogoPrimary_RGB-1-2.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:45289;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:33:\"TNCLogoPrimary_RGB-1-2-300x86.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:86;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:23322;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:34:\"TNCLogoPrimary_RGB-1-2-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11538;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10175,2416,'client_name','The Nature Conservancy'),(10176,2416,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10177,2416,'client_logo','2415'),(10178,2416,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10179,2416,'client_intro','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">The Nature Conservancy has been working with communities since 1951 to protect land and rivers worldwide</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap\"><span class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et-animated\"></span></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">Their mission is to protect these natural areas and resources on which all life depends</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap\"><span class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon et-animated\"></span></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">With 400+ scientists on staff, they have become one of the most effective environmental nonprofits in the world</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PMxZzi26Hc'),(10180,2416,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10181,2416,'challenge_title','Executive Summary: Results at a Glance'),(10182,2416,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10183,2416,'challenge_columns','0'),(10184,2416,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10185,2416,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10186,2416,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10187,2416,'solution_title',''),(10188,2416,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10189,2416,'solution_columns','1'),(10190,2416,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10191,2416,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10192,2416,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10193,2416,'solution_image',''),(10194,2416,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10195,2416,'solution_image_position','0'),(10196,2416,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10197,2416,'results_title',''),(10198,2416,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10199,2416,'results_columns','1'),(10200,2416,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10201,2416,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h3>\r\n<img src=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-5.png\" alt=\"Phoenix Cooling: How The Nature Conservancy Scaled Social Justice Through Bespoke eLearning Instructional Design - Microlearning\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10202,2416,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10203,2416,'project_section_title',''),(10204,2416,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10205,2416,'project_section_text',''),(10206,2416,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10207,2416,'linked_project',''),(10208,2416,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10209,2417,'client_name','The Nature Conservancy'),(10210,2417,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10211,2417,'client_logo','2415'),(10212,2417,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10213,2417,'client_intro','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">The Nature Conservancy has been working with communities since 1951 to protect land and rivers worldwide</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">Their mission is to protect these natural areas and resources on which all life depends</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\r\n<h4 class=\"et_pb_module_header\">With 400+ scientists on staff, they have become one of the most effective environmental nonprofits in the world</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<b>What is bespoke eLearning instructional design for environmental advocacy?</b> Bespoke eLearning instructional design is the engineering of custom educational experiences tailored to the specific cultural, linguistic, and technical realities of a target audience. For The Nature Conservancy’s Urban Heat Leadership Academy, this meant moving beyond generic, off-the-shelf training that ignores the soul of the community. By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, Ninja Tropic empowered residents in disinvested Phoenix neighborhoods to advocate for their environment. The project resulted in a significant increase in participant confidence and became a finalist for the Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.\r\n\r\nTo expand this case study into a high-authority asset, we move beyond the “what” and dive deep into the instructional design philosophy, the technical architecture of the solution, and the socio-economic impact of the project. This is about positioning a strategic partnership with the storytelling grit to face systemic threats, combined with the direct, value-driven insight needed to enact real change.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PMxZzi26Hc'),(10214,2417,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10215,2417,'challenge_title','Executive Summary: Results at a Glance'),(10216,2417,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10217,2417,'challenge_columns','0'),(10218,2417,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10219,2417,'challenge','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The Nature Conservancy successfully scaled its Urban Heat Leadership Academy by partnering with Ninja Tropic for bespoke eLearning instructional design.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">By engineering a bilingual, hybrid training program within Articulate Rise, they empowered Phoenix residents in disinvested neighborhoods to advocate for their environment.</li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">The project’s measurable impact resulted in it becoming a finalist for the prestigious Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee more examples of our award-winning work in our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.ninjatropic.com/portfolio/\"> portfolio</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>The Invisible Crisis: Why Traditional Training Fails in Disinvested Communities</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nIn the heart of Phoenix, the sun isn’t just a weather pattern; for many, it’s a systemic threat. Urban heat islands disproportionately affect neighborhoods that have seen years of disinvestment. The Nature Conservancy knew that a standard PDF or a static PowerPoint wouldn’t move the needle. To create real-world change, they needed to turn residents into advocates.\r\n\r\nThe problem with most “off-the-shelf” solutions is their lack of soul. They ignore the cultural nuances and educational barriers of the people they are meant to serve. The Nature Conservancy faced a ticking clock and a diverse demographic that required more than just data—they required a bridge\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10220,2417,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10221,2417,'solution_title',''),(10222,2417,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10223,2417,'solution_columns','1'),(10224,2417,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10225,2417,'solution','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nThe project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3>3. Scalability</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nBecause the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10226,2417,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10227,2417,'solution_image',''),(10228,2417,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10229,2417,'solution_image_position','0'),(10230,2417,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10231,2417,'results_title',''),(10232,2417,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10233,2417,'results_columns','1'),(10234,2417,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10235,2417,'results','<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n<h3><b>Technical Deep-Dive: Why Articulate Rise for Impactful Learning?</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nChoosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nParticipants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">\r\n\r\nWe broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">\r\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Strategic Feature Breakdown&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">\r\n<h3><b>Strategic Feature Breakdown</b></h3>\r\n<img src=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-5.png\" alt=\"Phoenix Cooling: How The Nature Conservancy Scaled Social Justice Through Bespoke eLearning Instructional Design - Microlearning\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(10236,2417,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10237,2417,'project_section_title',''),(10238,2417,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10239,2417,'project_section_text',''),(10240,2417,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10241,2417,'linked_project',''),(10242,2417,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10243,2418,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/dale-carnegie-featured.webp'),(10244,2418,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:695;s:6:\"height\";i:460;s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"2026/06/dale-carnegie-featured.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:20160;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"dale-carnegie-featured-300x199.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:199;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7586;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"dale-carnegie-featured-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4390;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10245,2419,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/dale-carnegie-logo.webp'),(10246,2419,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:584;s:6:\"height\";i:183;s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"2026/06/dale-carnegie-logo.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6426;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"dale-carnegie-logo-300x94.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:94;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3536;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"dale-carnegie-logo-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2396;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10247,2420,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/dale-carnegie-solution.webp'),(10248,2420,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:878;s:6:\"height\";i:524;s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"2026/06/dale-carnegie-solution.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14834;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"dale-carnegie-solution-300x179.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:179;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3938;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"dale-carnegie-solution-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2822;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"dale-carnegie-solution-768x458.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:458;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11868;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10249,2421,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10250,2421,'_thumbnail_id','2418'),(10251,2421,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10252,2421,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10253,2421,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10254,2421,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10255,2421,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10256,2421,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10257,2421,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10258,2421,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10259,2421,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10260,2421,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10261,2421,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10262,2421,'client_name','Dale Carnegie'),(10263,2421,'client_logo','2419'),(10264,2421,'solution_image','2420'),(10265,2421,'solution_image_position','0'),(10266,2421,'client_intro','<p>Dale Carnegie has been providing professional development training for over 100 years.</p>\n<p>With their belief in the power of self-transformation, Dale Carnegie has been providing people everywhere with better professional and personal lives, resulting in millions of success stories.</p>\n<p>With over 2000 talented and compassionate employees, Dale Carnegie is committed to being a valuable resource for individuals and organizations alike.</p>'),(10267,2421,'challenge_title','Creating Sophisticated E-Learning At The Beginning Of The Pandemic'),(10268,2421,'challenge','<p>The Covid-19 pandemic threw everyone for a loop in 2020, including established organizations such as Dale Carnegie. The sudden shutdown of in-person events called for fast action on their part, and rapid development of supporting content for their professional development training.</p>\n<p>With widely recognized subject matter experts in different parts of the country, Dale Carnegie wanted these familiar faces as part of their new online leadership development videos. The target audience of these videos were managers and leaders at large companies, so they were looking to keep their high-quality, sophisticated look intact with these new leadership e-learning examples.</p>'),(10269,2421,'solution_title','A New Era in Professional Development Training: Modern, Credible, and Virtual'),(10270,2421,'solution','<p>Working to coordinate the different subject matter experts in various locations was key to preserving the client\'s credibility. We worked with these SMEs to coordinate filming, and were provided with the scripts so we could rapidly create the leadership development training videos combining the videos with minimalist icons, text, and stock footage. The result was a sophisticated leadership training video that aligned with their brand and message.</p>\n<p>The key to making this project a success was keeping Dale Carnegie\'s brand and message at the forefront, building on their existing and widely renowned curriculum. The final product used simple, minimalist icons and text to enhance the teachings of the experts that learners were already familiar with. Using additional stock footage to keep it eye-catching and interesting, these videos captured the essence of the client\'s legacy while ushering in a new, virtual era.</p>'),(10271,2421,'results_title','Leadership Development Videos For Industry-Leading Training Pros'),(10272,2421,'results','<p>This rapidly developed project was successful in helping Dale Carnegie continue their leadership training, and helped them create a virtual presence at a time when the whole world went virtual.</p>\n<p>The project demonstrated that sophisticated, brand-aligned eLearning could be developed rapidly without compromising quality — helping Dale Carnegie maintain their century-long reputation for excellence even through unprecedented disruption.</p>'),(10273,2421,'linked_project','2249'),(10274,2421,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10275,2421,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10276,2421,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10277,2422,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10278,2423,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1.webp'),(10279,2423,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1920;s:6:\"height\";i:1080;s:4:\"file\";s:106:\"2026/06/Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:58448;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:106:\"Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1-300x169.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:10386;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1-1024x576.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:39254;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:106:\"Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6378;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:106:\"Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_1-768x432.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:432;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:29280;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"