ngaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_2-768x1365.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:1365;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:69544;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_2-864x1536.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:864;s:6:\"height\";i:1536;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:79726;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10286,2425,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Case-Study-Engaging-Educational-Animation-Safety-Videos-for-the-American-Rental-Association_2.webp'),(10287,2422,'_thumbnail_id','2423'),(10288,2422,'client_name','American Rental Association'),(10289,2422,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10290,2422,'client_intro','<p>The American Rental Association (ARA) is the leading organization for the equipment and event rental industry. Their mission is to support rental businesses by providing resources, education, and advocacy through online training, certification programs, and safety materials designed to enhance the skills of rental professionals.</p>'),(10291,2422,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10292,2422,'client_logo','2424'),(10293,2422,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10294,2422,'challenge_title','The Need for Animated Educational Safety Videos'),(10295,2422,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10296,2422,'challenge','<ul>\n<li><strong>Safety Knowledge Gaps:</strong> Rental professionals regularly encounter hazardous equipment and high-risk environments, yet traditional training materials — PDFs, static slides — failed to reflect the realities of the job site.</li>\n<li><strong>Low Engagement Rates:</strong> Text-heavy training was routinely skipped or completed without genuine comprehension, leaving members unprepared for real-world scenarios.</li>\n<li><strong>Brand and Tone Requirements:</strong> ARA needed training that felt approachable and friendly, not intimidating — a careful balance when the subject matter is workplace safety.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalability Across Membership:</strong> With thousands of members spanning small independent shops to large national chains, content had to be universally relevant and easy to distribute.</li></ul>'),(10297,2422,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10298,2422,'challenge_columns','1'),(10299,2422,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10300,2422,'solution_title','How Ninja Tropic Delivered Modern eLearning Solutions'),(10301,2422,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10302,2422,'solution','<p><strong>Comic Book Animation Style:</strong> Ninja Tropic developed a signature comic book-inspired visual style — bold outlines, vibrant colors, and dynamic action panels — that immediately differentiated ARA\'s content and made safety information feel engaging rather than obligatory.</p>\n<p><strong>Subject Matter Expert Integration:</strong> The SME\'s likeness was illustrated and animated throughout the videos, and their voice was used for narration. This gave the content an authentic, peer-to-peer feel that resonated with rental professionals far more than generic stock footage.</p>\n<p><strong>Scenario-Based Storytelling:</strong> Every episode was built around real-world scenarios that rental professionals actually face — from forklift operation to event setup safety — grounding the training in practical, immediately applicable knowledge.</p>\n<p><strong>Platform-Agnostic Delivery:</strong> Videos were produced in formats compatible with ARA\'s LMS, mobile devices, and in-store display screens, ensuring maximum reach across the membership base.</p>'),(10303,2422,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10304,2422,'solution_columns','0'),(10305,2422,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10306,2422,'solution_image','2425'),(10307,2422,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10308,2422,'solution_image_position','0'),(10309,2422,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10310,2422,'results_title','The Results of ARA\'s Safety Video Initiative'),(10311,2422,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10312,2422,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Dramatically Higher Engagement:</strong> Completion rates surged compared to previous text-based materials, with members reporting they actually looked forward to the next episode in the series.</li>\n<li><strong>Member Satisfaction:</strong> Post-training surveys showed overwhelmingly positive responses — members appreciated the humor, the relatable scenarios, and the approachable tone.</li>\n<li><strong>Improved Safety Outcomes:</strong> The clear, actionable safety tips delivered in memorable visual formats translated directly into better on-site safety practices and awareness.</li>\n<li><strong>Reusable Asset Library:</strong> The distinctive style guide created for this project gave ARA a repeatable production template for future safety modules, reducing cost and time for subsequent videos.</li></ul>'),(10313,2422,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10314,2422,'results_columns','1'),(10315,2422,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10316,2422,'linked_project','2303'),(10317,2422,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10318,2422,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10319,2422,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10320,2422,'project_section_text',''),(10321,2422,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10322,2426,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10323,2427,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1.webp'),(10324,2427,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1920;s:6:\"height\";i:1080;s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"2026/06/Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:70328;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-300x169.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:13942;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:108:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-1024x576.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:52240;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7982;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:107:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-768x432.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:432;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:38628;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:108:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-1536x864.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1536;s:6:\"height\";i:864;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:78878;}s:14:\"post-thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:108:\"Case-Study-How-Ninja-Tropic-Modernized-HPNAs-Custom-eLearning-Courses-for-Measurable-Success_1-1200x675.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1200;s:6: