png'),(10420,2437,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1080;s:6:\"height\";i:1740;s:4:\"file\";s:48:\"2026/06/Why-is-customer-training-important-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:92342;s:5:\"sizes\";a:5:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:48:\"Why-is-customer-training-important-1-186x300.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:186;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:19823;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:49:\"Why-is-customer-training-important-1-636x1024.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:636;s:6:\"height\";i:1024;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:95456;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:48:\"Why-is-customer-training-important-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11764;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:49:\"Why-is-customer-training-important-1-768x1237.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:1237;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:120786;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:49:\"Why-is-customer-training-important-1-953x1536.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:953;s:6:\"height\";i:1536;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:156592;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10421,2437,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Why-is-customer-training-important-1.png'),(10422,2434,'_thumbnail_id','2435'),(10423,2434,'client_name','Lumere'),(10424,2434,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10425,2434,'client_intro','<p>Lumere is a leading healthcare technology company that needed to effectively train customers on how to use its complex platform and navigate its learning management system (LMS).</p>'),(10426,2434,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10427,2434,'client_logo','2436'),(10428,2434,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10429,2434,'challenge_title','The Challenge'),(10430,2434,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10431,2434,'challenge','<p>Lumere\'s platform gave healthcare organizations powerful tools for supply chain management and value analysis — but the technology\'s depth was also its adoption barrier. Customers were logging in without understanding the \"why\" behind core features, leading to underutilization, low retention, and support burden on the Lumere team.</p>\n<p>The company needed a training approach that went beyond step-by-step tutorials: one that built genuine product advocacy by helping users understand strategic value, not just button locations. The training also had to scale without requiring live instruction for every new customer cohort.</p>'),(10432,2434,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10433,2434,'challenge_columns','0'),(10434,2434,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10435,2434,'solution_title','The Solution'),(10436,2434,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10437,2434,'solution','<ul>\n<li><strong>Value-First Scripting:</strong> Every video began by establishing the business case — why this feature matters, what problem it solves — before demonstrating the how-to. This \"sell the why\" framework transformed passive viewers into motivated learners.</li>\n<li><strong>Screen Walkthroughs:</strong> Precise, annotated screen recordings guided users through the exact workflows they\'d encounter in their daily use, reducing friction between training and real-world application.</li>\n<li><strong>Motion Graphics Integration:</strong> Complex concepts like vendor benchmarking and cost variance analysis were visualized through clean motion graphics, making abstract data relationships immediately intuitive.</li>\n<li><strong>Professional Voiceover:</strong> A consistent, professional voice carried the series — building brand trust and maintaining learner focus without the distraction of inconsistent audio quality.</li>\n<li><strong>Competency Architecture:</strong> The series was structured to build knowledge progressively — foundational modules first, advanced workflows last — ensuring users developed genuine platform fluency rather than surface familiarity.</li></ul>'),(10438,2434,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10439,2434,'solution_columns','1'),(10440,2434,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10441,2434,'solution_image','2437'),(10442,2434,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10443,2434,'solution_image_position','0'),(10444,2434,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10445,2434,'results_title','The Results Speak for Themselves'),(10446,2434,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10447,2434,'results','<p>The training series fundamentally changed how Lumere onboarded and retained customers. Users who completed the video curriculum demonstrated measurably higher platform engagement, explored more features, and required fewer support interventions in the months following onboarding.</p>\n<p>By embedding the training directly into their customer success workflow, Lumere was able to scale onboarding without proportionally scaling headcount — a critical efficiency gain as the company grew its client base. The videos became a cornerstone asset of the Lumere customer journey.</p>'),(10448,2434,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10449,2434,'results_columns','0'),(10450,2434,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10451,2434,'linked_project','2328'),(10452,2434,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10453,2434,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10454,2434,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10455,2434,'project_section_text',''),(10456,2434,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10457,2438,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10458,2439,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1.webp'),(10459,2439,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:2560;s:6:\"height\";i:1440;s:4:\"file\";s:100:\"2026/06/Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:143336;s:5:\"sizes\";a:7:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:100:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-300x169.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14258;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:101:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-1024x576.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:54938;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:100:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7198;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:100:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-768x432.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:432;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:39936;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:101:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-1536x864.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1536;s:6:\"height\";i:864;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:84576;}s:9:\"2048x2048\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:102:\"Transforming-Digital-Learning-elearning-Video-Production-for-Primary-Education-scaled-1-2048x1152.webp\";s: