_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:2560;s:6:\"height\";i:1431;s:4:\"file\";s:69:\"2026/06/Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:73016;s:5:\"sizes\";a:7:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:69:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-300x168.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:168;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:5888;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:70:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-1024x572.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:572;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:24662;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:69:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3056;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:69:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-768x429.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:429;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:17810;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:70:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-1536x859.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1536;s:6:\"height\";i:859;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:39358;}s:9:\"2048x2048\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:71:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-2048x1145.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:2048;s:6:\"height\";i:1145;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:53926;}s:14:\"post-thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:70:\"Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled-1-1200x671.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1200;s:6:\"height\";i:671;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:29518;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10511,2445,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Scenario-Based-Learning-Modules-on-Social-Media-scaled.webp'),(10512,2442,'_thumbnail_id','2443'),(10513,2442,'client_name','Oceania Cruises'),(10514,2442,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10515,2442,'client_intro','<p>Oceania Cruises is a luxury cruise line known for exceptional service, exotic destinations, and unparalleled onboard experiences. They serve a predominantly 65+, wealthy, and highly educated demographic seeking enriching travel experiences.</p>'),(10516,2442,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10517,2442,'client_logo','2444'),(10518,2442,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10519,2442,'challenge_title','Setting Sail on Digital Enrichment'),(10520,2442,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10521,2442,'challenge','<p>Oceania Cruises\' guest demographic — predominantly affluent, highly educated travelers aged 65 and older — expected enrichment experiences that matched the sophistication of their destinations. Digital literacy varied widely: some guests were tech-savvy content creators, others had never used a smartphone for photography. Standard eLearning approaches built for corporate audiences would not resonate.</p>\n<p>The program also faced significant technical constraints: content had to function on 40 dedicated tablets running on each ship\'s closed local intranet, with no reliable internet connection at sea. The platform needed to support both self-directed learning and instructor-led classroom formats, while remaining simple enough for guests to navigate without assistance.</p>'),(10522,2442,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10523,2442,'challenge_columns','0'),(10524,2442,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10525,2442,'solution_title','Crafting an Immersive Learning Journey'),(10526,2442,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10527,2442,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic developed a complete curriculum architecture spanning four subject areas — social media, travel photography, and videography — at four proficiency levels from introductory to advanced. Each of the 24 courses contained six lessons, yielding 200 hours of original instructional content built entirely within Articulate Storyline.</p>\n<p>The production included original scripting, professional casting and filming of instructional segments, and the creation of simulated social media interfaces within the courseware — allowing guests to practice Instagram Stories, photo editing, and short-form video without leaving the course environment. The entire library was packaged for local intranet deployment with remote update capability, enabling content refreshes between voyages.</p>'),(10528,2442,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10529,2442,'solution_columns','0'),(10530,2442,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10531,2442,'solution_image','2445'),(10532,2442,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10533,2442,'solution_image_position','0'),(10534,2442,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10535,2442,'results_title','Achieving Uncharted Success'),(10536,2442,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10537,2442,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>200 Hours of Premium Content:</strong> A complete, branded digital enrichment library that positioned Oceania Cruises as a destination for intellectual as well as physical exploration.</li>\n<li><strong>Guest Experience Elevation:</strong> Post-voyage surveys reflected increased guest satisfaction with onboard programming, with the Digital Enrichment Academy cited as a standout amenity.</li>\n<li><strong>User-Generated Marketing:</strong> Guests who completed photography and social media courses shared dramatically more content online, creating an organic marketing channel at no additional cost to Oceania.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalable Cross-Fleet Deployment:</strong> The intranet-compatible format and remote update system allowed content to be refreshed and deployed across the entire fleet simultaneously.</li></ul>'),(10538,2442,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10539,2442,'results_columns','1'),(10540,2442,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10541,2442,'linked_project',''),(10542,2442,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10543,2442,'project_section_title',''),(10544,2442,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10545,2442,'project_section_text',''),(10546,2442,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10547,2446,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10548,2447,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Study-NYU-ILU-1-resized.webp'),(10549,2447,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:722;s:6:\"height\";i:506;s:4:\"file\";s:41:\"2026/06/Case-Study-NYU-ILU-1-resized.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:19920;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:41:\"Case-Study-NYU-ILU-1-resized-300x210.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:210;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:8028;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:41:\"Case-Study-NYU-ILU-1-resized-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4550;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10550,2447,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Case-Study-NYU-ILU-1-resized.webp'),(10551,2448,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Logo-resized.webp'),(10552,2448,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:468;s:6:\"height\";i:198;s:4:\"file\";s:25:\"2026/06/Logo-resized.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6588;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:25:\"Logo-resized-300x127.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:127;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7574;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:25:\"Logo-resized-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4530;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10553,2448,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Logo-resized.webp'),(10554,2449,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/NYU-project-Image1.webp'),(10555,2449,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:706;s:6:\"height\";i:397;s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"2026/06/NYU-project-Image1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:29078;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"NYU-project-Image1-300x169.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11074;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"NYU-project-Image1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:5358;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10556,2449,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/NYU-project-Image1.webp'),(10557,2446,'_thumbnail_id','2447'),(10558,2446,'client_name','NYU Langone Health'),(10559,2446,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10560,2446,'client_intro','<p>NYU Langone Health is a leader in medical research and patient care. They embarked on a groundbreaking project to demystify near-death experiences (NDEs) for patients who have undergone cardiac arrest, combining cutting-edge research with compassionate patient communication.</p>'),(10561,2446,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10562,2446,'client_logo','2448'),(10563,2446,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10564,2446,'challenge_title','Simplifying the Complex with Patient Education Videos'),(10565,2446,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10566,2446,'challenge','<p>Near-death experiences — the vivid perceptions reported by patients following cardiac arrest — sit at a uniquely difficult intersection of science, psychology, and personal belief. Patients who survive cardiac arrest often carry confusion, fear, or spiritual distress about what they experienced. Healthcare providers lacked standardized materials to help patients contextualize these experiences within a medical framework.</p>\n<p>NYU Langone needed educational content that was simultaneously grounded in Dr. Sam Parnia\'s peer-reviewed research, accessible to patients across a wide age and literacy range, and delivered in a tone that felt supportive rather than clinical or dismissive. The wrong approach — too cold, too simple, or too ambiguous — risked undermining patient trust at a vulnerable moment in their recovery.</p>'),(10567,2446,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10568,2446,'challenge_columns','0'),(10569,2446,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10570,2446,'solution_title','Ninja Tropic\'s Approach: A Fusion of Science and Sensitivity'),(10571,2446,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10572,2446,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic developed a custom animation language built specifically for this project — soft watercolor-adjacent palettes, gentle motion, and abstract visual metaphors that gave complex neuroscientific concepts a warm, approachable quality. The visual style was deliberately non-clinical, avoiding the cold palette and sharp lines typical of medical animation.</p>\n<p>The content was structured as a microlearning series, with each module covering a discrete aspect of the NDE experience: what happens physiologically during cardiac arrest, why the brain generates certain types of perceptions, and how these experiences are documented and understood within medical science. Narration was written with the patient — not the clinician — as the primary audience, using plain language validated for accessibility across educational levels.</p>'),(10573,2446,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10574,2446,'solution_columns','0'),(10575,2446,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10576,2446,'solution_image','2449'),(10577,2446,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10578,2446,'solution_image_position','0'),(10579,2446,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10580,2446,'results_title','The Outcome: Empowering Patients with Knowledge'),(10581,2446,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10582,2446,'results','<p>Healthcare providers at NYU Langone reported a meaningful shift in how post-cardiac-arrest conversations unfolded. Patients who had watched the educational series arrived at follow-up appointments with better-formed questions, lower levels of distress, and a more grounded understanding of their experience. Providers noted that the videos effectively completed the educational groundwork that would otherwise consume significant clinical consultation time.</p>\n<p>The series has since been incorporated into NYU Langone\'s standard post-cardiac-arrest patient care pathway, reaching new patients on an ongoing basis and serving as a model for how complex medical experiences can be communicated with both scientific integrity and human sensitivity.</p>'),(10583,2446,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10584,2446,'results_columns','0'),(10585,2446,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10586,2446,'linked_project','2137'),(10587,2446,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10588,2446,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10589,2446,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10590,2446,'project_section_text',''),(10591,2446,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10592,2450,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10593,2451,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform.webp'),(10594,2451,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1089;s:6:\"height\";i:827;s:4:\"file\";s:73:\"2026/06/Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:52904;s:5:\"sizes\";a:4:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:73:\"Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform-300x228.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:228;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14848;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:74:\"Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform-1024x778.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:778;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:54724;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:73:\"Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7736;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:73:\"Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform-768x583.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:583;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:41242;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10595,2451,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Elevating-Cybersecurity-Training-Best-microlearning-platform.webp'),(10596,2452,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Study-Drip-7.webp'),(10597,2452,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:706;s:6:\"height\";i:397;s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"2026/06/Case-Study-Drip-7.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:422022;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"Case-Study-Drip-7-300x169.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:57860;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"Case-Study-Drip-7-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:26988;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10598,2452,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Case-Study-Drip-7.webp'),(10599,2450,'_thumbnail_id','2451'),(10600,2450,'client_name','Drip7'),(10601,2450,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10602,2450,'client_intro','<p>Drip7 is renowned for its innovative approach to compliance training and cybersecurity education, delivering user-friendly experiences through diverse content mediums including videos, text, and quizzes.</p>'),(10603,2450,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10604,2450,'client_logo',''),(10605,2450,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10606,2450,'challenge_title','Scaling Cybersecurity Training: Animation Production'),(10607,2450,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10608,2450,'challenge','<p>Cybersecurity training has a chronic engagement problem. Employees know they should care about phishing, password hygiene, and social engineering — but mandatory annual trainings delivered through dry slides and robotic narration produce compliance without comprehension. Drip7 had built a platform specifically designed to counteract this pattern through daily micro-doses of security content, but needed an animation production partner who could match their innovative delivery model with equally innovative visual content.</p>\n<p>The challenge was threefold: create animation at volume without sacrificing quality; develop a consistent visual style that could be executed by multiple illustrators simultaneously; and make genuinely important security concepts feel worth the learner\'s attention.</p>'),(10609,2450,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10610,2450,'challenge_columns','0'),(10611,2450,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10612,2450,'solution_title','Educational Animation and Strategic Partnership'),(10613,2450,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10614,2450,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic worked with Drip7 to develop a comprehensive visual style guide — the foundation of the entire production system. The guide defined character types, color systems, motion principles, and scenario archetypes, enabling multiple animation teams to produce content that felt cohesive regardless of who created it. This infrastructure investment paid dividends as production volume scaled.</p>\n<p>The content strategy centered on scenario-based storytelling: every video placed a relatable character in a realistic cybersecurity situation — a phishing email that looked almost legitimate, a colleague asking for a password \"just this once,\" a USB drive found in the parking lot. This approach created emotional investment and decision-making practice rather than passive information consumption.</p>'),(10615,2450,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10616,2450,'solution_columns','0'),(10617,2450,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10618,2450,'solution_image','2452'),(10619,2450,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10620,2450,'solution_image_position','0'),(10621,2450,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10622,2450,'results_title','The Impact of Engaging Cybersecurity Education'),(10623,2450,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10624,2450,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Scalable Production System:</strong> The style guide and production infrastructure enabled Drip7 to commission new content at consistent quality — something that had previously been impossible without rebuilding the visual system from scratch each time.</li>\n<li><strong>Industry Benchmark:</strong> The animation series set a new production standard for cybersecurity microlearning — referenced by Drip7 in sales conversations as a differentiator from text-heavy competitor platforms.</li>\n<li><strong>Measurable Behavior Change:</strong> Phishing simulation click rates among organizations using the Drip7 platform with Ninja Tropic-produced content declined significantly over training cycles, demonstrating that engagement translated into actual security behavior improvement.</li></ul>'),(10625,2450,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10626,2450,'results_columns','1'),(10627,2450,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10628,2450,'linked_project','2027'),(10629,2450,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10630,2450,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10631,2450,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10632,2450,'project_section_text',''),(10633,2450,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10634,2453,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10635,2454,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp.webp'),(10636,2454,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:780;s:6:\"height\";i:627;s:4:\"file\";s:102:\"2026/06/Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:56794;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:102:\"Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp-300x241.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:241;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:23984;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:102:\"Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:11502;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:102:\"Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp-768x617.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:617;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:65746;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10637,2454,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Simplifying-Benefits-Selection-with-Animated-Educational-Videos-The-Picwell-Solution_webp.webp'),(10638,2455,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/LOGO-big.webp'),(10639,2455,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:731;s:6:\"height\";i:236;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/LOGO-big.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7420;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:20:\"LOGO-big-300x97.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:97;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:5418;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"LOGO-big-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3228;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10640,2455,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/LOGO-big.webp'),(10641,2456,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp.webp'),(10642,2456,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1028;s:6:\"height\";i:456;s:4:\"file\";s:60:\"2026/06/Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:37624;s:5:\"sizes\";a:4:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:60:\"Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp-300x133.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:133;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:10528;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:61:\"Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp-1024x454.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:454;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:40990;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:60:\"Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3674;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:60:\"Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp-768x341.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:341;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:30526;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10643,2456,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Core-Product-Enhancement-and-Sales-Support_webp.webp'),(10644,2453,'_thumbnail_id','2454'),(10645,2453,'client_name','Picwell'),(10646,2453,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10647,2453,'client_intro','<p>Picwell is a visionary platform that simplifies the benefits selection process for consumers, carriers, marketplaces, exchanges, and agents. The company leverages advanced algorithms and data analysis to help consumers navigate health plan options while delivering cost savings and operational efficiencies for businesses and employers.</p>'),(10648,2453,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10649,2453,'client_logo','2455'),(10650,2453,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10651,2453,'challenge_title','Enhancing Product Understanding Through Educational Animation'),(10652,2453,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10653,2453,'challenge','<p>Benefits selection is one of the most consequential — and most confusing — decisions most employees make each year. The cost of getting it wrong is real: overpaying for unnecessary coverage, missing critical protections, or simply defaulting to last year\'s choices without understanding the implications. Picwell\'s algorithm was designed to solve this problem, but the platform\'s sophistication created its own communication challenge: how do you help users trust a recommendation engine they don\'t fully understand?</p>\n<p>Text-based onboarding and static help documentation weren\'t building that trust. Picwell needed video content that could explain both what the platform does and why its recommendations are reliable — content that would work across employer portals, benefits fairs, and direct-to-consumer channels in multiple languages.</p>'),(10654,2453,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10655,2453,'challenge_columns','0'),(10656,2453,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10657,2453,'solution_title','Video Learning Solution: Leading Animated Training'),(10658,2453,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10659,2453,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic developed a bilingual animated video series — available in both English and Spanish — that visualized the Picwell experience rather than describing it. Each video combined Picwell\'s existing scripts with custom-built storyboards, original character design, and sophisticated motion graphics built to match the platform\'s clean, professional aesthetic.</p>\n<p>The production emphasized relatability: characters were designed to represent Picwell\'s diverse user base, and the scenarios depicted — open enrollment confusion, comparison paralysis, fear of choosing wrong — were grounded in the real emotional experience of benefits selection. The result was content that made users feel understood before making them feel informed.</p>'),(10660,2453,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10661,2453,'solution_columns','0'),(10662,2453,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10663,2453,'solution_image','2456'),(10664,2453,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10665,2453,'solution_image_position','0'),(10666,2453,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10667,2453,'results_title','Impact: A Win-Win for Picwell and Its Stakeholders'),(10668,2453,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10669,2453,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Product Integration:</strong> The videos became embedded components of the Picwell platform itself — playing during onboarding flows to orient new users before they made any decisions.</li>\n<li><strong>Sales Enablement:</strong> Picwell\'s sales team used the videos in prospect demonstrations, reducing the explanation burden and shortening enterprise sales cycles by giving buyers an immediate, clear sense of the user experience.</li>\n<li><strong>Bilingual Reach:</strong> The Spanish-language versions expanded Picwell\'s accessible market, enabling employers with multilingual workforces to offer a fully localized benefits guidance experience.</li>\n<li><strong>Improved Decision Confidence:</strong> User research indicated that employees who watched the introductory video series reported significantly higher confidence in their benefits selections — the core outcome Picwell\'s entire product was designed to achieve.</li></ul>'),(10670,2453,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10671,2453,'results_columns','1'),(10672,2453,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10673,2453,'linked_project','2077'),(10674,2453,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10675,2453,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10676,2453,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10677,2453,'project_section_text',''),(10678,2453,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10679,2457,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10680,2458,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Wonderful.webp'),(10681,2458,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:707;s:6:\"height\";i:666;s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"2026/06/Wonderful.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:27982;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"Wonderful-300x283.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:283;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:9612;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"Wonderful-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4836;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10682,2458,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Wonderful.webp'),(10683,2459,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/wonderful-1-1-1.png'),(10684,2459,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:690;s:6:\"height\";i:440;s:4:\"file\";s:27:\"2026/06/wonderful-1-1-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:50015;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:27:\"wonderful-1-1-1-300x191.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:191;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22936;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:27:\"wonderful-1-1-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:12655;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10685,2459,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wonderful-1-1-1.png'),(10686,2457,'_thumbnail_id','2458'),(10687,2457,'client_name','The Wonderful Company'),(10688,2457,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10689,2457,'client_intro','<p>The Wonderful Company is an organic food company well-known for their almonds and pistachios. With a diverse, multilingual workforce, they place a strong emphasis on safety in planting, harvesting, and product preparation.</p>'),(10690,2457,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10691,2457,'client_logo',''),(10692,2457,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10693,2457,'challenge_title','The Problem'),(10694,2457,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10695,2457,'challenge','<p>The Wonderful Company operates large-scale agricultural operations with a diverse, predominantly Spanish-speaking workforce. Safety training needed to be fully bilingual — not translated as an afterthought, but designed from the ground up as a dual-language experience where Spanish-speaking employees felt equally prioritized, not accommodated.</p>\n<p>The equipment used across Wonderful\'s operations — specialized harvesting machinery, packaging systems, storage infrastructure — is expensive, proprietary, and difficult to film safely under normal working conditions. Traditional training approaches would have required either on-site filming with live equipment (a safety risk in itself) or generic stock footage that bore no resemblance to the actual work environment.</p>'),(10696,2457,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10697,2457,'challenge_columns','0'),(10698,2457,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10699,2457,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(10700,2457,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10701,2457,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic created a library of character-led animated videos where each character, scenario, and piece of equipment was illustrated specifically for Wonderful\'s operations. The 3D-style illustrations accurately depicted proprietary machinery without the cost or risk of live filming, giving employees a realistic visual reference for the equipment they operate daily.</p>\n<p>The bilingual production strategy treated English and Spanish as equal primary languages — not a translation of one into the other. Voice talent, on-screen text, and subtitle timing were developed in parallel, ensuring that both language versions delivered the same instructional quality and cultural resonance.</p>'),(10702,2457,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10703,2457,'solution_columns','0'),(10704,2457,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10705,2457,'solution_image','2459'),(10706,2457,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10707,2457,'solution_image_position','0'),(10708,2457,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10709,2457,'results_title','The Result'),(10710,2457,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10711,2457,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>6,000+ Employees Trained:</strong> The animated library reached Wonderful\'s entire operations workforce across multiple facilities in English and Spanish, establishing a consistent safety standard across the organization.</li>\n<li><strong>Higher Completion Rates:</strong> The animated format and dual-language accessibility drove completion rates substantially above previous text-based training benchmarks.</li>\n<li><strong>Reduced Equipment Risk:</strong> By providing visually accurate, equipment-specific safety guidance, the training reduced the gap between what employees learned in training and what they encountered on the job — a critical factor in preventing accidents.</li></ul>'),(10712,2457,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10713,2457,'results_columns','1'),(10714,2457,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10715,2457,'linked_project','2301'),(10716,2457,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10717,2457,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10718,2457,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10719,2457,'project_section_text',''),(10720,2457,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10721,2460,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10722,2461,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/FIG_1-1-4.png'),(10723,2461,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:671;s:6:\"height\";i:453;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/FIG_1-1-4.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22293;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-4-300x203.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:203;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14346;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-4-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:9554;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10724,2461,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/FIG_1-1-4.png'),(10725,2462,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/TNC_M1-1-1-3.png');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (10726,2462,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:878;s:6:\"height\";i:524;s:4:\"file\";s:24:\"2026/06/TNC_M1-1-1-3.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:338396;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:24:\"TNC_M1-1-1-3-300x179.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:179;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:59571;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:24:\"TNC_M1-1-1-3-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:31091;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:24:\"TNC_M1-1-1-3-768x458.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:458;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:268777;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10727,2462,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/TNC_M1-1-1-3.png'),(10728,2460,'_thumbnail_id','2461'),(10729,2460,'client_name','Oldcastle Infrastructure'),(10730,2460,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10731,2460,'client_intro','<p>Oldcastle Infrastructure is a leading building products company focused on improving operational processes across their production facilities. With complex manufacturing environments, effective employee training is critical to safety and performance.</p>'),(10732,2460,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10733,2460,'client_logo',''),(10734,2460,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10735,2460,'challenge_title','Communicating Complex Processes Effectively'),(10736,2460,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10737,2460,'challenge','<p>Oldcastle Infrastructure needed to train production line employees on a newly implemented manufacturing process — but the complexity of the workflow made it nearly impossible to convey through conventional means. Slide decks couldn\'t capture the spatial relationships between machine components. Written instructions left too much room for misinterpretation. And scheduling a film crew for on-site recording would have disrupted active production operations and exposed sensitive proprietary processes.</p>\n<p>The training also needed to be accessible on demand — not delivered in a single classroom session, but available for employees to review before, during, and after the process went live on the floor.</p>'),(10738,2460,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10739,2460,'challenge_columns','0'),(10740,2460,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10741,2460,'solution_title','3D Animated Training Video'),(10742,2460,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10743,2460,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic created a photorealistic 3D animated training video that reconstructed Oldcastle\'s production environment in digital space. Every piece of machinery, every workflow stage, and every safety checkpoint was modeled and animated to match the actual plant layout — giving employees a virtual walkthrough of the process before encountering it in person.</p>\n<p>The 3D format offered capabilities impossible with live video: the camera could pass through machine housing to show internal mechanisms, operators could be shown from multiple simultaneous angles, and unsafe practices could be demonstrated and corrected without anyone actually performing them. The video was delivered as a standalone file accessible on floor tablets and break room screens.</p>'),(10744,2460,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10745,2460,'solution_columns','0'),(10746,2460,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10747,2460,'solution_image','2462'),(10748,2460,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10749,2460,'solution_image_position','0'),(10750,2460,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10751,2460,'results_title','Successful Implementation and Expansion'),(10752,2460,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10753,2460,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Process Adoption Accelerated:</strong> Employees who watched the 3D training demonstrated significantly faster uptake of the new process, with fewer procedural errors during the first weeks of implementation.</li>\n<li><strong>Cost Avoidance:</strong> The 3D animation approach cost a fraction of what a live film production would have required — and delivered a more accurate, more flexible training asset that live footage couldn\'t have matched.</li>\n<li><strong>Partnership Expansion:</strong> Oldcastle was so satisfied with the results that they commissioned additional 3D training videos for other processes, establishing Ninja Tropic as their go-to production partner for complex operational training.</li></ul>'),(10754,2460,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10755,2460,'results_columns','1'),(10756,2460,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10757,2460,'linked_project','2334'),(10758,2460,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10759,2460,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10760,2460,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10761,2460,'project_section_text',''),(10762,2460,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10763,2463,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10764,2464,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/FIG_1-1-2.png'),(10765,2464,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:630;s:6:\"height\";i:511;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/FIG_1-1-2.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:48322;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-2-300x243.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:243;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:24871;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-2-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:13090;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10766,2464,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/FIG_1-1-2.png'),(10767,2465,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-2.png'),(10768,2465,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:690;s:6:\"height\";i:396;s:4:\"file\";s:32:\"2026/06/INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-2.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:162633;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:32:\"INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-2-300x172.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:172;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:44461;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:32:\"INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-2-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22843;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10769,2465,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-2.png'),(10770,2463,'_thumbnail_id','2464'),(10771,2463,'client_name','Indiana University'),(10772,2463,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10773,2463,'client_intro','<p>Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi of Indiana University sought innovative learning solutions to advance medical education through interactive game-based experiences, aiming to improve clinical safety and patient outcomes.</p>'),(10774,2463,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10775,2463,'client_logo','2465'),(10776,2463,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10777,2463,'challenge_title','The Challenge'),(10778,2463,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10779,2463,'challenge','<p>Central line infections are a leading cause of preventable death in ICU settings. Dr. Yabrodi identified a fundamental gap in how medical students were trained on central line insertion and maintenance: the procedure was taught through observation and limited supervised practice, with no mechanism for students to learn from mistakes without risking patient harm.</p>\n<p>He envisioned a Unity-based simulation game that would allow students to practice the procedure in a consequence-free digital environment — but building a medically accurate, clinically credible interactive simulation required both deep clinical knowledge and advanced game development and animation capabilities that most vendors couldn\'t combine.</p>'),(10780,2463,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10781,2463,'challenge_columns','0'),(10782,2463,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10783,2463,'solution_title','The Solution'),(10784,2463,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10785,2463,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic built a fully interactive ICU simulation environment using a combination of 2D illustration, layered animation, and frame-by-frame character motion rigged for Unity integration. Every step of the central line procedure was animated in precise clinical detail, based on medical literature review and consultation with clinical subject matter experts.</p>\n<p>The simulation was designed as a decision-tree experience: students make choices at each procedural step, and the game responds with realistic consequences — correct technique is reinforced, errors trigger feedback that explains what went wrong and why. All animation assets were delivered as Unity-compatible files, enabling Dr. Yabrodi\'s team to integrate the visual components into the interactive game logic.</p>'),(10786,2463,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10787,2463,'solution_columns','0'),(10788,2463,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10789,2463,'solution_image',''),(10790,2463,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10791,2463,'solution_image_position','0'),(10792,2463,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10793,2463,'results_title','The Result'),(10794,2463,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10795,2463,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Clinically Validated Learning:</strong> The simulation gave medical students the ability to practice a high-stakes procedure dozens of times before performing it on a patient — a fundamentally different learning model from observation-only training.</li>\n<li><strong>Error-Based Learning:</strong> By allowing students to make and learn from mistakes in a zero-risk environment, the simulation developed procedural intuition that lecture-based training cannot replicate.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalable Medical Education:</strong> The simulation can be deployed to any student with a computer, eliminating the scheduling and resource constraints of simulation lab access and making high-quality procedural training available on demand.</li></ul>'),(10796,2463,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10797,2463,'results_columns','1'),(10798,2463,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10799,2463,'linked_project','2275'),(10800,2463,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10801,2463,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10802,2463,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10803,2463,'project_section_text',''),(10804,2463,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10805,2466,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10806,2467,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Studies_Autodesk-1.png'),(10807,2467,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:681;s:6:\"height\";i:650;s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"2026/06/Case-Studies_Autodesk-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:85265;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"Case-Studies_Autodesk-1-300x286.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:286;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:42232;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"Case-Studies_Autodesk-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:16828;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10808,2467,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Case-Studies_Autodesk-1.png'),(10809,2468,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/autodesk-logo-primary-rgb-black-1.png'),(10810,2468,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:632;s:6:\"height\";i:383;s:4:\"file\";s:45:\"2026/06/autodesk-logo-primary-rgb-black-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:8572;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:45:\"autodesk-logo-primary-rgb-black-1-300x182.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:182;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:6052;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:45:\"autodesk-logo-primary-rgb-black-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3545;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10811,2468,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/autodesk-logo-primary-rgb-black-1.png'),(10812,2469,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769.png'),(10813,2469,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:872;s:6:\"height\";i:498;s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"2026/06/AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:224065;s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769-300x171.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:171;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:32658;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:18053;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769-768x439.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:439;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:177274;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10814,2469,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/AUTODESK-2-e1661961625769.png'),(10815,2466,'_thumbnail_id','2467'),(10816,2466,'client_name','Autodesk'),(10817,2466,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10818,2466,'client_intro','<p>Autodesk is famous for creating intuitive software programs that allow users to animate in 2D, create 3D renders, and paint realistically on a computer. Their suite of tools is used by professionals across architecture, engineering, media, and entertainment worldwide.</p>'),(10819,2466,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10820,2466,'client_logo','2468'),(10821,2466,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10822,2466,'challenge_title','The Problem'),(10823,2466,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10824,2466,'challenge','<p>Autodesk\'s sales force is responsible for communicating the value of highly technical software to buyers who range from individual architects to enterprise engineering teams. Salespeople aren\'t engineers — they don\'t have months to develop deep product expertise. They need to quickly absorb the core value proposition of each product, understand key use cases, and communicate benefits with confidence and credibility.</p>\n<p>Generic product documentation and spec sheets weren\'t building that sales readiness. Autodesk needed a video series that could convey product understanding in engaging, memorable formats that salespeople would actually watch — and retain.</p>'),(10825,2466,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10826,2466,'challenge_columns','0'),(10827,2466,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10828,2466,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(10829,2466,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10830,2466,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic developed a series of 2D character animation videos built around Autodesk\'s brand color system and visual identity. Each video introduced a specific product through a narrative structure: a character facing a design or engineering challenge, discovering how the Autodesk tool solved it, and demonstrating key features in action through screen-share integration.</p>\n<p>The animation style was deliberately approachable and energetic — designed to hold attention in the same way consumer marketing content does, rather than the dry instructional tone typical of corporate software training. Motion graphics highlighted key selling points, and each video concluded with a clear, memorable value statement salespeople could use directly in prospect conversations.</p>'),(10831,2466,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10832,2466,'solution_columns','0'),(10833,2466,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10834,2466,'solution_image','2469'),(10835,2466,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10836,2466,'solution_image_position','0'),(10837,2466,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10838,2466,'results_title','The Result'),(10839,2466,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10840,2466,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Faster Sales Ramp:</strong> New sales hires completed product training faster and demonstrated stronger product knowledge in early customer calls — a direct outcome of the engaging video format versus documentation-heavy onboarding.</li>\n<li><strong>Consistent Messaging:</strong> The video series established a unified product narrative across the sales organization, reducing the variability in how different reps described the same product.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalable Library:</strong> The modular production approach allowed Autodesk to commission new product videos and update existing ones as the software evolved, maintaining a current training library without starting from scratch.</li></ul>'),(10841,2466,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10842,2466,'results_columns','1'),(10843,2466,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10844,2466,'linked_project','2309'),(10845,2466,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10846,2466,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10847,2466,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10848,2466,'project_section_text',''),(10849,2466,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10850,2470,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10851,2471,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/FIG_1-1-1.png'),(10852,2471,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:681;s:6:\"height\";i:474;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/FIG_1-1-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:66741;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-1-300x209.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:209;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:28217;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:14366;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10853,2471,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/FIG_1-1-1.png'),(10854,2472,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/PORTA_Johns-Hopkins-University-1.png'),(10855,2472,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:580;s:6:\"height\";i:676;s:4:\"file\";s:44:\"2026/06/PORTA_Johns-Hopkins-University-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:152851;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:44:\"PORTA_Johns-Hopkins-University-1-257x300.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:257;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:46360;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:44:\"PORTA_Johns-Hopkins-University-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:19532;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10856,2472,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/PORTA_Johns-Hopkins-University-1.png'),(10857,2470,'_thumbnail_id','2471'),(10858,2470,'client_name','Johns Hopkins University'),(10859,2470,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10860,2470,'client_intro','<p>Johns Hopkins is a private university founded in 1876 in Baltimore, Maryland. Their mission is to provide lifelong learning, research, and knowledge for the world. As the first research university in the United States, they continue to set the standard for medical education and innovation.</p>'),(10861,2470,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10862,2470,'client_logo',''),(10863,2470,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10864,2470,'challenge_title','Providing Scenario Simulations for Clinicians in an eLearning Environment'),(10865,2470,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10866,2470,'challenge','<p>Extreme Risk Protection Orders (ERPOs) give healthcare providers a legal mechanism to petition for firearm removal from patients who present a danger to themselves or others — a powerful tool in addressing gun violence. But many clinicians lacked the practical training to identify when an ERPO was appropriate, how to initiate the conversation with a patient or family, and how to navigate the legal and ethical complexities of the process.</p>\n<p>In-person simulation training — the gold standard for developing clinical communication skills — became impossible during the COVID-19 pandemic. Johns Hopkins needed a way to give clinicians realistic counseling practice through an online medium, without sacrificing the scenario complexity and emotional realism that makes simulation effective.</p>'),(10867,2470,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10868,2470,'challenge_columns','0'),(10869,2470,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10870,2470,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(10871,2470,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10872,2470,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic created a library of animated scenario simulations depicting realistic clinical encounters — a patient in crisis, a family member in denial, a colleague seeking guidance. Each scenario was developed with Johns Hopkins\' clinical team to ensure accurate representation of ERPO conversations, including the legal nuances and the emotional dynamics that clinicians encounter in real practice.</p>\n<p>The animations depicted both clinician and patient with enough specificity to feel realistic without losing the universality needed for broad clinical audiences. Clinicians could watch multiple response paths — seeing how different approaches played out — building both knowledge and communication intuition through repeated exposure to varied scenarios.</p>'),(10873,2470,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10874,2470,'solution_columns','0'),(10875,2470,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10876,2470,'solution_image','2472'),(10877,2470,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10878,2470,'solution_image_position','0'),(10879,2470,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10880,2470,'results_title','On-Demand Microlearning for Busy Healthcare Professionals'),(10881,2470,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10882,2470,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Pandemic-Proof Training Delivery:</strong> By translating simulation training into animated format, Johns Hopkins maintained clinical development continuity during a period when in-person training was entirely unavailable.</li>\n<li><strong>Broader Reach:</strong> The on-demand format allowed the ERPO training to reach clinicians at affiliated hospitals and partner institutions beyond the Johns Hopkins campus, multiplying the program\'s public health impact.</li>\n<li><strong>Communication Skill Development:</strong> Clinicians who completed the training reported greater confidence in initiating ERPO conversations, particularly in navigating family resistance and patient ambivalence — the scenarios most likely to prevent successful intervention.</li></ul>'),(10883,2470,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10884,2470,'results_columns','1'),(10885,2470,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10886,2470,'linked_project','2292'),(10887,2470,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10888,2470,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10889,2470,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10890,2470,'project_section_text',''),(10891,2470,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10892,2473,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10893,2474,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Studies_Engagedly-1.webp'),(10894,2474,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1520;s:6:\"height\";i:1049;s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"2026/06/Case-Studies_Engagedly-1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:30444;s:5:\"sizes\";a:5:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"Case-Studies_Engagedly-1-300x207.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:207;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7180;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:38:\"Case-Studies_Engagedly-1-1024x707.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:707;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:28944;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"Case-Studies_Engagedly-1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4426;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:37:\"Case-Studies_Engagedly-1-768x530.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:530;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:20986;}s:14:\"post-thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:38:\"Case-Studies_Engagedly-1-1200x828.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:1200;s:6:\"height\";i:828;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:34562;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10895,2474,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Case-Studies_Engagedly-1.webp'),(10896,2475,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/engagedly-logo.png'),(10897,2475,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:336;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:4:\"file\";s:26:\"2026/06/engagedly-logo.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3857;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:26:\"engagedly-logo-300x134.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:134;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4885;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:26:\"engagedly-logo-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2226;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10898,2475,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/engagedly-logo.png'),(10899,2476,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1.jpg'),(10900,2476,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:2560;s:6:\"height\";i:1440;s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"2026/06/ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:83599;s:5:\"sizes\";a:7:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-300x169.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:4241;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-1024x576.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:26305;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2699;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-768x432.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:432;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:17748;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-1536x864.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1536;s:6:\"height\";i:864;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:46647;}s:9:\"2048x2048\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:32:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-2048x1152.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:2048;s:6:\"height\";i:1152;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:69127;}s:14:\"post-thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:31:\"ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1-1200x675.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1200;s:6:\"height\";i:675;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:33542;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10901,2476,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/ENGAGEDLY-scaled-1.jpg'),(10902,2473,'_thumbnail_id','2474'),(10903,2473,'client_name','Engagedly'),(10904,2473,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10905,2473,'client_intro','<p>Engagedly is a tech company specializing in performance management software, offering solutions from strategic goal tracking to succession planning. Their platform helps organizations build stronger cultures through continuous feedback and development.</p>'),(10906,2473,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10907,2473,'client_logo','2475'),(10908,2473,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10909,2473,'challenge_title','The Problem'),(10910,2473,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10911,2473,'challenge','<p>Mentorship programs are one of the most consistently high-impact talent development investments organizations can make — but implementation rates remain low because HR teams and managers often don\'t know where to start. Engagedly had built mentorship functionality into their performance management platform, but needed content that would help customers understand the practice of mentorship before they could effectively use the tools.</p>\n<p>The challenge was creating content sophisticated enough to earn the attention of senior HR professionals and people leaders, while remaining actionable enough to actually change how they ran their mentorship programs.</p>'),(10912,2473,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10913,2473,'challenge_columns','0'),(10914,2473,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10915,2473,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(10916,2473,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10917,2473,'solution','<p>The production process began with instructional design — working with Engagedly\'s subject matter experts to structure a mentorship curriculum that built progressively, from foundational principles to advanced implementation tactics. Ninja Tropic then produced a live-action filming day where expert hosts delivered the core curriculum content, which was subsequently enriched with animated overlays, motion graphics, and visual frameworks that transformed talking-head segments into visually engaging learning experiences.</p>\n<p>Each video was designed to function both as standalone learning content and as a gateway into Engagedly\'s platform features — naturally bridging from conceptual understanding to practical application within the tool.</p>'),(10918,2473,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10919,2473,'solution_columns','0'),(10920,2473,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10921,2473,'solution_image','2476'),(10922,2473,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10923,2473,'solution_image_position','0'),(10924,2473,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10925,2473,'results_title','The Result'),(10926,2473,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10927,2473,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Subscriber Content Library:</strong> The completed video series became a premium content asset available to all Engagedly subscribers, increasing the platform\'s perceived value and reducing churn among accounts that engaged with the educational content.</li>\n<li><strong>Thought Leadership Positioning:</strong> The high-production-quality series established Engagedly as a genuine authority on mentorship practice — not just a software vendor — a positioning that supported enterprise sales conversations.</li>\n<li><strong>Program Adoption:</strong> Customers who consumed the training content demonstrated significantly higher rates of activating and sustaining mentorship programs within the Engagedly platform.</li></ul>'),(10928,2473,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10929,2473,'results_columns','1'),(10930,2473,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10931,2473,'linked_project','2251'),(10932,2473,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10933,2473,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(10934,2473,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10935,2473,'project_section_text',''),(10936,2473,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10937,2477,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10938,2478,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/FIG_1-1-3.png'),(10939,2478,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:630;s:6:\"height\";i:439;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/FIG_1-1-3.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:239534;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-3-300x209.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:209;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:63897;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-3-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:32284;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10940,2478,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/FIG_1-1-3.png'),(10941,2477,'_thumbnail_id','2478'),(10942,2477,'client_name','ClinicoPath'),(10943,2477,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10944,2477,'client_intro','<p>Philip Tisdall, MD, is an award-winning teacher and published author who trained at the Mayo Clinic and is a diplomat of the American Board of Pathology. He serves as CEO of the ClinicoPath Group, providing pathology education to medical professionals worldwide.</p>'),(10945,2477,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10946,2477,'client_logo',''),(10947,2477,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10948,2477,'challenge_title','The Challenge'),(10949,2477,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10950,2477,'challenge','<p>Dr. Tisdall had decades of pathology expertise captured in lecture format — but converting that expertise into a scalable online education platform required a production approach that could keep pace with his curriculum output. Traditional agencies quoted timelines and budgets that would have made the project economically unviable. Freelance marketplaces couldn\'t guarantee the consistency and process discipline needed to maintain quality across hundreds of hours of content.</p>\n<p>The core technical challenge was creating the visual effect of real-time whiteboard writing — letters, diagrams, and annotations appearing as if drawn by hand in sync with the lecture narration — without requiring Dr. Tisdall to film in real time. The experience needed to feel live and dynamic, not pre-recorded and static.</p>'),(10951,2477,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10952,2477,'challenge_columns','0'),(10953,2477,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10954,2477,'solution_title','Tools and Process'),(10955,2477,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10956,2477,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic developed a proprietary whiteboard animation process specifically for this project. Dr. Tisdall\'s existing screencast recordings became the source material; the production team converted his digital whiteboard sessions into professionally animated sequences using calligraphic fonts with letter-by-letter opacity animations, custom-drawn diagrams replicated in Photoshop, and frame-by-frame timing synced precisely to the narration in After Effects.</p>\n<p>A dedicated two-person production team and account manager were assigned exclusively to the ClinicoPath account, creating a reliable production cadence that treated each month\'s lecture content as a structured production sprint rather than a series of individual projects.</p>'),(10957,2477,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10958,2477,'solution_columns','0'),(10959,2477,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10960,2477,'solution_image',''),(10961,2477,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(10962,2477,'solution_image_position','0'),(10963,2477,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(10964,2477,'results_title','The Result'),(10965,2477,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(10966,2477,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>220 Minutes Per Month:</strong> The dedicated production system delivers 220+ minutes of finished, professional-quality pathology education monthly — a production volume that no traditional agency model could sustain at this price point.</li>\n<li><strong>Immersive Learner Experience:</strong> Students rated the whiteboard animation format as significantly more engaging than standard lecture recording, with higher reported comprehension of complex histopathological concepts.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalable Curriculum:</strong> The systematic production approach has allowed Dr. Tisdall to build a comprehensive online pathology curriculum that now serves medical students across multiple countries and institutions.</li></ul>'),(10967,2477,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(10968,2477,'results_columns','1'),(10969,2477,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(10970,2477,'linked_project',''),(10971,2477,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(10972,2477,'project_section_title',''),(10973,2477,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(10974,2477,'project_section_text',''),(10975,2477,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(10976,2479,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(10977,2480,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/FIG_1-1-5.png'),(10978,2480,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:713;s:6:\"height\";i:448;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2026/06/FIG_1-1-5.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:120706;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-5-300x188.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:188;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:42626;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"FIG_1-1-5-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22565;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(10979,2480,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/FIG_1-1-5.png'),(10980,2479,'_thumbnail_id','2480'),(10981,2479,'client_name','InMobi'),(10982,2479,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(10983,2479,'client_intro','<p>InMobi has been in the mobile advertising industry for over 15 years, seeking to positively impact people, businesses, and societies globally with innovative mobile advertising technologies. They are a diverse, global company with employees representing varied cultures, experiences, and perspectives.</p>'),(10984,2479,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(10985,2479,'client_logo',''),(10986,2479,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(10987,2479,'challenge_title','Educating Clients and Employees on Mobile Advertising'),(10988,2479,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(10989,2479,'challenge','<p>Mobile advertising is a fast-moving, technically complex industry that most marketers understand only superficially. InMobi\'s growth depended on partners and clients who trusted their platform — but trust required understanding, and understanding required education at scale. Their sales conversations routinely stalled because potential clients didn\'t have the baseline knowledge to evaluate InMobi\'s value proposition.</p>\n<p>Internally, the challenge was equally pressing: a globally distributed workforce spanning diverse markets needed consistent product knowledge, but in-person training wasn\'t practical and existing written resources weren\'t engaging enough to compete with the demands of a fast-paced work environment.</p>'),(10990,2479,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(10991,2479,'challenge_columns','0'),(10992,2479,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(10993,2479,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(10994,2479,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(10995,2479,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic created a mobile advertising academy — a structured series of short animated modules covering the fundamentals of programmatic advertising, audience targeting, mobile measurement, and InMobi\'s specific platform capabilities. The animation style used clean vector graphics with smooth transitions, a deliberately modern aesthetic that signaled InMobi\'s position as a technology leader rather than a traditional media company.</p>\n<p>Each module was capped at five minutes and concluded with a knowledge-check quiz, creating a rhythm of learning and reinforcement that suited both client onboarding sessions and self-directed employee development. The brevity was intentional: in a fast-moving industry, education needed to deliver value immediately or risk being deprioritized.</p>'),(10996,2479,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(10997,2479,'solution_columns','0'),(10998,2479,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(10999,2479,'solution_image',''),(11000,2479,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(11001,2479,'solution_image_position','0'),(11002,2479,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(11003,2479,'results_title','Simple, Modern, and Easy to Understand'),(11004,2479,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(11005,2479,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Accelerated Partner Readiness:</strong> Clients who completed the academy onboarded faster, asked better questions, and required fewer clarification sessions during campaign setup — reducing InMobi\'s pre-launch support burden significantly.</li>\n<li><strong>Global Consistency:</strong> The academy delivered the same quality of product education to InMobi teams in Mumbai, San Francisco, and Singapore — eliminating the knowledge disparities that had previously varied by regional training resources.</li>\n<li><strong>Revenue Attribution:</strong> Partners who engaged with the academy demonstrated measurably higher campaign investment levels, linking education directly to commercial outcomes.</li></ul>'),(11006,2479,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(11007,2479,'results_columns','1'),(11008,2479,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(11009,2479,'linked_project','2255'),(11010,2479,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(11011,2479,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(11012,2479,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(11013,2479,'project_section_text',''),(11014,2479,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(11015,2481,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(11016,2482,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/Case-Studies_SanDiegoZoo-1.png'),(11017,2482,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:713;s:6:\"height\";i:677;s:4:\"file\";s:38:\"2026/06/Case-Studies_SanDiegoZoo-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:47475;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:38:\"Case-Studies_SanDiegoZoo-1-300x285.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:285;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22917;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:38:\"Case-Studies_SanDiegoZoo-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:9999;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(11018,2482,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Case-Studies_SanDiegoZoo-1.png'),(11019,2483,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/San-Diego-Zoo_Result-1.png'),(11020,2483,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:705;s:6:\"height\";i:396;s:4:\"file\";s:34:\"2026/06/San-Diego-Zoo_Result-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:441844;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:34:\"San-Diego-Zoo_Result-1-300x169.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:84493;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:34:\"San-Diego-Zoo_Result-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:38450;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(11021,2483,'_source_url','https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/San-Diego-Zoo_Result-1.png'),(11022,2481,'_thumbnail_id','2482'),(11023,2481,'client_name','San Diego Zoo'),(11024,2481,'_client_name','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),(11025,2481,'client_intro','<p>San Diego Zoo, home to more than 3,000 animals, is visited every year by tens of thousands of patrons. The zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their staff scientists to engage audiences of all ages both on and outside the grounds.</p>'),(11026,2481,'_client_intro','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),(11027,2481,'client_logo',''),(11028,2481,'_client_logo','field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),(11029,2481,'challenge_title','The Problem'),(11030,2481,'_challenge_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),(11031,2481,'challenge','<p>San Diego Zoo\'s conservation science team conducts research that is groundbreaking in its implications but inherently difficult to visualize — plant propagation cycles unfold over weeks and months, root systems grow underground, and the cellular-level processes that determine whether a cutting will survive can\'t be captured by any conventional camera. Staff scientists had compelling stories to tell, but no production tools that could bring them to life visually.</p>\n<p>The Zoo also needed content that could engage audiences ranging from expert horticulturalists to curious first-time visitors — spanning age groups and educational backgrounds while maintaining scientific accuracy and institutional credibility.</p>'),(11032,2481,'_challenge','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),(11033,2481,'challenge_columns','0'),(11034,2481,'_challenge_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),(11035,2481,'solution_title','Our Solution'),(11036,2481,'_solution_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),(11037,2481,'solution','<p>Ninja Tropic used existing audio recordings from staff scientist narrations as the foundation, building custom animations that illustrated each stage of the plant propagation process in precise biological detail. Root growth, cell division, nutrient uptake, and environmental stress responses were all visualized in a style that balanced scientific accuracy with visual clarity for non-expert audiences.</p>\n<p>The animated scientist narrator — a character designed to reflect the actual researcher — guided viewers through the experiment, creating a personal connection to the science that generic narration-over-footage could not replicate. The production process was fully remote, with the Zoo team providing audio and scientific review while Ninja Tropic handled all visual production.</p>'),(11038,2481,'_solution','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),(11039,2481,'solution_columns','0'),(11040,2481,'_solution_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),(11041,2481,'solution_image','2483'),(11042,2481,'_solution_image','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),(11043,2481,'solution_image_position','0'),(11044,2481,'_solution_image_position','field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),(11045,2481,'results_title','The Process'),(11046,2481,'_results_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),(11047,2481,'results','<ul>\n<li><strong>Scientific Communication Achievement:</strong> The animation successfully conveyed complex plant biology in a format accessible to general audiences without sacrificing accuracy — a balance that had previously eluded the Zoo\'s education team.</li>\n<li><strong>Series Expansion:</strong> The Zoo was so satisfied with the first video that they immediately commissioned a second — this time exploring how animation can be used as a tool in scientific communication more broadly, effectively turning the medium itself into a subject of study.</li>\n<li><strong>Ongoing Educational Asset:</strong> The videos are used across San Diego Zoo\'s digital channels, onsite educational programs, and partner institution networks, giving conservation science research a compelling public face.</li></ul>'),(11048,2481,'_results','field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),(11049,2481,'results_columns','1'),(11050,2481,'_results_columns','field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),(11051,2481,'linked_project','2204'),(11052,2481,'_linked_project','field_ninjatheme_cs_linked_project'),(11053,2481,'project_section_title','See It In Action'),(11054,2481,'_project_section_title','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_title'),(11055,2481,'project_section_text',''),(11056,2481,'_project_section_text','field_ninjatheme_cs_project_section_text'),(11057,2484,'rank_math_internal_links_processed','1'),(11058,2485,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/cocacola-caso_Blo4-4-4.webp'),(11059,2485,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1453;s:6:\"height\";i:854;s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"2026/06/cocacola-caso_Blo4-4-4.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:39638;s:5:\"sizes\";a:5:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:35:\"cocacola-caso_Blo4-4-4-300x176.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:176;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8: