practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_i