and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"anchor\":\"contact-form\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our <em>Process</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\">Our process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Instructional Design Services','','publish','closed','closed','','results-driven-instructional-design-services','','','2026-03-06 23:28:32','2026-03-06 23:28:32','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=347',0,'page','',0),(348,1,'2026-02-08 20:38:29','2026-02-08 20:38:29','','Instructional Design Consulting | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 20:38:29','2026-02-08 20:38:29','',347,'http://localhost:8080/?p=348',0,'revision','',0),(349,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','349','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=349',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(351,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27','','Blended Learning','','publish','closed','closed','','351','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=351',7,'nav_menu_item','',0),(352,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27','','Content Monetization','','publish','closed','closed','','352','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=352',6,'nav_menu_item','',0),(353,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27','','Training Needs Analysis','','publish','closed','closed','','353','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=353',5,'nav_menu_item','',0),(354,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27','','Curriculum Blueprint/Roadmap','','publish','closed','closed','','354','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=354',4,'nav_menu_item','',0),(355,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-08 20:39:27','','Mobile Learning','','publish','closed','closed','','355','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=355',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(357,1,'2026-02-08 21:10:40','2026-02-08 21:10:40','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom eLearning Development Services\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Looking for \\u003cb\\u003ecustom elearning development\\u003c/b\\u003e that prioritizes \\u003cb\\u003elearner experience\\u003c/b\\u003e and delivers \\u003cb\\u003emeasurable results? \\u003c/b\\u003eWe focus on what your learners really need to know or do, and we design and create elearning solutions that fit your budget and meet your deadline. From bite-sized microlearning to full-blown courses, we’ve got the skills to make your training rock. Our secret? We’re not just creating content, we’re crafting experiences. We infuse our eLearning with storytelling, interactive elements, and real-world scenarios to make learning engaging, memorable, and award-winning.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":798,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eBespoke \\u003cem\\u003eeLearning Courses\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners, problems and brand aren’t generic, so why should their training be? We dive deep into your goals, audience, and content to create custom elearning that’s tailor-made for your people, your business drivers, and your desired outcome. Your bespoke courses will spark engagement and drive real behavioral change. Check out the largest portfolio of dynamic eLearning. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":800,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMicrolearning Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners need and prefer quick and accessible online training. Our microlearning solutions offer focused content in short bursts, making it easy for learners to fit training into their busy schedules. Bite sized learning experiences boost knowledge retention and engagement. We are leaders in microlearning development and boast the largest portfolio of microlearning examples. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":803,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eInstructional Design Services \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nOur instructional design consulting starts with a thorough training needs analysis to uncover gaps and align your training with your business goals. We then develop a strategy focused on measurable outcomes, helping you deliver impactful learning that improves performance. Whether you’re struggling with engagement, retention, or aligning training with key objectives, we provide a clear path forward, ensuring your learning initiatives support your team’s success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFull-service course production\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eFrom Concept to Completion\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\r\\nWe handle every aspect of the eLearning development process, from initial concept and design to content creation, development, and deployment. Our full-service approach saves you time and resources, allowing you to focus on what you do best.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFull-service course production\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nFrom Concept to Completion\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We handle every aspect of the eLearning development process, from initial concept and design to content creation, development, and deployment. Our full-service approach saves you time and resources, allowing you to focus on what you do best.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eHigh-quality for tight timelines\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nMeeting Deadlines Without Compromising Quality\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team is adept at delivering high-quality eLearning solutions on tight timelines. We have the team and processes to ensure your training programs launch on schedule and exceed your expectations.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":669,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTransparency in customer service\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eCustom Solutions That Align with Your Goals\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\nWhether you need a single microlearning module or a comprehensive training program, we have the expertise and track record to deliver online learning that is simple, usable, and effective. We collaborate with you to develop eLearning experiences that inspire, educate, and empower your learners.\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nOpen Communication Every Step of the Way\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\nWe believe in open and honest communication. Throughout the eLearning development process, we keep you informed and involved. We value your feedback and strive to exceed your expectations at every turn.\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":812,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBespoke solutions to meet your training needs\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Whether you need a single microlearning module or a comprehensive training program, we have the expertise to deliver custom solutions that align with your training goals. We collaborate with you to develop eLearning experiences that inspire, educate, and empower your learners.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":555,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"eLearning Awards\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to quality and innovation has earned us recognition in the learning and development industry. We’re proud to have received awards for our eLearning solutions, a testament to our dedication to delivering exceptional training experiences.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6