r training goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eContent Development Company\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We have a team of experienced content developers who specialize in creating compelling and informative training materials. From interactive videos to engaging simulations, we bring your content to life.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":819,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Inteleos\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":820,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Comcast\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":821,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhat makes us different?\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\nWe believe that learning should be an enjoyable and rewarding journey, not a tedious chore. That’s why we prioritize creating content that is interactive, relevant, and visually appealing. We avoid the pitfalls of “click next” content by incorporating elements of gamification, storytelling, and real-world scenarios. Our goal is to inspire learners to actively participate in their learning and apply the knowledge they gain to their work.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eCustom-designed\\u003c/em\\u003e learning built for you\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We’re passionate about helping organizations achieve their training goals through the power of a custom elearning experience. Our custom designed solutions are built with your success in mind. We strive to create elearning experiences that inspire, educate, and empower your learners, driving real results for your business.\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":829,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a  [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your association, university, or enterprise’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Custom eLearning Development Services','','publish','closed','closed','','custom-elearning-development-services','','','2026-03-12 04:10:51','2026-03-12 04:10:51','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=357',0,'page','',0),(358,1,'2026-02-08 21:10:40','2026-02-08 21:10:40','','Custom eLearning Development Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','357-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:10:40','2026-02-08 21:10:40','',357,'http://localhost:8080/?p=358',0,'revision','',0),(359,1,'2026-02-08 21:11:09','2026-02-08 21:11:09','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eHost Lead\\r\\nInstructional Videos\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen it comes to training and educating your employees or customers, you want to ensure that the content you’re delivering is both effective and engaging. After all, the ultimate goal of any training program is to inspire behavior change and drive results for your organization. And what better way to achieve this goal than through the power of video?\\r\\n\\r\\nOur recording host lead instructional videos are designed to deliver results, educate and engage your audience, making it the perfect complement to your existing training programs or a standalone solution. But what sets our instructional videos apart from others on the market? It’s our commitment to customization and flexibility.\\r\\nWe understand that every organization is unique, and that’s why we offer two options to help you create the perfect instructional video: Onsite Filming and Remote Film Options.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":878,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e#1 Onsite Filming\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The first option is to coordinate filming with your subject matter experts. This way, your audience is learning directly from the people who know your industry best.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey will be able to provide real-world examples and insights that will help your audience retain the information better. This option is perfect for organizations that want to showcase the expertise of their team, or for those looking for a more personal and relatable touch.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":880,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eInteractive and Engaging Content\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Regardless of which option you choose, rest assured that our recording host lead instructional videos are more than just talking heads. They are interactive and engaging, designed to keep your audience focused and interested. We incorporate a variety of techniques to keep the content engaging, such as visual aids, interactive quizzes, and animated graphics. Our instructional videos are not only informative but also enjoyable to watch, which helps to keep your audience engaged and invested in the training.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":881,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch1 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_heading\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eDelivering Results\\u003c/em\\u003e That Matter\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"With our recording host lead instructional videos, you can be confident that your audience will receive the education and training they need to succeed. Whether you’re looking to improve customer satisfaction, increase employee productivity, or drive sales, our instructional videos are an effective tool for achieving your goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eA Better Call to Action\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"So, if you’re ready to take your training to the next level and start delivering results that matter, contact us today to learn more about how we can help you achieve your training goals. Our recording host lead instructional videos are the perfect solution for organizations looking for an effective, engaging, and enjoyable way to train their employees or customers. Don’t wait, get started today and see the difference for yourself!\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":882,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Learn more about the Training Needs Analysis on a Free Consultation\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis is a crucial step in the creation of effective e-learning content. Embrace the power of TNA and take your e-learning content to the next level. Start inspiring behavior change and drive results for your organization today.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Live Action Host Video | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','publish','closed','closed','','live-action-host-video-video-elearning-and-video-animation-company','','','2026-03-13 04:07:45','2026-03-13 04:07:45','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=359',0,'page','',0),(360,1,'2026-02-08 21:11:09','2026-02-08 21:11:09','','Live Action Host Video | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','359-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:11:09','2026-02-08 21:11:09','',359,'http://localhost:8080/?p=360',0,'revision','',0),(361,1,'2026-02-08 21:11:50','2026-02-08 21:11:50','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAward Winning Custom Animated Training Videos\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCorporate training must do more than just inform—it must engage, educate, and inspire. That’s where custom animated training videos come in. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we specialize in crafting engaging, skill-building animated videos designed to resonate with modern learners. From vibrant visuals to tailored messaging, our award-winning process ensures your training content delivers measurable results. Whether you’re building compliance training, onboarding modules, or product knowledge videos, our approach is designed to achieve real business outcomes.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":884,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation grabs attention and simplifies complex topics, making learning enjoyable and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boost Retention:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Studies show learners remember visual content better than text alone. Animated videos enhance understanding by combining visuals with auditory elements.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Increase Comprehension:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can break down complex concepts into easy-to-understand steps, making it easier for learners to grasp new information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve Focus:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engaging visuals and sound effects can help learners stay focused and reduce distractions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create a Positive Learning Experience:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can make training more fun and enjoyable, which can lead to increased motivation and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facilitate Collaboration:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can be used to spark discussion and collaboration among learners.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enhance Brand Awareness:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can help to build brand awareness and recognition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAnimated videos make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We focus on your learners and desired results by tailoring our approach to their specific needs and preferences. We create engaging and memorable learning experiences that drive real behavior change.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor example, if you want to improve employee onboarding, we’ll create a series of animated videos that welcome new hires, introduce them to the company culture, and teach them the skills they need to be successful. We’ll use relatable characters and scenarios to make the learning experience enjoyable and relevant.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eAnd that’s not all!\\u003c/b\\u003e We offer a full range of services to help you achieve your training goals from start to finish, including \\u003cb\\u003elive action video production\\u003c/b\\u003e,\\u003cb\\u003e instructional design consulting\\u003c/b\\u003e, and more.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":723,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eAnimated videos\\u003c/em\\u003e make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We take pride in having the\\u003cb\\u003e largest portfolio\\u003c/b\\u003e of educational animation examples spanning multiple industries. From healthcare to technology, nonprofits to corporate training, our animations have transformed learning experiences for diverse audiences. Each example showcases our ability to create customized, engaging content that resonates with learners and achieves measurable outcomes. Whether you’re looking for compliance training, onboarding, or product education, our portfolio demonstrates how we bring concepts to life with creativity.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022\\u003eCheck out our award-winning portfolio!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eAligned with Your Learners and Your Brand\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners are unique, and so is your brand. At Ninja Tropic, we ensure that every educational video we create reflects both.\\r\\n\\r\\nTailored Visuals: We design animations that match your brand’s colors, style, and tone. Learner-Centric Focus: By understanding your audience, we create videos that address their specific needs and preferences.  Our animations integrate seamlessly with your existing training materials.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":891,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Our <em>Animated Training</em> Process</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eTraining Needs Analysis:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We start by understanding your goals. What skills or knowledge gaps are you trying to address? Who are your learners? What outcomes do you want to see? This analysis ensures your training videos are not just engaging but also aligned with your business objectives.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":555,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eCreate a script for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"A compelling script is the backbone of any great video. Clear Objectives: Every script is written with the end goal in mind—what do you want your learners to achieve? Engaging Language: We write in a tone that resonates with your audience, avoiding jargon and focusing on clarity.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":894,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eDevelop a storyboard for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The storyboard is where your vision begins to take shape. Each scene is sketched out with accompanying text to show what learners will see and hear. You review the storyboard to ensure it aligns with your goals and vision. This step helps avoid costly revisions later and ensures everyone is on the same page before production begins.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":895,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eCreate assets and animate!\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team creates unique characters, backgrounds, and visuals tailored to your brand. Using state-of-the-art tools, we bring your storyboard to life with smooth, professional animation. Professional narrators and soundtracks enhance the learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":896,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eTest your animated educational videos with audiences\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Testing is a critical step in our process. We share the video with a small group of learners to gather feedback. Based on feedback, we fine-tune the video for clarity, engagement, and effectiveness.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWe measure \\u003cem\\u003eresults\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We don’t just deliver a typical explainer video and call it a day. At Ninja Tropic, we measure the impact of your animated training videos.\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli style=\\u0022list-style-type: none;\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLearner Assessments:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nTrack knowledge retention through quizzes or interactive elements.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003ePerformance Metrics:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nAnalyze behavior changes or productivity improvements post-training.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eContinuous Improvement:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nUse the data to refine future training initiatives.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Case [gradient]Studies[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Want to see how we’ve helped other organizations achieve real results with animated training videos? Check out our in-depth \\u003cb\\u003ecase studies\\u003c/b\\u003e to see how we’ve helped companies like yours overcome their training challenges and achieve measurable outcomes. You’ll see real-world examples of how our engaging, learner-centric approach can transform your training programs and drive success\\r\\n\\r\\nAt \\u003cb\\u003eNinja Tropic eLearning\\u003c/b\\u003e, we believe training should never feel like a chore. With custom animated videos, your learners will stay engaged, retain more, and apply what they’ve learned.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Swire Coca-Cola\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":900,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":617,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"DRIP7\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":901,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Animation | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','publish','closed','closed','','video-animation-video-elearning-and-video-animation-company','','','2026-03-12 05:10:07','2026-03-12 05:10:07','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=361',0,'page','',0),(362,1,'2026-02-08 21:11:50','2026-02-08 21:11:50','','Video Animation | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','361-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:11:50','2026-02-08 21:11:50','',361,'http://localhost:8080/?p=362',0,'revision','',0),(363,1,'2026-02-08 21:12:41','2026-02-08 21:12:41','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eMicrolearning Video Solutions\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Statistics have proven that while the need for effective eLearning is increasing, the attention span of most humans is on the decline.\\r\\n\\r\\nHow do we combat both concerns? \\u003cstrong\\u003eMicrolearning Solutions.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nMicrolearning solutions are methods that include short educational spurts in video format to both entertain and educate a growing workforce or student population – optimizing downtime and productivity rates for every booming business.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":905,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"What is Microlearning Video?\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Microlearning solutions use video to combine hyper-focused content, stunning animation, and exciting audio to produce an eLearning method that works for every student. Slide decks are a thing of the past and just don’t offer the same benefits and desired outcome – if they even finish it… at all!\\r\\n\\r\\nWith microlearning solutions, less is definitely more – more engagement, more output… more RESULTS!\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Get in Touch\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://vimeo.com/727563749?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"AT\\u0026T\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":907,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":908,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"ARA (American Rental Association)\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":909,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego Zoo reached out to the experts at Ninja Tropic to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Engagedly</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Infographic + Live Action</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Performance management is the forte of Engagedly, but when it came to implementing an eLearning solution that actually performed, they came to us. Engagedly needed a learning strategy for potential customers focused on mentorship and combining polished live action clips with beautiful animation was the perfect solution. At the end of the project, Engagedly had a collection of purposeful content for their subscribers to boost their corporate cultures through advisorship.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Old Castle</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High detail Illustrative + 3D</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Procedural training is a challenging feat because traditional instructional methods struggle to keep attention. The experts at Oldcastle Infrastructure veered away from the “normal slide deck” and opted for animated 3D training to visually demonstrate a new process to their line employees that they could access anytime. Oldcastle’s team connected instantly to the video and were able to implement the new complex process successfully.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":912,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MS_Our-case-studies-526x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-912\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":785,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Video-Training-Strategy-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-785\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Video Training Strategy</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":915,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Custom-Development-Training.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-915\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Custom<br>Development Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":786,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Corporate-Training.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-786\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Corporate Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Microlearning Solutions | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','publish','closed','closed','','microlearning-solutions','','','2026-03-12 05:23:00','2026-03-12 05:23:00','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=363',0,'page','',0),(364,1,'2026-02-08 21:12:41','2026-02-08 21:12:41','','Microlearning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','363-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:12:41','2026-02-08 21:12:41','',363,'http://localhost:8080/?p=364',0,'revision','',0),(365,1,'2026-02-08 21:12:46','2026-02-08 21:12:46','','Microlearning Solutions | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','363-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:12:46','2026-02-08 21:12:46','',363,'http://localhost:8080/?p=365',0,'revision','',0),(366,1,'2026-02-08 21:13:37','2026-02-08 21:13:37','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eeLearning Video Storytelling\\r\\nCompany: Bespoke Video\\r\\nService for Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Customized eLearning that screams your core values, personalized processes, and targeted objectives is what our top-notch video storytelling company offers your firm. You can entertain your students through business storytelling via video while they digest all your most important messages.\\r\\n\\r\\nLearners are challenged with focus and attention, but with storytelling services, we’ve got your back. Video is everywhere – streaming on television, on every social media platform, and even on billboards in cities across the world. It’s time to integrate what your learners want into what your learners need… Storytelling videos.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":918,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Enhanced Learning Outcomes with Video Storytelling\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Imagine your learners emotionally connecting with your content. That’s precisely what our video storytelling company offers. Through stunning visuals and expertly crafted copy transformed into energizing audio, your business storytelling videos engage learners and dramatically increase retention (and implementation) – when they can see themselves in it.\\r\\n\\r\\nDecrease personal and professional distractions when your learning outcomes are targeted to your learners. Even content that is not quite relatable (yet) becomes relatable when our expert storytelling company injects the connection back into training.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":919,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch1 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_heading\\u0022\\u003eBuilding Knowledge Through Familiarity Using \\u003cem\\u003eVideo Storytelling Animation\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Trying to find an innovative and fresh way to instruct your learners on a new process, piece of equipment, or another type of complicated material? We’re just what you need – an explainer video production company.\\r\\n\\r\\nThrough our stunning animation, we teach every student and employee through smaller, bite-sized videos via our explainer video production process – and get them to comprehend and implement those new tactics in no time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Corporate <em>Video Storytelling</em> for Your<br>Unique Training Needs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"mb-4 is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background mb-4 is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Corporate video agencies take complex information and reformulate it into visually stunning videos that capture their attention and keep them hanging on every word. Ditch the old slide deck-based web-based training and step into the 21st century with video storytelling animation for your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Start Telling Your Story<br>with <em>Ninja Tropic </em>Today</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center mb-4\">As your one-stop shop for video storytelling, we’re ready to transform dull boring bullet points into story scenes that pop. Corporate storytelling is exactly what your business needs to forge forward on productivity metrics and professional success – content presented in a way that people actually want to engage with. Simple. Entertaining. Effective. That’s a corporate video agency result.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">See our solutions!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Video <em>Storytelling Services</em> &amp; Examples<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"mb-4 is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background mb-4 is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":926,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VIDEO-STO_OW_BOTH_2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-926\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Future</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":927,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VIDEO-STO_OW_BOTH_1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-927\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Psychhub</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":934,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Leadership-Development-Training.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-934\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Leadership<br>Development Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">With few natural-born leaders, effective leadership training is vital for any business’s success. Support employee growth and boost revenue with impactful learning solutions.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":935,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Brand-Training_.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-935\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Brand Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For clients and employees alike, understanding your company’s goals, mission, and values is essential. Brand training with innovative video methods delivers rapid, lasting results across industries.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":936,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Product-Training-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-936\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams must engage in product training to effectively understand what they’re promoting. Invest in short, engaging, video-based microlearning to boost knowledge and drive results!<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Interactive eLearning[/gradient] Videos Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Storytelling | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','publish','closed','closed','','video-storytelling-company','','','2026-03-13 03:06:34','2026-03-13 03:06:34','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=366',0,'page','',0),(367,1,'2026-02-08 21:13:37','2026-02-08 21:13:37','','Video Storytelling Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','366-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:13:37','2026-02-08 21:13:37','',366,'http://localhost:8080/?p=367',0,'revision','',0),(368,1,'2026-02-08 21:13:51','2026-02-08 21:13:51','','Video Storytelling | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','366-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:13:51','2026-02-08 21:13:51','',366,'http://localhost:8080/?p=368',0,'revision','',0),(369,1,'2026-02-08 21:14:27','2026-02-08 21:14:27','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAnimation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 image-hover\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":949,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Walkme\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":950,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":951,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clinico Path</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Character Animation + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Award-winning teacher at the Mayo Clinic and published author, Dr. Philip Tisdall, MD, had a massive task to achieve. The Clinico Path Group hoped to create whiteboard video training instructing students to use critical reasoning when caring for their patients. With hundreds of 40-minute lectures to morph into stunning and captivating video modules, Dr. Tisdall reached out to the pros at Ninja Tropic. He has been immersing his pathology students in these unique eLearning videos every month since.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Illustrative Minimalist + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical educators know it’s important to keep up with the times. That’s why it’s important to offer only the best learning resources for medical professionals. In fact, new educational methods, like elearning video animation, have the potential to increase student engagement and understanding. This is what made Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi seek out NinjaTropic’s help. Dr. Yabrodi wanted to lead the charge for more innovative learning solutions in the medical field.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego zoo reached out to Ninja Tropic experts to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":953,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_Our-case-studies-486x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-953\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got just a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? Busy schedules demand condensed learning, and that’s what Ninja Tropic’s microlearning solutions offer!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":955,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Video-Animation-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-955\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Video Animation</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Are your learners struggling to grasp key company info or lacking process expertise? Video animation is the solution to boring lectures, enhancing engagement and delivering messages effectively!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18  et_pb_text_align_justified et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAre you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','publish','closed','closed','','video-training-strategy','','','2026-03-13 03:48:47','2026-03-13 03:48:47','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=369',0,'page','',0),(370,1,'2026-02-08 21:14:27','2026-02-08 21:14:27','','Video Training Strategy','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-02-