tservices','','','2026-02-08 21:22:39','2026-02-08 21:22:39','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=379',0,'page','',0),(380,1,'2026-02-08 21:22:38','2026-02-08 21:22:38','','LMS SupportServices','','inherit','closed','closed','','379-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 21:22:38','2026-02-08 21:22:38','',379,'http://localhost:8080/?p=380',0,'revision','',0),(381,1,'2026-02-08 21:23:27','2026-02-08 21:23:27','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLMS Implementation Consultant\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Are you transitioning to a new Learning Management System (LMS) or struggling to maximize the potential of your current one? Ninja Tropic is here to help! We offer comprehensive LMS consulting services to guide you through every step of the process. Get an expert LMS implementation consultant today\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":957,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e# 1 LMS \\u003cem\\u003eImplementation Consultant\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhy Choose Ninja Tropic for LMS Consulting?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eExpert Guidance:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nOur experienced consultants have a deep understanding of LMS technology and the challenges organizations face in implementation and optimization.\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eTailored Solutions:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nWe know that every organization is unique. We work closely with you to develop customized solutions that align with your specific goals and needs.\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eFocus on Success:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nOur mission is to ensure your LMS project is a success. We’ll be with you every step of the way, providing support, training, and troubleshooting.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our <em>LMS Consulting</em> Services</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eLMS Implementation\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Implementing a new LMS is an investment in your organization’s future. We’ll guide you through the entire implementation process, from vendor selection and system configuration to user training and ongoing support.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":965,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eLMS Migration\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Moving to a new training LMS can be complex. We’ll help you plan and execute a smooth migration, ensuring your data is transferred securely and your users are up and running quickly.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":967,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eLMS Admin Services\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We understand that managing an LMS can be a complex and time-consuming task. Our LMS admin support services can help you with everything from routine maintenance and troubleshooting to advanced reporting and analytics. We’ll work with you to develop a customized support plan that fits your needs and frees up your time to focus on other important tasks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":968,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>The <em>LMS implementation</em> process</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Migration and Development:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Seamlessly integrate our courses into your existing learning management system (LMS) for easy deployment and tracking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">User Training and Adoption:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Next, we craft a mobile friendly learning experience that’s both engaging and effective. We define clear learning objectives, map out the user journey, and select the best content types (videos, quizzes, etc.). We also plan assessments to measure progress. This ensures your learners stay focused and motivated on their mobile friendly training program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Testing and Quality Assurance:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, we bring your vision to life. We create captivating, interactive content, or repurpose your existing materials for mobile delivery. We develop quizzes and tests to reinforce the learning experience and ensure everything is accurate and up-to-date.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Launch and Rollout:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finally, we package everything for a smooth mobile experience. We optimize content for different devices, load it onto your platform, and thoroughly test it. Your custom mobile learning program is ready for launch, and we’ll monitor its performance to make sure it’s a success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Monitoring and Optimization:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, we bring your vision to life. We create captivating, interactive content, or repurpose your existing materials for mobile delivery. We develop quizzes and tests to reinforce the learning experience and ensure everything is accurate and up-to-date.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Launch and Promote Your LMS:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finally, we package everything for a smooth mobile experience. We optimize content for different devices, load it onto your platform, and thoroughly test it. Your custom mobile learning program is ready for launch, and we’ll monitor its performance to make sure it’s a success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"1rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Monitor and Evaluate:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, we bring your vision to life. We create captivating, interactive content, or repurpose your existing materials for mobile delivery. We develop quizzes and tests to reinforce the learning experience and ensure everything is accurate and up-to-date.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":970,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/The-LMS-implementation-process_Mesa-de-trabajo-1_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-1-509x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-970\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eLMS Implementation\\u003c/em\\u003e Project Plan Template\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"Need help planning your LMS project? Download our free project plan template to get started\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Download your Free Template!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Cost of <em>LMS Implementation</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">he cost of LMS implementation can vary widely, but with Ninja Tropic’s fixed monthly plans, you can focus on execution without worrying about upfront costs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">We offer two plans to suit your specific needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"ninja-pricing-table container\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table ninja-pricing-table container\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Standard Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$1,850</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">Up to 3000 Learners</span>\n    </th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Power Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$2,875</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">3000+ Learners</span>\n    </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>LMS Administration</strong></td><td>Unlimited access to experienced LMS administrators during business hours, ensuring your system runs smoothly and efficiently.</td><td>Includes all Standard features plus integrated LMS administration with content editing support.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Loading</strong></td><td>Quick and accurate course uploads, keeping your content accessible and up-to-date.</td><td>Load and customize courses as needed, ensuring they stay relevant and engaging.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Management</strong></td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Routine Reporting</strong></td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Proactive System Development</strong></td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues.</td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"10rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:10rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\