>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<script charset=\"utf-8\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  hbspt.forms.create({\n    region: \"na1\",\n    portalId: \"7816367\",\n    formId: \"763978d5-b0ad-40e2-a8b4-1310da8b2ee9\"\n  });\n</script>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Contact Us','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-us','','','2026-04-05 22:09:26','2026-04-05 22:09:26','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=400',0,'page','',0),(401,1,'2026-02-09 01:46:56','2026-02-09 01:46:56','','Contact Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','400-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 01:46:56','2026-02-09 01:46:56','',400,'http://localhost:8080/?p=401',0,'revision','',0),(402,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-09 01:47:40',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','402','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=402',54,'nav_menu_item','',0),(403,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-02-09 01:47:40',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','403','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=403',53,'nav_menu_item','',0),(404,1,'2026-02-09 02:37:19','2026-02-09 02:37:19','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustomer Education Services – Modern Online Learning\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Businesses need more than just a great product. They need to empower their customers with the knowledge and skills to fully leverage their offerings. That’s where our specialized customer education services come in, providing engaging and effective online learning experiences that drive customer success and fuel business growth.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1076,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhat is Customer Education?\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Customer education, in the context of online onboarding, is about providing new customers with the tools and knowledge they need to seamlessly adopt and succeed with your product or service. It’s a strategic process that goes beyond simple product tours and feature explanations.\\r\\n\\r\\nThrough engaging online learning experiences, like interactive videos, microlearning modules, and gamified elements, you empower customers to quickly understand the value of your offering and navigate its complexities.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis proactive approach to onboarding not only accelerates the time-to-value for customers but also fosters a sense of confidence and loyalty, setting the stage for a long-lasting and fruitful relationship.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Engage and educate <em>your audience.</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Effective customer education is a strategic investment that yields significant returns. By providing your customers with the knowledge and tools they need to succeed, you can:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Improve customer satisfaction and retention:</strong><br>When customers feel empowered to use your product or service effectively, they are more likely to be satisfied and remain loyal to your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Drive product adoption and usage:</strong><br>When customers feel empowered to use your product or service effectively, they are more likely to be satisfied and remain loyal to your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Reduce support costs:</strong><br>Well-educated customers are less likely to need frequent assistance, reducing the burden on your support team and saving your business money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Turn customers into brand advocates:</strong><br>Customers who feel confident and successful with your product or service are more likely to recommend it to others, becoming valuable brand advocates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸<strong>Increase customer lifetime value:</strong><br>By providing ongoing education and support, you can help customers get the most out of your offerings, leading to increased customer lifetime value.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1078,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Engage-and-training-for-customer-education_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-509x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1078\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong><strong>Training Formats for <em>Customer Education</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic specializes in creating engaging and interactive customer education experiences. We offer a variety of training formats, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactive Videos:</strong><br>Break down complex concepts into bite-sized, visually appealing videos that keep learners engaged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Microlearning Modules:</strong><br>Deliver focused, just-in-time training that fits seamlessly into busy schedules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactive Video and Assessments:</strong><br>Reinforce learning and track progress with interactive assessments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Gamified Learning:</strong><br>Make learning fun and motivate learners to complete training with game-like elements.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eCourse Creation\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe that no two businesses are the same. That’s why we offer custom course creation services designed to meet your specific customer education goals. Our team of copy writers will work closely with you to develop a comprehensive customer training program that builds your brand and drives product adoption.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":894,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eMicrolearning Services\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our microlearning experts will transform your content into short, impactful modules that are perfect for on-the-go learning. We’ll guide you through the entire microlearning content development process, from initial planning and content creation to final delivery. Our experts will leverage their knowledge of adult learning principles and customer training best practices to create engaging and effective education programs that drive customer success with new customers. \\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1088,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eAcademy Branding \\u0026 Customization\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your customer education program should reflect your company’s brand and values. Our academy branding and customization services can help you create a branded learning environment that is both visually appealing and user-friendly.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":896,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eKey Benefits of \\u003cem\\u003eBranding\\u003c/em\\u003e Your Academy\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEnhanced brand recognition:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"A branded customer education program helps reinforce your company’s identity with a targeted user base.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":555,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":\"\",\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eImproved learner experience:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"A consistent brand experience can make it easier for learners to navigate your academy and drive customer success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":1091,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":\"\",\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eIncreased engagement:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"A branded academy can help you build a stronger connection with your customers and increase production adoption.\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":1092,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":\"\",\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong><strong><strong>Key <em>Benefits of Branding</em> Your Academy</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We specialize in creating engaging and effective customer education programs that drive customer success. Our team of experts works closely with you to develop high-quality content that meets your specific needs and aligns with your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We focus on creating a seamless learning experience for your customers, from onboarding to ongoing education.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our customer training programs are designed to help your customers get the most out of your products or services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use a variety of delivery methods, including interactive videos, microlearning modules, and gamified learning experiences, to ensure that your customers can access the training they need when they need it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We also provide tools and resources to help you track learner progress and engagement, so you can measure the effectiveness of your customer education program. By analyzing learner data, you can identify areas for improvement and optimize your training content to better meet the needs of your customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe Ideal Customer Education Team\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team of instructional designers, videographers, and learning experience specialists is committed to creating a cohesive and collaborative environment where your customer education program thrives.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe work closely with you to understand your specific needs and goals, and we leverage our expertise to develop engaging and effective education content that resonates with your customers.\\r\\n\\r\\nBy combining our skills and knowledge, we become a cohesive team that is dedicated to delivering exceptional customer education experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Benefits of Creating a <em>Customer Education Program</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Increased customer satisfaction and loyalty:</strong><br>Empowered customers who understand your product or service are more likely to be happy and stay with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Higher product adoption and usage:</strong></strong><br>Effective training encourages customers to explore and utilize all the features you offer, maximizing their investment and your revenue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Reduce support costs:</strong><br>Knowledgeable customers mean fewer support tickets and calls, freeing up your team and saving your business money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Boosted brand reputation and advocacy:</strong><br>Confident customers become brand advocates, spreading positive word-of-mouth and attracting new business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Greater customer lifetime value:</strong></strong><br>By nurturing customers through education, you foster long-term relationships and increase their overall value to your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Competitive advantage:</strong></strong><br>A strong customer education program sets you apart from competitors and demonstrates your commitment to customer success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Improved onboarding and activation:</strong><br>New customers get up to speed faster, leading to quicker activation and a smoother user experience.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eRemember:\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Investing in customer education is an investment in your business’s future. Let Ninja Tropic be your partner in creating a learning journey that transforms your customers into raving fans.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1102,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_43 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE[/gradient] Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','Customer Education Services','','publish','closed','closed','','customer-education-services','','','2026-03-17 04:24:18','2026-03-17 04:24:18','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=404',0,'page','',0),(405,1,'2026-02-09 02:37:19','2026-02-09 02:37:19','','Customer Education Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','404-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 02:37:19','2026-02-09 02:37:19','',404,'http://localhost:8080/?p=405',0,'revision','',0),(406,1,'2026-02-09 02:38:49','2026-02-09 02:38:49','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWorkplace Compliance Training: Improve Your\\r\\nWork Culture\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"From complying with legal requirements to remaining safe in the workplace, compliance training keeps both individuals and the organization safe. Compliance isn’t just annual training but its content must become a culture of its own.\\r\\n\\r\\nWithout compliance training for employees, the result could be disastrous for your workforce and your business license but learning leaders struggle to bring their employee compliance training into the 21st century with methodology that gets results.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhether it’s self-paced online workplace compliance training or video-based employee compliance training – it has to be done right. Transform your dull, monotonous, “it’s the same thing every year” content delivery into something enjoyable and engaging for every employee and achieve… compliance.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1106,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhat is Compliance Training?\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Compliance training is commonly mandatory content that must be viewed, learned, and practiced by every employee, every day. It may be industry-related, diversity, equity, and inclusion-centered, safety-focused, or something that limits your organizational risk.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt’s an insurance policy for your business and corporate compliance training should be taken seriously from its conception to delivery.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhy You Need Compliance Training?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Workplace compliance training protects employees from serious physical, emotional, and mental harm while keeping organizations on the right side of the law. It shares corporate values, ethics, and culture to forge a path to success – together, and ensures every person feels seen and represented.\\r\\n\\r\\nWithout employee compliance training, the organization can feel like every employee is on their own to do the right thing in the right ways. Lack of knowledge can be disastrous but with a workplace compliance training strategy that proves solidarity with employees to ensure the best possible environment, compliance training can be the engaging hero in your organizational story.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1109,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur Approach to Workplace Compliance\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nWe understand that workplace compliance training takes some serious undertones but when you integrate some employee-centered context into your educational material, your team feels like they’re part of the solution. Getting that emotional buy-in from your employees can be the difference between compliance – and lack thereof.\\r\\n\\r\\nDeveloping and delivering your meaningful workplace compliance training begins with respect for the professionals you’ve hired and integrates high levels of engagement without the tedious monotony for improved results.\\r\\nIt’s what we do.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_7  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1110,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Types of <em>Workplace Compliance</em> Training</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">While there are many types of workplace compliance training, your specific business and industry can help learning leaders decide which ones are the most beneficial. Some are required by law but a few of the most popular and results-driven content include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Safety Compliance Training<br>🔸 Diversity, Equity and Inclusion<br>🔸 HR Compliance Training<br>🔸 Ethics and Values Compliance Training<br>🔸 FERC Compliance Training<br>🔸 OSHA Compliance Training<br>🔸 Serve Safe Compliance Training<br>🔸 Harassment Compliance Training<br>🔸 Security-based Compliance Training</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCheck out our\\r\\n\\u003cem\\u003eCompliance Training Solutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022#\\u0022\\u003eSee more\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1114,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eTechnical Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Technical training involves complex steps and interconnected processes to master productivity. Leave the hard stuff to us! Stunning graphics and engaging voice promote lasting learning retention.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_43 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Start Your [gradient]Workplace Compliance[/gradient] Training Program Today\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','Workplace Compliance Training','','publish','closed','closed','','workplace-compliance-training','','','2026-03-17 04:51:05','2026-03-17 04:51:05','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=406',0,'page','',0),(407,1,'2026-02-09 02:38:49','2026-02-09 02:38:49','','Workplace Compliance Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','406-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 02:38:49','2026-02-09 02:38:49','',406,'http://localhost:8080/?p=407',0,'revision','',0),(409,1,'2026-02-09 02:39:26','2026-02-09 02:39:26','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eDigital Employee Onboarding Solutions: Engaging eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"It’s exciting to bring new members to the team but the sheer amount of employee onboarding can be overwhelming for any training leader. Corporate core values, employee benefits, and social-type training are just the tip of the iceberg.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn-person onboarding training can be a bit dull (and sucks up a tremendous amount of productive time). Combat employee onboarding training fatigue, make them feel welcome and encourage a connection with the company through interactive visual eLearning for your next onboarding session\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1074,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eHarnessing the Power of Digital Employee Onboarding\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"New hires are the future of any organization. They bring fresh ideas and energy. The first impression matters. Digital employee onboarding sets the stage for success. Ninja Tropic understands this. We help you craft a seamless onboarding experience through effective eLearning training.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Digital Employee Onboarding?\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Digital employee onboarding is the process of welcoming new employees into an organization using technology. It involves providing necessary information, training, and resources to help new hires quickly become productive members of the team.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining online creates the first experience any any new hire. It allows new employees to learn at their own pace and access information whenever they need it. This can be especially helpful for remote or hybrid work environments.\\r\\n\\r\\nSpeeding up employees ready for production is a key goal of digital onboarding. By providing targeted training and resources, new hires can learn essential skills and knowledge more efficiently. This can reduce the time it takes for them to become fully productive contributors to the organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1120,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Give Your <em>New Hires</em> a Best-in-Class Experience</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make onboarding exciting. We know first impressions matter. That’s why we focus on creating interactive eLearning experiences that resonate with new hires.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our eLearning courses are designed to make learning easy. We break down complex information into bite-sized lessons, making it simple for new employees to grasp and retain key knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our video training production team brings onboarding to life. We create dynamic and informative videos that help new employees quickly understand their role within the organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We cover a wide range of topics – from compliance training to leadership development. We also offer instructional design strategy consultations to help you create a comprehensive and effective onboarding program that aligns with your organizational goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Partner with Ninja Tropic and give your new hires the best possible start. We’ll create a digital onboarding experience that fosters a sense of belonging, accelerates learning, and sets your employees up for success from day one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container ninja-sticky-columns\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container ninja-sticky-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading py-3\"><strong>Benefits of <em>Digital Onboarding</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our Digital Onboarding offers numerous benefits for both new hires and organizations. In the context of eLearning, it provides several key advantages:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Increased efficiency:</strong><br>Digital onboarding streamlines the onboarding process, reducing paperwork and administrative tasks. This allows new hires to focus on learning and development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Improved accessibility:</strong></strong><br>ELearning modules can be accessed anytime, anywhere, providing flexibility for new hires to learn at their own pace. This is especially beneficial for remote or hybrid work environments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Enhanced engagement:</strong></strong> <br>Interactive eLearning experiences can make the onboarding process more engaging and memorable. This can help new hires feel more connected to the organization and its culture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Improved knowledge retention:</strong><br>ELearning often incorporates multimedia elements, such as videos and simulations, which can enhance learning and retention. This ensures that new hires are equipped with the necessary knowledge and skills to succeed in their roles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Cost-effective:</strong><br>Digital onboarding can be more cost-effective than traditional methods, as it eliminates the need for physical training materials and travel expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBest Tools for Digital \\u003cem\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our customized onboarding modules act as a central hub, guiding new hires through the process with interactive modules, informative videos, and essential resources. We streamline LMS administration, making it easy to deliver and track onboarding progress. Our microlearning approach ensures content is easily digestible and engaging, maximizing knowledge retention.\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4 my-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eDigital Employee Onboarding in Tech Companies\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The fast-paced world of tech demands an onboarding process that’s both efficient and engaging. Ninja Tropic understands the unique challenges of tech companies and tailors our solutions to meet your specific needs. We create onboarding experiences that quickly immerse new hires in your company culture and equip them with the skills and knowledge needed to hit the ground running. From role-specific training to compliance modules, we ensure your new employees are productive from day one.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1149,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eImplementing a Digital Employee Onboarding Strategy\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"A successful digital onboarding strategy requires careful planning and execution. Ninja Tropic is your partner every step of the way. We’ll help you assess your needs, design a tailored strategy, implement it seamlessly, and provide ongoing support to ensure its effectiveness. Our instructional design expertise guarantees an engaging and impactful experience that leaves a lasting impression on your new hires. With Ninja Tropic, you can rest assured that your onboarding process is optimized for success.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1151,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Cobs Bread\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1155,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Trupanion\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1156,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Saks Fifth Avenue\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1157,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eTechnical Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Technical training involves complex steps and interconnected processes to master productivity. Leave the hard stuff to us! Stunning graphics and engaging voice promote lasting learning retention.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','Employee Onboarding Training','','publish','closed','closed','','employee-onboarding-training','','','2026-03-21 15:54:53','2026-03-21 15:54:53','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=409',0,'page','',0),(410,1,'2026-02-09 02:39:26','2026-02-09 02:39:26','','Employee Onboarding Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','409-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 02:39:26','2026-02-09 02:39:26','',409,'http://localhost:8080/?p=410',0,'revision','',0),(412,1,'2026-02-09 02:40:09','2026-02-09 02:40:09','<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCustom Competency Based Training Solutions – Award Winning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1164,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDoes your workforce need training that builds \\u003cem\\u003ereal world skills\\u003c/em\\u003e?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Traditional training methods often focus on content delivery, but competency-based training ensures employees gain the knowledge and skills they need to perform. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we design engaging learning experiences that drive measurable results.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur approach helps organizations bridge skill gaps, boost performance, and achieve business outcomes. We don’t just train employees—we transform them into confident, capable professionals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eDeveloping Competency-Based Training and Development Programs\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Competency-based training (CBT) focuses on mastery. Employees learn at their own pace, demonstrating competence before moving forward. Unlike passive learning, competency-based training is practical, interactive, and skill-focused.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt Ninja Tropic eLearning, we build competency-based programs designed for modern learners. We prioritize engagement, blending video, gamification, and interactive scenarios. Our custom training solutions align with job roles, ensuring learners develop skills they can immediately apply.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1167,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container ninja-sticky-columns\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container ninja-sticky-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-3\"><strong><strong>How We Build <em>Competency-Based</em> Training:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Needs Analysis:</strong><br>We identify key competencies and performance gaps</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Engaging Learning Paths:</strong></strong><br>We design structured, interactive training journeys.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Enhanced engagement:</strong></strong> <br>Interactive eLearning experiences can make the onboarding process more engaging and memorable. This can help new hires feel more connected to the organization and its culture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Assessment &amp; Feedback:</strong><br>We measure skills through real world applications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong><br>We refine programs based on learner performance.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eUnderstanding Competency-Based Training and Development\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Competency-based training isn’t about hours spent in training. It’s about skill mastery. Employees must demonstrate they can apply what they’ve learned before progressing.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis approach benefits organizations because it ensures employees gain practical, job-ready skills. It also benefits learners by providing personalized, self-paced learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt Ninja Tropic eLearning, we structure training to reinforce knowledge retention and skill application. Our courses integrate real world scenarios, making learning engaging, efficient, and impactful.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1171,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Deliver <em>Competency-Based</em> Training to Your Team, Right to Their Smartphones</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modern learners demand accessibility. Employees don’t want to sit in a classroom for hours. They need training that fits into their work schedules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That’s why&nbsp;<strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning</strong>&nbsp;delivers&nbsp;<strong>mobile-friendly, bite-sized training</strong>. Your team can learn anytime, anywhere—right from their smartphones or tablets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸<strong>Microlearning Modules:</strong><br>Short, engaging lessons that fit into a busy workday.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactive Scenarios:</strong><br>Simulated experiences that reinforce skills</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>On-Demand Learning:</strong><br>Employees can revisit content whenever they need a refresher.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Gamification:</strong><br>Rewards and challenges that keep learners engaged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1172,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LP-Custom-Competency-Based-Training-Solutions-Award-Winning_2-576x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1172\" style=\"width:auto;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><em>Competency-Based</em> Training Examples</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Wondering what competency-based training looks like? Here are examples of how we bring learning to life – <a href=\"#\">Check out our Portfolio with 100s of examples and case studies! </a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Employees practice real world sales conversations through interactive video simulations.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/D0T-4LMvUik?si=XXbE_F-8XXb8g-Sw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Leadership Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Managers complete scenario-based training to improve decision-making and coaching skills.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/CfYLE9WjtQc\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Technical Skills Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Employees engage in hands-on simulations to master software or equipment.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/ae91ZGbrXXo\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance \\u0026 Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Workers demonstrate knowledge through role-playing exercises and assessments.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/isxxyBBE6yU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">No matter your industry, <em><strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning</strong> </em>creates training that delivers <strong>real world results</strong>.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container-sm\">No matter your industry, <strong><em>Ninja Tropic eLearning</em></strong> creates training that delivers <strong>real world results</strong>.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Your organization needs more than generic training videos. You need engaging, results-driven training solutions. That’s what we deliver at <strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Custom Training Solutions:</strong><br>Tailored programs designed for your workforce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Engaging Learning Experiences:</strong><br>Interactive, high-quality content that learners prefer.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Measurable Outcomes:</strong><br>Training designed to drive performance improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Proven Expertise:</strong><br>We help leading organizations transform their workforce.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm\">Ready to upgrade your employee training? Let’s build a custom competency-based training program that ensures <strong>your employees gain the skills they need to succeed</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button mt-4 mb-6\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\">Schedule a Free call!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Transform Your Training with [gradient]Custom eLearning Solutions[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Competency Based Training','','publish','closed','closed','','competency-based-training','','','2026-03-21 19:14:41','2026-03-21 19:14:41','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=412',0,'page','',0),(413,1,'2026-02-09 02:40:09','2026-02-09 02:40:09','','Competency Based Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','412-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 02:40:09','2026-02-09 02:40:09','',412,'http://localhost:8080/?p=413',0,'revision','',0),(414,1,'2026-02-09 02:40:47','2026-02-09 02:40:47','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSuccessful Sales Enablement Training Strategies That Work\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you need your sales team primed and ready to go with the latest and greatest information about your products, services, and organization – you turn to sales enabled training solutions but… are they working? Do you find your sales team off the phones more than on them trying to complete their sales enablement training plan?\\r\\nIt’s time to integrate a sales training strategy that actually works!\\r\\n\\r\\nWith microlearning strategies in a video-based sales enablement training platform, you can have your sales teams educated on the newest product information and back to doing what they do best in a fraction of the time – making money for the company.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1200,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Sales Enablement?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Sales enablement training gets your team ready and armed with crucial sales and soft skills to inform your current and potential clients with the most up-to-date information about your amazing products and services. Without it, your sales team will be challenged to close the sale and bring in crucial capital for your organization.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt can take the form of instructor-led classroom training, virtual training, or self-paced sales enablement training modules. With a video-based microlearning format, your sales learners will be engaged, entertained, and educated – and back to selling.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1205,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhy You Need a \\u003cem\\u003eSales Enablement \\u003c/em\\u003ePlan\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your current sales team may be comprised of a few top performers and some who may need more time to learn the ropes. Effective sales enablement training gets those newbies and average-performers learning and implementing the new information quickly – improving their performance while limiting time away from their revenue-generating role.\\r\\n\\r\\nA great sales training strategy helps organizations crush their goals, achieve their mission, and drive a high-achieving sales culture among the team which is exactly what sales success looks like.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Create a Training and Enablement Program Rooted in Performance</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well-rounded training and enablement programs not only teach your sales reps how to sell, but it also informs them of the sales process as a whole. When they understand where customers come from and where they’re headed after the sales conversation, they’ll better guide those clients through the buyer’s journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With an effective sales enablement program, your team will feel supported and ready to take on anything that comes their way – a new product, new resources, and new customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>The Crucial Difference Between Sales Enablement &amp; Sales Training</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sure, you can teach your team the script and the rebuttals, but more than sales training is required. With a sales enablement strategy and program, sales training can transition into something much more valuable. Each training module builds upon the next, demonstrating how to use the knowledge and resources to their advantage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ditch the old “how-tos” of sales training and grow your learners into a sales enablement program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur Approach to Sales Enablement\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"An off-the-shelf or basic sales enablement training program isn’t going to cut it. We understand… and that’s why we develop bespoke or custom video-based sales enablement modules designed specifically for your organization and your team.\\r\\n\\r\\nIntegrating your brand, your distinct processes, and your one-of-a-kind structure, our approach to sales enablement is personal.\",\