tion_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Sales Enablement Solutions That Work\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"“Is it really that surprising when sales reps you don’t train, coach or support properly aren’t successful?”\\r\\n― Rob Liano\\r\\n\\r\\nIt’s about time you amped up your sales enablement training. Contact Ninja Tropic and speak with one of our representatives to discuss a bit more about your team and how we can help you crush those sales goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Sales Enablement Training','','publish','closed','closed','','sales-enablement-training','','','2026-03-21 19:30:53','2026-03-21 19:30:53','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=414',0,'page','',0),(415,1,'2026-02-09 02:40:47','2026-02-09 02:40:47','','Sales Enablement Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','414-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 02:40:47','2026-02-09 02:40:47','',414,'http://localhost:8080/?p=415',0,'revision','',0),(418,1,'2026-02-09 02:46:43','2026-02-09 02:46:43','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Safety Training: Online \\u0026 eLearning Solutions\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"As an award-winning provider of custom safety training online , Ninja Tropic is here to help. We’ve been recognized for our innovative approach to eLearning, and our clients consistently experience a significant reduction in workplace accidents and injuries\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1222,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCustomized Safety Training\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team of instructional designers can help you develop customized safety training content aligned to your industry regulations, company culture, and specific training goals. We have a network of subject matter experts (SMEs) we can tap into if needed, and we’ll partner with your internal safety experts and SMEs to ensure the content reflects the specific environments and nuances of your business.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1225,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Custom <em>Safety eLearning</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer a range of eLearning formats to cater to different learning styles and training objectives. Whether you need in-depth training modules or quick refresher courses, we can create a custom program that effectively delivers the essential safety knowledge and skills your employees need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Customized Online Safety Training Courses (SCORM Format):</strong><br>Seamlessly integrate our courses into your existing learning management system (LMS) for easy deployment and tracking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Microlearning Modules:</strong><br> Deliver bite-sized, focused lessons for maximum engagement and knowledge retention</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactive Video Training:</strong><br>Immerse your employees in realistic scenarios with engaging video content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Scenario-Based Learning:</strong><br>Challenge learners with interactive simulations that test their decision-making skills in real-world situations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":560,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/eLearning-Dev-Services-980x2078-1-483x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-560\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container ninja-sticky-columns\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container ninja-sticky-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-3\"><strong><strong><strong>Benefits of Partnering with Us for <em>Safety Training Online</em></strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Customer Education eLearning:</strong><br>Proactive safety education empowers your employees to make safer choices on the job, leading to a significant reduction in workplace accidents, injuries, and associated costs</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Increased Compliance:</strong></strong><br>Ensure your training meets industry standards and regulatory requirements, mitigating legal risks and potential fines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Employee Engagement:</strong><br>Interactive, visually appealing training that captures attention, promotes knowledge retention, and fosters a more positive safety culture within your organization. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Reduced Training Costs:</strong><br>Custom online training eliminates the need for travel and instructor-led training, offering a cost-effective solution that scales easily with your workforce. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Scalability and Flexibility:</strong><br>Easily adapt your training programs as your workforce or safety needs evolve, ensuring your employees are equipped with the most up-to-date safety knowledge. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Measurable Results:</strong></strong><br>Track the effectiveness of your training through learning management systems (LMS) and assessments, allowing you to demonstrate a return on investment (ROI) and continuously improve your training programs.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Create a Training and Enablement Program Rooted in Performance</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fit\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<p>We offer a range of eLearning formats to cater to different learning styles and training objectives. Whether you need in-depth training modules or quick refresher courses, we can create a custom program that effectively delivers the essential safety knowledge and skills your employees need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Needs Assessment:</strong></strong><br>We work closely with you to identify your specific safety training needs, including your target audience, training objectives, regulatory requirements, and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Development &amp; Design:</strong></strong><br>Our team collaborates with you to create a custom curriculum, design engaging learning experiences, and transform content into an interactive online format.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong><strong>Implementation &amp; Support:</strong></strong></strong><br>We will seamlessly integrate your custom safety training program into your existing Learning Management System (LMS) and provide ongoing support to ensure a smooth rollout and user experience.<br><br>🔸 <strong><strong><strong>Evaluation &amp; Continuous Improvement:</strong></strong></strong><br>We will track the effectiveness of your training program through assessments and learner feedback, and use this data to continuously improve your training and ensure it remains relevant and impactful</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Sales [gradient]Enablement Case[/gradient] Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"See how we’ve helped organizations of all sizes improve their safety performance. Check out our case study briefs below or visit our resource center for more information on the largest eLearning portfolio, case studies, and examples\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The N2 Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"American Rental Association\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1238,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"University of Delaware\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1237,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022 data-start=\\u00220\\u0022 data-end=\\u002250\\u0022\\u003eAward-Winning Microlearning Portfolio\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022 data-start=\\u002252\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022218\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"Explore our award-winning portfolio and discover the limitless potential of microlearning solutions designed to engage, educate, and drive results.\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Explore Our Portfolio\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training b