 more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ready to Transform [gradient]Your Training[/gradient]?\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze yo