8080/?page_id=429',0,'page','',0),(430,1,'2026-02-09 17:13:00','2026-02-09 17:13:00','','Custom Healthcare Training Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','429-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:13:00','2026-02-09 17:13:00','',429,'http://localhost:8080/?p=430',0,'revision','',0),(431,1,'2026-02-09 17:13:22','2026-02-09 17:13:22','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCustom Product Knowledge Training – Custom eLearning Solutions\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Ninja Tropic eLearning empowers your team with the customized product knowledge training they need to succeed through engaging and effective training solutions. From interactive online courses to scenario-based simulations, we create tailored programs that boost sales, enhance customer satisfaction, and drive business growth.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1315,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"What is [gradient]Product Knowledge[/gradient] Training?\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Product knowledge training is essential for teams to excel in selling your products. It involves mastering the intricate details, features, benefits, and effective usage of your offerings. By investing in online product knowledge training, you’re empowering your team to become true product experts who can confidently guide customers and build strong relationships. Think of it as equipping your team with the tools they need to shine in their roles and drive business success.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1317,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach to Product Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_pb_gutters1\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_5  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nPosition your sales and marketing teams as product authority figures by pairing appealing graphics and engaging voiceover with the perfect amount of product training content. That’s exactly what we provide. Microlearning for the on-demand skills essential for personal, product, and company success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What are the Key Benefits Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em>?</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fit\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<p><strong>Investing in product knowledge training offers numerous benefits for your business.</strong>&nbsp;It empowers your team to become product experts, boosting sales, enhancing customer satisfaction, and improving team morale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Boost Sales</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work closely with you to identify your specific safety training needs, including your target audience, training objectives, regulatory requirements, and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Happy Customers:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Fewer Returns:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Efficient Onboarding:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New hires get up to speed faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Increased Customer Satisfaction:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When teams are knowledgeable about products, they can provide better support and assistance, leading to happier customers who are more likely to return and recommend your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Improved Team Morale:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Investing in training shows employees that their development is valued, boosting morale and motivation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><strong><em>Ninja Tropic eLearning</em></strong>&nbsp;can help you achieve these benefits and more. Our expert team will work with you to create tailored product knowledge training programs that meet your specific needs.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Different Types Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em> for Different Teams</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSales Teams\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"Product knowledge training can help sales teams close more deals by equipping them with the tools to effectively address customer concerns and present the product’s value proposition.\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1330,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eMarketing Teams:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nProduct knowledge training can help marketing teams develop more effective messaging and positioning strategies by understanding the product’s unique features and benefits.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1345,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCustomer Service:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"Product knowledge training can help customer service teams provide exceptional support by mastering troubleshooting techniques, handling inquiries efficiently, and understanding the product’s intricacies.\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1346,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eGeneral Employees:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_8 modulo-mas\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_14 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nProviding product knowledge training to all employees can help create a more informed and engaged workforce, leading to improved customer satisfaction and overall business performance.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_5 et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_9\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_15 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1344,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong><strong>Types of Product <em>Knowledge Training</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eSynchronous and asynchronous product training\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We collaborate with your subject matter experts (SMEs) to develop customized synchronous blended learning plans. This approach combines the best of both worlds, offering real-time instruction with interactive elements, while leveraging the expertise of your SMEs to provide relevant and engaging content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1102,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eOnline courses\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our online courses are designed to provide a comprehensive and structured learning experience. They include interactive elements, quizzes, and assessments to ensure learners fully grasp the material. We specialize in creating engaging and informative courses that cater to different learning styles.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1360,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eTraining videos\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our training videos are concise, informative, and visually appealing. We use high-quality production techniques and clear explanations to make complex topics easy to understand. Our team of experienced video producers ensures that our videos are engaging and effective.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1361,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eMicrolearning models\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_22 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOur microlearning modules are short, focused lessons that deliver essential information in a digestible format. They’re perfect for busy teams who need to learn on the go or for reinforcing key concepts.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_23 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1362,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eJust-in-time training\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our just-in-time training provides learners with the information they need exactly when they need it. This can be through on-demand access to training materials or personalized coaching sessions. We tailor our just-in-time training to address specific challenges and improve performance.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1363,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eScenario-based training\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our scenario-based training simulations place learners in realistic situations to help them apply their knowledge and skills. We create engaging scenarios that mimic common challenges and provide opportunities for practice and feedback. Our scenario-based training is designed to improve decision-making, problem-solving, and overall performance.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1149,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Product Knowledge Training Examples\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Connected Nation\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1369,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Pickwell\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1368,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1367,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSafety Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"In every work environment, safety is the top priority. Team members should return home safely. Engaging visuals and compelling explanations are key to capturing attention and ensuring knowledge retention.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1372,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Laws and regulations are top of mind for executives but often overlooked by employees. Combat compliance training grumbles with engaging video-based eLearning for effective knowledge retention.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":643,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Product Training','','publish','closed','closed','','product-training','','','2026-03-21 22:28:07','2026-03-21 22:28:07','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=431',0,'page','',0),(432,1,'2026-02-09 17:13:22','2026-02-09 17:13:22','','Product Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','431-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:13:22','2026-02-09 17:13:22','',431,'http://localhost:8080/?p=432',0,'revision','',0),(433,1,'2026-02-09 17:13:49','2026-02-09 17:13:49','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInteractive Technical Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Technical learning processes, step-by-step procedures, and complex undertakings that are integral to a company’s bottom line cannot be left to a boring, traditional slide deck. When effective training is crucial to employees being able to do their job well – it’s time to evolve in the way you educate them. Video-based eLearning aligns with employee preferences and attention to ensure each team member’s technical procedural mastery.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1376,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"stretch\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-stretch container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1378,\"aspectRatio\":\"1\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Technical-Training-2_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-281x300.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1378\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Advantages of Technical Training</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bullet points and still images don’t offer the 65% majority of visual learners a true demonstration of technical processes. Animated, visually-focused specialized training reaches employees faster and more effectively while seeing how the procedure is performed and applying that knowledge. When was the last time you were able to follow a complex set of process steps without seeing it done? Exactly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not to mention, operational cost savings are often associated with extensive on-the-job instruction. This is where a robust technical learning procedure comes into play.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our Approach\\r\\nNot only does visual demonstration maximize effectiveness, but interactivity seals the deal. It’s not enough to learn a technical process, but the application of that process is key to achieving corporate and personal objectives – and that’s exactly what our visual-based eLearning provides.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"TradeDesk\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1393,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"SCCT\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1392,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Kaplan\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1391,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eMarketing \\u0026 Communications Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Marketing is key to embedding your brand in the minds of customers. Train your team on the latest trends with engaging microlearning instead of outdated slide decks for better results.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1398,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eMachine Learning\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Safety is crucial for physical workers, achieved through education and knowledge. Engaging animated eLearning modules clearly demonstrate safe machine operation and maintenance for all workers.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":1397,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eLeadership\\r\\nDevelopment Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"As society evolves, so do leadership needs. Executives have little time for development training, making interactive, video-based microlearning the best choice for effective leadership growth.\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":784,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Technical Training','','publish','closed','closed','','technical-training','','','2026-03-21 22:50:28','2026-03-21 22:50:28','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=433',0,'page','',0),(434,1,'2026-02-09 17:13:49','2026-02-09 17:13:49','','Technical Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','433-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:13:49','2026-02-09 17:13:49','',433,'http://localhost:8080/?p=434',0,'revision','',0),(436,1,'2026-02-09 17:14:07','2026-02-09 17:14:07','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eMarketing and Communication Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Marketing and communication can be considered the backbone of the bottom line. Without adequately trained employees, customers are not offered the omni experience they demand in this ever-changing e-commerce world.\\r\\n\\r\\nContinuous training is crucial to keeping up with the industry and essential for creating an effective marketing and communication strategy for every business but the age-old instruction methods no longer cut it. Give your marketing employees the directive they need to help your organization skyrocket success with engaging learning solutions that produce revenue-boosting results.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1402,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null,\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1404,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ILU_COMMUNICATIONFOSTERS_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-1024x610.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1404\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Communication Fosters Clarity in Every Organization</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we jump (with both feet) into a digitally-centered world without looking back, clear and impactful marketing and communication strategies play a crucial role in the success of businesses. It’s not enough to create a revolutionary product or service and expect customers to find, and flock to it with unquestionable force – it must be marketed and communicated to customers in ever-evolving ways. With one finger on the pulse of customer preferences, marketing and communication teams require continual training to remain competitive in the age of e-commerce – with absolute clarity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Evolution of industry trends demands evolution of training methodology. Through a visual, engaging approach to learning solutions, microlearning provides the perfect storm of effectiveness and productivity where marketing and communication team members benefit from fast, focused training that is jam-packed with content that sets them up for success. Less unproductive time with multiplied impact creates the perfect combo for marketing and communication employee development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eWe Help You Build a Stronger Brand\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We pair innovation with effectiveness and cater to every diverse learning style in every diverse employee. Our top-rated, innovative video production team gets to work transforming your custom content into an engagement-driven learning solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"SocialRep\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1409,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"InMobi\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1410,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Future (Arrow)\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1411,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Marketing employees need thorough product training to create effective content and boost sales. Video-based training equips them to learn quickly and promote your amazing products efficiently.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":936,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSales Enablement Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"On-the-job training can only take employees so far. With engaging sales enablement training, your team can sell effectively. Invest in microlearning for concise, entertaining, and impactful training!\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":1416,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eBrand Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"To achieve corporate objectives, employees must understand the mission, vision, and values. Ditch old talking points for engaging eLearning that promotes social responsibility and inclusion.\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":935,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Marketing Communication Training','','publish','closed','closed','','marketing-communication-training','','','2026-03-21 23:00:55','2026-03-21 23:00:55','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=436',0,'page','',0),(437,1,'2026-02-09 17:14:07','2026-02-09 17:14:07','','Marketing Communication Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','436-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:14:07','2026-02-09 17:14:07','',436,'http://localhost:8080/?p=437',0,'revision','',0),(438,1,'2026-02-09 17:14:32','2026-02-09 17:14:32','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eLeadership Development Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Great leadership can grow a company from the ground up, but when leadership is thrown into their role with little direction, things can go south quickly. Morale decreases, production halts, and the company’s bottom line plummets when newly-appointed leadership is unaware of how to actually lead a team. Prepare your new leaders with meaningful leadership development training and equip them with the tools needed for whole-company prosperity.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1420,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1422,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LDT_Effective-e1678296214885-1024x589.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1422\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><em>Effective Leaders</em> Develop Themselves While Developing Others</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we jump (with both feet) into a digitally-centered world without looking back, clear and impactful marketing and communication strategies play a crucial role in the success of businesses. It’s not enough to create a revolutionary product or service and expect customers to find, and flock to it with unquestionable force – it must be marketed and communicated to customers in ever-evolving ways. With one finger on the pulse of customer preferences, marketing and communication teams require continual training to remain competitive in the age of e-commerce – with absolute clarity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Evolution of industry trends demands evolution of training methodology. Through a visual, engaging approach to learning solutions, microlearning provides the perfect storm of effectiveness and productivity where marketing and communication team members benefit from fast, focused training that is jam-packed with content that sets them up for success. Less unproductive time with multiplied impact creates the perfect combo for marketing and communication employee development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our Approach\\r\\nWe believe in great leadership and that starts with great instruction. With 77% of businesses reporting that their leadership is lacking, it’s time to evolve in the way we teach leaders to guide their team. The old traditional methods of instruction are no longer effective and learning leaders have been searching for new methodology. We’ve got the solution.\\r\\n\\r\\nExecutives have little time left in the day for personal and leadership development that’s dull and doesn’t demonstrate the tools or how to use them. Packing content into short, visually-appealing, scenario-based learning solutions could be the path to a productive team and supportive leadership.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Cybersecurity Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"USA Swimming\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1423,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Dale Carnegie\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1425,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Small Business Administration\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1424,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSoft Skills Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Need eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning offers the flexibility to learn anywhere, anytime, giving your team the freedom to learn on their own terms and at their own pace.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1429,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eWorkplace Harassment Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s the ideal solution for hands-on learners!\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":1428,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_so