02-09 17:17:16','','Patient Education','','publish','closed','closed','','patient-education','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?p=445',27,'nav_menu_item','',0),(446,1,'2026-02-09 17:18:36','2026-02-09 17:18:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCybersecurity Awareness Training for Employees\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"The dangers to your business don’t stop at safety issues, legalities, and a changing market – business owners and leadership must also dodge online hackers who have become more savvy as technology advances.\\r\\n\\r\\nCybersecurity awareness training is a must-have for every business to fend off attackers and keep your organization and customer data out of malicious hands – maintaining your reputation as a trusted business partner.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1431,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Cybersecurity Awareness Training?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"So many business owners avoid cybersecurity,,, until they’ve been hacked and it’s entirely too late. Cybersecurity awareness training arms your team with the knowledge and skills to spot, report, and avoid a catastrophic data breach.\\r\\n\\r\\nCybersecurity awareness training is just one more layer of protection against organizational vulnerabilities because let’s face it – humans are… well, human.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1434,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CT_HowToProtect-1024x919.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1434\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Protect Your Business with <em>CyberSecurity Training</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a world of remote work, there are a slew of risks for organizations including phishing, weak network security, social engineering, and compromised passwords. Prepare your business for any potential attacks with a high-level of education for every employee, contractor, and intern.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Humans are both fallible and valuable so make sure they are your shield of protection against devastating cyber attacks with engaging video-based cybersecurity awareness training that includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 How to stay safe from threats while working remotely<br>🔸 Password creation tips<br>🔸 How to spot and report phishing attempts<br>🔸 Installing a firewall to block shady websites<br>🔸 Protecting your emails with an automatic spam blocker</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of<em> Cybersecurity Training</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cybersecurity training offers the confidence your employees need to work with conviction and control over their own projects without the fear of catastrophic risk and vulnerabilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply knowing what to look for and how to report it within your organization gives them the tools they need and the knowledge they seek to remain aware of potential cybersecurity risks – and make solid decisions on your behalf.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That means… You need solid cybersecurity training that excites your learners and visually speaks to them with content unique to your organization so – off the shelf products just aren’t going to cut it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong>Common <em>Digital Threats</em> for Businesses</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To protect your business and your customers, it’s crucial that leadership and employees alike can recognize common digital threats. Keep the following on your radar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Phishing<br>🔸 Whaling<br>🔸 Ransomware<br>🔸 Malware<br>🔸 Wi-Fi and Home Network Security<br>🔸 Password Policies<br>🔸 Email Security</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Cybersecurity Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Willis College\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1443,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Drip 7 SANS\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1444,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"SANS\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1445,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSafety Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"In every work environment, safety is the top priority. Team members should return home safely. Engaging visuals and compelling explanations are key to capturing attention and ensuring knowledge retention.\\r\\n\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1372,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Laws and regulations are top of mind for executives but often overlooked by employees. Combat compliance training grumbles with engaging video-based eLearning for effective knowledge retention.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":643,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"How to Get Started with a [gradient]Cybersecurity Employee Training[/gradient] Program\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Whether you employ 1 or 100,000 people, every business needs a strong cybersecurity training program to ensure your business stays protected, remains safe, and stays in business. One data breach could result in years of recovery and millions of dollars spent.\\r\\n\\r\\nContact Ninja Tropic to chat about your cybersecurity training for employees and let’s protect you and your life’s work.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Cybersecurity Training','','publish','closed','closed','','cybersecurity-training','','','2026-03-21 23:31:32','2026-03-21 23:31:32','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=446',0,'page','',0),(447,1,'2026-02-09 17:18:36','2026-02-09 17:18:36','','Cybersecurity Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','446-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:18:36','2026-02-09 17:18:36','',446,'http://localhost:8080/?p=447',0,'revision','',0),(449,1,'2026-02-09 17:18:59','2026-02-09 17:18:59','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eBest Diversity \\u0026 Inclusion Training eLearning Company\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Diversity, equity, and inclusion training is an integral piece of education that benefits every employee at every corporation but developing it can feel overwhelming and confusing. How do you ensure that every team member feels represented and included? You hire the pros.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic is an award-winning video-based education development and consulting company that has perfected the art of DEI training development and delivery to make sure your team understands what diversity, equity, and inclusion mean, how to integrate crucial behaviors and mentalities into daily operations and produce the best of the best from every single human.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1450,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is <em>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion</em> Training</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to understand how diversity, equity, and inclusion fit into your company, it’s essential to define each.<br>Diversity describes the things or characteristics that make people awesomely different from others, varied in talents and experience, and just who they are as a human. It could include things like gender, sexual orientation, ethnicity, age, religion, socioeconomic status, disability, and veteran status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equity is often confused with equality (which means treating everyone equally) but is a bit different in its definition. Equity refers to ensuring that every person during the hiring process and daily operations of the company – begins at the same starting line.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It removes existing barriers. For example, a wheelchair handicapable person cannot perform their best if offered a standard desk height and the walkways within the company are not wide enough for a wheelchair to comfortably travel the office. In short, equity is fairness, justice, and impartiality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inclusion expresses a welcoming environment for all which promotes each team member to feel comfortable sharing their ideas, contributions, and gifts with support and respect. Without inclusion, employees may not feel valued and do not offer their best during collaborative assignments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>DEI training instructs all members of the team to treat others in accordance with these key behaviors to ensure a great working environment for all, a top-shelf level of productivity, and a reduced attrition rate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1452,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1452\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhy You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\r\\nNot only does an inclusive and culturally diverse workplace create that positive working environment for all team members, when each employee feels valued, it attracts high-quality talent, provides equal opportunities for everyone, and motivates each human to perform at their very best with innovative ideas and a higher productivity rate.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe most effective way to achieve those goals is relatable diversity, equity, and inclusion training that appeals to the emotional connection of people. If you’re not sure where to begin in developing your DEI training, look no further. We’ve got your back.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1458,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OUR-APPROACH-3-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1458\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><em>Our Approach</em> to Diversity Training Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We ask the tough questions, get to the root of your unique perspective, and work tirelessly to customize a DEI training program that exceeds every expectation because that’s what we do. We see employees as humans and not as numbers on a spreadsheet and when it comes to diversity, equity, and inclusion training, you need a professional to appeal to the human factor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re not here to talk about awards (we’ve got a LOT of them), or how awesomely talented our team is (they are), but we understand that our clients are putting a lot of responsibility in our hands. Our experience will show for itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Diversity Training \\u0026 Inclusion Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"View Case Studie\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1461,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eTechnical Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Technical training involves complex steps and interconnected processes to master productivity. Leave the hard stuff to us! Stunning graphics and engaging voice promote lasting learning retention.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":644,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started With [gradient]Diversity Training Services[/gradient] for Employees\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Whether you employ 1 or 100,000 people, every business needs a strong cybersecurity training program to ensure your business stays protected, remains safe, and stays in business. One data breach could result in years of recovery and millions of dollars spent.\\r\\n\\r\\nContact Ninja Tropic to chat about your cybersecurity training for employees and let’s protect you and your life’s work.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Diversity And Inclusion Training','','publish','closed','closed','','diversity-and-inclusion-training','','','2026-03-22 00:11:29','2026-03-22 00:11:29','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=449',0,'page','',0),(450,1,'2026-02-09 17:18:59','2026-02-09 17:18:59','','Diversity And Inclusion Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','449-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:18:59','2026-02-09 17:18:59','',449,'http://localhost:8080/?p=450',0,'revision','',0),(451,1,'2026-02-09 17:19:34','2026-02-09 17:19:34','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.\\r\\nCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Educational Simulation Software?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Taking a real-to-life software simulation and embedding it into training offers learners the experience of a practical approach without risk to the company. Making mistakes and finding success in a simulation-type environment offers a unique learning experience unmatched by traditional training methodology.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith such impeccable positive learning statistics measured with educational simulation software as a training technique, it’s a win-win for both the organization and its team members.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Use <em>Simulation Software</em> for Training &amp; Education</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether opting for an augmented or virtual reality experience, gamified simulation, or a simple test drive of the software in a video-based eLearning format, specific applications and methods are varied and should be more targeted to the unique type of software and systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Depending on the process from safety to tech, integrating hands-on experiences for your learners greatly increases content retention and in turn, the company’s success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Virtual<br><em>Training and Simulation </em>Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The benefits of using virtual training and simulation training for your attendees are vast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This learning and training practice allows for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Improved confidence of the learner<br>🔸 Hands-on practice without risk<br>🔸 Increased safety and knowledge<br>🔸 True-to-life experiences<br>🔸 Immediate feedback without manual intervention to guide success<br>🔸 Gaining measurable success data and knowledge retention</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container-sm\">Training <em>Simulation Software</em><br>Portfolio &amp; Examples</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1474,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/PORTA_LexisNexis-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1474\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">LexisNexis</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1475,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Segment-1280x720-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1475\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Segment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"How to Get Started With Training Simulation Software for eLearning\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"It’s time to give your team members the training they need to hit the ground running when the new system or process is luanched internally with simulation training and Ninja Tropic has the best developers and artist in the field. Complete the form below so one of our knowledgeable staff can reach the right person and discuss exactly what you need to transorm your learning methods into something that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSimulation-Based Training FAQ’s\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\n🔸 How do i include simulation in eLearning training programs?\\r\\n\\r\\n🔸 What is simulation in eLearning?\\r\\n\\r\\n🔸 How much does eLearning simulation software cost?\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Software Simulation','','publish','closed','closed','','software-simulation','','','2026-03-22 00:05:56','2026-03-22 00:05:56','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=451',0,'page','',0),(452,1,'2026-02-09 17:19:34','2026-02-09 17:19:34','','Software Simulation','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:19:34','2026-02-09 17:19:34','',451,'http://localhost:8080/?p=452',0,'revision','',0),(453,1,'2026-02-09 17:20:15','2026-02-09 17:20:15','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eNinja Tropic: A Soft Skills Training Company for eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Communication is essential for every organization that serves customers or works in a collaborative environment and that means – you need solid soft skills training. Ninja Tropic, an award-winning development, coaching, and training service-providing company can take your team members’ soft skill development from awkward to awe-inspiring and amp up those sales numbers.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1479,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null,\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>What is <em>Soft Skills </em>Training</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Why Use <em>Soft Skills </em>Training in Your Company?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s hard to check the boxes on whether or not someone has mastered soft skills because they are often thought of as “innate talents.” However, with adequate instruction and continual practice, we believe that soft skills training can be learned and perfected over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If not, imagine the lack of awesome sales team members, customer service employees, and collaborative in-house teams that get things done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1487,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-322-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1487\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use<em> Soft Skills</em> Training for Employees in the Workplace</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat Are the Benefits of Soft Skill Development?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Soft skills training is an impactful way to build solid, positive relationships both internally and with clientele. I can nudge people outside their comfort zones, where the magic happens and innovation lives while strengthening their interpersonal skills to create a strategy for raking in the profit.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Soft Skills Development Training Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Cornerstone Foundation\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1490,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"AsylumWorks\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1491,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":949,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started With Soft Skill Training \\u0026 Development\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ninja Tropic is a leading, award-winning video-based training development company that also specializes in custom soft skills training creation, learning and development coaching, and learning consultation services. Your one-stop-shop for all bespoke learning because when it’s tailored to exactly what you need, it’s just better (and more effective).\\r\\n\\r\\nReach out today and let’s chat about what you need and how we can introduce soft skills training with an impact on your existing learning and development curriculum.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Soft Skills Training','','publish','closed','closed','','soft-skills-training','','','2026-03-22 00:14:48','2026-03-22 00:14:48','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=453',0,'page','',0),(454,1,'2026-02-09 17:20:15','2026-02-09 17:20:15','','Soft Skills Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','453-revision-v1','','','2026-02-09 17:20:15','2026-02-09 17:20:15','',453,'http://localhost:8080/?p=454',0,'revision','',0),(455,1,'2026-02-09 17:20:36','2026-02-09 17:20:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eeLearning Harassment Training for Employees In the Workplace\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"We’ve all seen the 80s workplace harassment videos that forces new hires to sit in a room with countless colleagues and an old VCR and consume some very outdated training that does check the boxes, but does not reflect the current issues faced in today’s workplace.\\r\\n\\r\\nEvery person within the workplace deserves harassment-free working conditions and this mandatory, integral training must be transparent, honest, concise, respectful, and state (without question) the company policy on workplace harassment.\\r\\n\\r\\nSensitive topics like these can make team members feel a bit awkward watching in front of coworkers. Still, when transformed into powerful eLearning harassment training, employees can interact with their learning modules where they feel the most comfortable and focused.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1494,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>The Importance of <em>Harassment Prevention</em> Training for Employees</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Providing effective harassment prevention training keeps the organization protected from legal ramifications while keeping team members safe from mistreatment, unwanted sexual advances, workplace bullying, discrimination, and abuses of power.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>Prior to developing workplace harassment learning modules, learning leaders should identify their current weak points and opportunities for education – and that’s exactly what we do. We assist in finding the most crucial topics relevant to your organization, develop impactful and lasting messages, and format the content into real-life scenarios and visually-appealing eLearning presentations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Benefits of Online Interactive eLearning <em>Harassment Training</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learning leaders worldwide strive to find a way to deliver this training, but still keep the human element and ensure retention of the content. To drive the message of securing a safe workplace, recognizing harassing behaviors, and ensuring the mental and emotional comfort of attending this type of sensitive training, online eLearning Harassment Training is exactly the answer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our process is both delicate to the needs and preferences of all attendees, yet powerful enough to keep your organization on the right side of the law – avoiding liabilities and with an interactive online learning format, attendees have the flexibility to take the training alone, at home, in the office, or within a group for further discussion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eTechnical Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Technical training involves complex steps and interconnected processes to master productivity. Leave the hard stuff to us! Stunning graphics and engaging voice promote lasting learning retention.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":644,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started With [gradient]Diversity Training Services[/gradient] for Employees\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Whether you employ 1 or 100,000 people, every business needs a strong cybersecurity training program to ensure your business stays protected, remains safe, and stays in business. One data breach could result in years of recovery and millions of dollars spent.\\r\\n\\r\\nContact Ninja Tropic to chat about your cybersecurity training for employees and let’s protect you and your life’s work.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_star