and icons to create engaging visual content. It is a popular style for eLearning as it enhances the effectiveness of the learning experience by promoting engagement, aiding in memory retention, and improving comprehension. Kinetic typography can be used to emphasize important points, demonstrate concepts, and make information more digestible for learners. Paired with an eLearning design that aligns with learners, it can help to make learning more interesting, interactive, and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223953/16f9abb31e?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/821223953/16f9abb31e?fl=pl&amp;fe=sh\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Text and shapes</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1902,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Q0.1-1024x383.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1902\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Icons and elements</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1903,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Q0.2-1024x383.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp