competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":6513} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Our-Process-vertical.webp\" alt=\"Instructional Design Services\" class=\"wp-image-6513\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Game-Based Learning and Gamification:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Making learning fun and motivating.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microlearning:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bite-sized modules for focused, knowledge retention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mobile Learning:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accessible&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/mobile-learning/\">learning on any device</a>, anytime, anywhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Corporate Training Video Production:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accessible learning on any device, anytime, anywhere.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2026-03-06 19:27:56','2026-03-06 19:27:56','',347,'http://localhost:8080/?p=633',0,'revision','',0),(634,1,'2026-03-06 19:28:23','2026-03-06 19:28:23','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\