odules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2026-03-06 19:56:17','2026-03-06 19:56:17','',347,'http://localhost:8080/?p=638',0,'revision','',0),(639,1,'2026-03-06 20:00:36','2026-03-06 20:00:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and