2d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"anchor\":\"contact-form\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our <em>Process</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\">Our process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\">Check our customer success stories!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->','Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','347-revision-v1','','','2026-03-06 20:00:36','2026-03-06 20:00:36','',347,'http://localhost:8080/?p=639',0,'revision','',0),(640,1,'2026-03-06 20:03:38','2026-03-06 20:03:38','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"da