modules can be used for skills refreshers, new policy updates, and product knowledge training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gamification:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe in the power of gamification to enhance learning experiences. Our gamified content incorporates points, badges, and leaderboards to motivate learners and track progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Custom Assessments:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer custom assessments tailored to your specific training goals, with a variety of question types to measure knowledge retention and application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Custom Mobile Learning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','337-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 01:54:31','2026-03-07 01:54:31','',337,'http://localhost:8080/?p=676',0,'revision','',0),(677,1,'2026-03-07 01:55:14','2026-03-07 01:55:14','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Mobile learning solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Mobile learning is no longer a “nice-to-have.” It’s a must-have business learning solution. It’s the key to unlocking a more engaged, effective, and efficient workforce. And with Ninja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions, you can harness the power of interactive video to deliver training that truly resonates.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":657,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"