99a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCombining the best of both worlds, in-person instruction with a side of eLearning has the ability to provide interaction with an extremely effective follow-up for content retention. Reaching those who prefer something a bit more structured to those who want the freedom to learn when they can focus their time on the material, blended learning engages them all.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":728,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eModern blended eLearning solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We understand that every organization is unique. That’s why our approach is flexible and adaptable, ensuring your online training program perfectly aligns with your specific goals and challenges.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eBlended\\u003c/em\\u003e (Hybrid) Learning Solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we put the learner first. Every journey is unique. We tailor our blended learning experiences to each individual by focusing on user experience and learner access. We use our expertise in instructional design, interactive video, and microlearning and blend this with dynamic instructor lead training. This lets us create engaging and effective learning. \\r\\n\\r\\nOur goal is simple: upskill learners to achieve business goals and their full potential through dynamic digital learning experiences. We do this through a seamless and enjoyable experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":730,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is ‘\\u003cem\\u003eBlended Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e’?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Think of blended learning as a fusion of flavors with respect to learning strategy. It combines online flexibility with the personal touch of instructor lead learning. This mix enhances learning outcomes. It also caters to the diverse needs of learners. It’s a truly effective and engaging approach to education.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":731,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"da