t_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCombining the best of both worlds, in-person instruction with a side of eLearning has the ability to provide interaction with an extremely effective follow-up for content retention. Reaching those who prefer something a bit more structured to those who want the freedom to learn when they can focus their time on the material, blended learning engages them all.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":728,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eModern blended eLearning solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We understand that every organization is unique. That’s why our approach is flexible and adaptable, ensuring your online training program perfectly aligns with your specific goals and challenges.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eBlended\\u003c/em\\u003e (Hybrid) Learning Solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we put the learner first. Every journey is unique. We tailor our blended learning experiences to each individual by focusing on user experience and learner access. We use our expertise in instructional design, interactive video, and microlearning and blend this with dynamic instructor lead training. This lets us create engaging and effective learning. \\r\\n\\r\\nOur goal is simple: upskill learners to achieve business goals and their full potential through dynamic digital learning experiences. We do this through a seamless and enjoyable experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":730,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is ‘\\u003cem\\u003eBlended Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e’?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Think of blended learning as a fusion of flavors with respect to learning strategy. It combines online flexibility with the personal touch of instructor lead learning. This mix enhances learning outcomes. It also caters to the diverse needs of learners. It’s a truly effective and engaging approach to education.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":731,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>How we approach <em>Blended Learning</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We prioritize user experience. We leverage modern learning tools to create seamless journeys. We balance online and offline activities. This ensures a cohesive and engaging experience for learners. Our approach includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eInteractive SME Lead Videos:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Engaging videos with subject matter experts for personalized instruction.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_container\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eMicrolearning Modules:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_11 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_justified-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Bite-sized lessons for easy digestion of key information.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_container\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eGamified Elements:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Fun elements to motivate learners and boost retention.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_container\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eGamified Elements:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Fun elements to motivate learners and boost retention.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_container\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003ePersonalized Learning Paths:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Tailored experiences based on individual needs.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Discover Our<em> Award-Winning</em> Projects</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Explore our portfolio of award-winning projects that showcase our expertise in Microlearning and Interactive Learning</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check our out work!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eBlended Digital Learning Solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Blended learning offers a wide range of options to fit different learners. Whether you prefer online courses or live webinars, there’s a solution for you. Blended learning can also be customized to meet specific training goals. This makes it flexible and adaptable for all types of organizations. By combining online and in-person learning, blended digital learning empowers learners to achieve their full potential and drive business success.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":747,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container py-6 my-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container py-6 my-6\" id=\"container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"60%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What could ‘Blended Learning’ encompass?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The options are endless! Blended learning can include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸<strong> Online Courses &amp; Modules:</strong><br>Interactive, self-paced training for foundational knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🔸 Live Webinars &amp; Virtual Classrooms:</strong><br>Real-time instructor-led sessions for discussion and collaboration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🔸 In-Person Workshops &amp; Training:</strong><br>Hands-on activities and face-to-face interaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🔸 Microlearning &amp; Performance Support:</strong><br>Bite-sized content for on-the-job learning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>🔸 Gamified Learning:</strong><br>Interactive elements and rewards for increased engagement.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":748,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Choosing-the-Right-LMS-A-Guide-to-Making-an-Informed_Blo10-3-1280x722-1-1024x578.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-748\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container py-y my-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container py-y my-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What could ‘<em>Blended Learning</em>’</strong> <strong>encompass?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><br>encompass?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today’s learners want flexibility and engagement. Blended learning delivers both. It combines the convenience of online learning with the personal touch of in-person interactions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related</strong><em><strong> Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a  [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your association, university, or enterprise’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Blended eLearning Solutions | Ninja Tropic','','inherit','closed','closed','','345-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 15:38:12','2026-03-07 15:38:12','',345,'http://localhost:8080/?p=757',0,'revision','',0),(758,1,'2026-03-07 15:38:28','2026-03-07 15:38:28','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBlended eLearning Solutions – Modern User Experience\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCombining the best of both worlds, in-person instruction with a side of eLearning has the ability to provide interaction with an extremely effective follow-up for content retention. Reaching those who prefer something a bit more structured to those who want the freedom to learn when they can focus their time on the material, blended learning engages them all.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":728,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eModern blended eLearning solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We understand that every organization is unique. That’s why our approach is flexible and adaptable, ensuring your online training program perfectly aligns with your specific goals and challenges.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eBlended\\u003c/em\\u003e (Hybrid) Learning Solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we put the learner first. Every journey is unique. We tailor our blended learning experiences to each individual by focusing on user experience and learner access. We use our expertise in instructional design, interactive video, and microlearning and blend this with dynamic instructor lead training. This lets us create engaging and effective learning. \\r\\n\\r\\nOur goal is simple: upskill learners to achieve business goals and their full potential through dynamic digital learning experiences. We do this through a seamless and enjoyable experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":730,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is ‘\\u003cem\\u003eBlended Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e’?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Think of blended learning as a fusion of flavors with respect to learning strategy. It combines online flexibility with the personal touch of instructor lead learning. This mix enhances learning outcomes. It also caters to the diverse needs of learners. It’s a truly effective and engaging approach to education.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":731,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>How we approach <em>Blended Learning</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We prioritize user experience. We leverage modern learning tools to create seamless journeys. We balance online and offline activities. This ensures a cohesive and engaging experience for learners. Our approach includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eInteractive SME Lead Videos:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Engaging videos with subject matter experts for personalized instruction.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\