image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eBespoke \\u003cem\\u003eeLearning Courses\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners, problems and brand aren’t generic, so why should their training be? We dive deep into your goals, audience, and content to create custom elearning that’s tailor-made for your people, your business drivers, and your desired outcome. Your bespoke courses will spark engagement and drive real behavioral change. Check out the largest portfolio of dynamic eLearning. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":800,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMicrolearning Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners need and prefer quick and accessible online training. Our microlearning solutions offer focused content in short bursts, making it easy for learners to fit training into their busy schedules. Bite sized learning experiences boost knowledge retention and engagement. We are leaders in microlearning development and boast the largest portfolio of microlearning examples. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":803,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eInstructional Design Services \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nOur instructional design consulting starts with a thorough training needs analysis to uncover gaps and align your training with your business goals. We then develop a strategy focused on measurable outcomes, helping you deliver impactful learning that improves performance. Whether you’re struggling with engagement, retention, or aligning training with key objectives, we provide a clear path forward, ensuring your learning initiatives support your team’s success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFull-service course production\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eFrom Concept to Completion\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\r\\nWe handle every aspect of the eLearning development process, from initial concept and design to content creation, development, and deployment. Our full-service approach saves you time and resources, allowing you to focus on what you do best.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFull-service course production\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nFrom Concept to Completion\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We handle every aspect of the eLearning development process, from initial concept and design to content creation, development, and deployment. Our full-service approach saves you time and resources, allowing you to focus on what you do best.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eHigh-quality for tight timelines\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nMeeting Deadlines Without Compromising Quality\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team is adept at delivering high-quality eLearning solutions on tight timelines. We have the team and processes to ensure your training programs launch on schedule and exceed your expectations.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":669,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTransparency in customer service\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eCustom Solutions That Align with Your Goals\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\nWhether you need a single microlearning module or a comprehensive training program, we have the expertise and track record to deliver online learning that is simple, usable, and effective. We collaborate with you to develop eLearning experiences that inspire, educate, and empower your learners.\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e\\t\\r\\nOpen Communication Every Step of the Way\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\nWe believe in open and honest communication. Throughout the eLearning development process, we keep you informed and involved. We value your feedback and strive to exceed your expectations at every turn.\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":812,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBespoke solutions to meet your training needs\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Whether you need a single microlearning module or a comprehensive training program, we have the expertise to deliver custom solutions that align with your training goals. We collaborate with you to develop eLearning experiences that inspire, educate, and empower your learners.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":555,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\