9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eBespoke \\u003cem\\u003eeLearning Courses\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners, problems and brand aren’t generic, so why should their training be? We dive deep into your goals, audience, and content to create custom elearning that’s tailor-made for your people, your business drivers, and your desired outcome. Your bespoke courses will spark engagement and drive real behavioral change. Check out the largest portfolio of dynamic eLearning. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":800,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMicrolearning Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners need and prefer quick and accessible online training. Our microlearning solutions offer focused content in short bursts, making it easy for learners to fit training into their busy schedules. Bite sized learning experiences boost knowledge retention and engagement. We are leaders in microlearning development and boast the largest portfolio of microlearning examples. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\