ause customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\