ropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of <strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 04:09:12','2026-03-12 04:09:12','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=867',0,'revision','',0),(868,1,'2026-03-12 04:09:24','2026-03-12 04:09:24','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom eLearning Development Services\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Looking for \\u003cb\\u003ecustom elearning development\\u003c/b\\u003e that prioritizes \\u003cb\\u003elearner experience\\u003c/b\\u003e and delivers \\u003cb\\u003emeasurable results? \\u003c/b\\u003eWe focus on what your learners really need to know or do, and we design and create elearning solutions that fit your budget and meet your deadline. From bite-sized microlearning to full-blown courses, we’ve got the skills to make your training rock. Our secret? We’re not just creating content, we’re crafting experiences. We infuse our eLearning with storytelling, interactive elements, and real-world scenarios to make learning engaging, memorable, and award-winning.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":798,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eBespoke \\u003cem\\u003eeLearning Courses\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners, problems and brand aren’t generic, so why should their training be? We dive deep into your goals, audience, and content to create custom elearning that’s tailor-made for your people, your business drivers, and your desired outcome. Your bespoke courses will spark engagement and drive real behavioral change. Check out the largest portfolio of dynamic eLearning. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":800,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMicrolearning Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners need and prefer quick and accessible online training. Our microlearning solutions offer focused content in short bursts, making it easy for learners to fit training into their busy schedules. Bite sized learning experiences boost knowledge retention and engagement. We are leaders in microlearning development and boast the largest portfolio of microlearning examples. \",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":803,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eInstructional Design Services \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nOur instructional design consulting starts with a thorough training needs analysis to uncover gaps and align your training with your business goals. We then develop a strategy focused on measurable outcomes, helping you deliver impactful learning that improves performance. Whether you’re struggling with engagement, retention, or aligning training with key objectives, we provide a clear path forward, ensuring your learning initiatives support your team’s success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFull-service course production\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eFrom Concept to Completion\\u003c/h4\\u003