nt/uploads/2026/03/BLOG_82_eLearning_Interactivity_2023_.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(882,1,'2026-03-12 04:36:17','2026-03-12 04:36:17','','ml-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','ml-copia','','','2026-03-12 04:36:17','2026-03-12 04:36:17','',359,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ml-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(883,1,'2026-03-12 04:36:56','2026-03-12 04:36:56','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eHost Lead\\r\\nInstructional Videos\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen it comes to training and educating your employees or customers, you want to ensure that the content you’re delivering is both effective and engaging. After all, the ultimate goal of any training program is to inspire behavior change and drive results for your organization. And what better way to achieve this goal than through the power of video?\\r\\n\\r\\nOur recording host lead instructional videos are designed to deliver results, educate and engage your audience, making it the perfect complement to your existing training programs or a standalone solution. But what sets our instructional videos apart from others on the market? It’s our commitment to customization and flexibility.\\r\\nWe understand that every organization is unique, and that’s why we offer two options to help you create the perfect instructional video: Onsite Filming and Remote Film Options.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":878,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e#1 Onsite Filming\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The first option is to coordinate filming with your subject matter experts. This way, your audience is learning directly from the people who know your industry best.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey will be able to provide real-world examples and insights that will help your audience retain the information better. This option is perfect for organizations that want to showcase the expertise of their team, or for those looking for a more personal and relatable touch.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":880,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eInteractive and Engaging Content\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Regardless of which option you choose, rest assured that our recording host lead instructional videos are more than just talking heads. They are interactive and engaging, designed to keep your audience focused and interested. We incorporate a variety of techniques to keep the content engaging, such as visual aids, interactive quizzes, and animated graphics. Our instructional videos are not only informative but also enjoyable to watch, which helps to keep your audience engaged and invested in the training.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":881,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch1 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_heading\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eDelivering Results\\u003c/em\\u003e That Matter\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"With our recording host lead instructional videos, you can be confident that your audience will receive the education and training they need to succeed. Whether you’re looking to improve customer satisfaction, increase employee productivity, or drive sales, our instructional videos are an effective tool for achieving your goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eA Better Call to Action\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"So, if you’re ready to take your training to the next level and start delivering results that matter, contact us today to learn more about how we can help you achieve your training goals. Our recording host lead instructional videos are the perfect solution for organizations looking for an effective, engaging, and enjoyable way to train their employees or customers. Don’t wait, get started today and see the difference for yourself!\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":882,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Learn more about the Training Needs Analysis on a Free Consultation\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis is a crucial step in the creation of effective e-learning content. Embrace the power of TNA and take your e-learning content to the next level. Start inspiring behavior change and drive results for your organization today.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Live Action Host Video | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','359-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 04:36:56','2026-03-12 04:36:56','',359,'http://localhost:8080/?p=883',0,'revision','',0),(884,1,'2026-03-12 04:38:39','2026-03-12 04:38:39','','atv','','inherit','open','closed','','atv','','','2026-03-12 04:38:39','2026-03-12 04:38:39','',361,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/atv.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(885,1,'2026-03-12 05:23:41','2026-03-12 05:23:41','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAward Winning Custom Animated Training Videos\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCorporate training must do more than just inform—it must engage, educate, and inspire. That’s where custom animated training videos come in. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we specialize in crafting engaging, skill-building animated videos designed to resonate with modern learners. From vibrant visuals to tailored messaging, our award-winning process ensures your training content delivers measurable results. Whether you’re building compliance training, onboarding modules, or product knowledge videos, our approach is designed to achieve real business outcomes.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":884,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation grabs attention and simplifies complex topics, making learning enjoyable and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boost Retention:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Studies show learners remember visual content better than text alone. Animated videos enhance understanding by combining visuals with auditory elements.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Increase Comprehension:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can break down complex concepts into easy-to-understand steps, making it easier for learners to grasp new information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve Focus:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engaging visuals and sound effects can help learners stay focused and reduce distractions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create a Positive Learning Experience:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can make training more fun and enjoyable, which can lead to increased motivation and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facilitate Collaboration:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can be used to spark discussion and collaboration among learners.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enhance Brand Awareness:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can help to build brand awareness and recognition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAnimated videos make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We focus on your learners and desired results by tailoring our approach to their specific needs and preferences. We create engaging and memorable learning experiences that drive real behavior change.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor example, if you want to improve employee onboarding, we’ll create a series of animated videos that welcome new hires, introduce them to the company culture, and teach them the skills they need to be successful. We’ll use relatable characters and scenarios to make the learning experience enjoyable and relevant.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eAnd that’s not all!\\u003c/b\\u003e We offer a full range of services to help you achieve your training goals from start to finish, including \\u003cb\\u003elive action video production\\u003c/b\\u003e,\\u003cb\\u003e instructional design consulting\\u003c/b\\u003e, and more.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":723,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eAnimated videos\\u003c/em\\u003e make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We take pride in having the\\u003cb\\u003e largest portfolio\\u003c/b\\u003e of educational animation examples spanning multiple industries. From healthcare to technology, nonprofits to corporate training, our animations have transformed learning experiences for diverse audiences. Each example showcases our ability to create customized, engaging content that resonates with learners and achieves measurable outcomes. Whether you’re looking for compliance training, onboarding, or product education, our portfolio demonstrates how we bring concepts to life with creativity.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022\\u003eCheck out our award-winning portfolio!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eAligned with Your Learners and Your Brand\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners are unique, and so is your brand. At Ninja Tropic, we ensure that every educational video we create reflects both.\\r\\n\\r\\nTailored Visuals: We design animations that match your brand’s colors, style, and tone. Learner-Centric Focus: By understanding your audience, we create videos that address their specific needs and preferences.  Our animations integrate seamlessly with your existing training materials.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":891,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Our <em>Animated Training</em> Process</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eTraining Needs Analysis:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We start by understanding your goals. What skills or knowledge gaps are you trying to address? Who are your learners? What outcomes do you want to see? This analysis ensures your training videos are not just engaging but also aligned with your business objectives.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":555,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eCreate a script for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"A compelling script is the backbone of any great video. Clear Objectives: Every script is written with the end goal in mind—what do you want your learners to achieve? Engaging Language: We write in a tone that resonates with your audience, avoiding jargon and focusing on clarity.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":894,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eDevelop a storyboard for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The storyboard is where your vision begins to take shape. Each scene is sketched out with accompanying text to show what learners will see and hear. You review the storyboard to ensure it aligns with your goals and vision. This step helps avoid costly revisions later and ensures everyone is on the same page before production begins.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":895,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eCreate assets and animate!\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team creates unique characters, backgrounds, and visuals tailored to your brand. Using state-of-the-art tools, we bring your storyboard to life with smooth, professional animation. Professional narrators and soundtracks enhance the learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":896,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eTest your animated educational videos with audiences\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Testing is a critical step in our process. We share the video with a small group of learners to gather feedback. Based on feedback, we fine-tune the video for clarity, engagement, and effectiveness.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWe measure \\u003cem\\u003eresults\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We don’t just deliver a typical explainer video and call it a day. At Ninja Tropic, we measure the impact of your animated training videos.\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli style=\\u0022list-style-type: none;\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLearner Assessments:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nTrack knowledge retention through quizzes or interactive elements.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003ePerformance Metrics:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nAnalyze behavior changes or productivity improvements post-training.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eContinuous Improvement:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\nUse the data to refine future training initiatives.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Case [gradient]Studies[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Want to see how we’ve helped other organizations achieve real results with animated training videos? Check out our in-depth \\u003cb\\u003ecase studies\\u003c/b\\u003e to see how we’ve helped companies like yours overcome their training challenges and achieve measurable outcomes. You’ll see real-world examples of how our engaging, learner-centric approach can transform your training programs and drive success\\r\\n\\r\\nAt \\u003cb\\u003eNinja Tropic eLearning\\u003c/b\\u003e, we believe training should never feel like a chore. With custom animated videos, your learners will stay engaged, retain more, and apply what they’ve learned.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Swire Coca-Cola\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":900,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":617,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"DRIP7\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":901,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Animation | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','361-autosave-v1','','','2026-03-12 05:23:41','2026-03-12 05:23:41','',361,'http://localhost:8080/?p=885',0,'revision','',0),(886,1,'2026-03-12 04:49:06','2026-03-12 04:49:06','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eHost Lead\\r\\nInstructional Videos\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen it comes to training and educating your employees or customers, you want to ensure that the content you’re delivering is both effective and engaging. After all, the ultimate goal of any training program is to inspire behavior change and drive results for your organization. And what better way to achieve this goal than through the power of video?\\r\\n\\r\\nOur recording host lead instructional videos are designed to deliver results, educate and engage your audience, making it the perfect complement to your existing training programs or a standalone solution. But what sets our instructional videos apart from others on the market? It’s our commitment to customization and flexibility.\\r\\nWe understand that every organization is unique, and that’s why we offer two options to help you create the perfect instructional video: Onsite Filming and Remote Film Options.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":878,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e#1 Onsite Filming\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The first option is to coordinate filming with your subject matter experts. This way, your audience is learning directly from the people who know your industry best.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey will be able to provide real-world examples and insights that will help your audience retain the information better. This option is perfect for organizations that want to showcase the expertise of their team, or for those looking for a more personal and relatable touch.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":880,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eInteractive and Engaging Content\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Regardless of which option you choose, rest assured that our recording host lead instructional videos are more than just talking heads. They are interactive and engaging, designed to keep your audience focused and interested. We incorporate a variety of techniques to keep the content engaging, such as visual aids, interactive quizzes, and animated graphics. Our instructional videos are not only informative but also enjoyable to watch, which helps to keep your audience engaged and invested in the training.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":881,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch1 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_heading\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eDelivering Results\\u003c/em\\u003e That Matter\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e \\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"With our recording host lead instructional videos, you can be confident that your audience will receive the education and training they need to succeed. Whether you’re looking to improve customer satisfaction, increase employee productivity, or drive sales, our instructional videos are an effective tool for achieving your goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eA Better Call to Action\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"So, if you’re ready to take your training to the next level and start delivering results that matter, contact us today to learn more about how we can help you achieve your training goals. Our recording host lead instructional videos are the perfect solution for organizations looking for an effective, engaging, and enjoyable way to train their employees or customers. Don’t wait, get started today and see the difference for yourself!\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":882,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Learn more about the Training Needs Analysis on a Free Consultation\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis is a crucial step in the creation of effective e-learning content. Embrace the power of TNA and take your e-learning content to the next level. Start inspiring behavior change and drive results for your organization today.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Live Action Host Video | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','359-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 04:49:06','2026-03-12 04:49:06','',359,'http://localhost:8080/?p=886',0,'revision','',0),(887,1,'2026-03-12 04:50:34','2026-03-12 04:50:34','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAward Winning Custom Animated Training Videos\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCorporate training must do more than just inform—it must engage, educate, and inspire. That’s where custom animated training videos come in. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we specialize in crafting engaging, skill-building animated videos designed to resonate with modern learners. From vibrant visuals to tailored messaging, our award-winning process ensures your training content delivers measurable results. Whether you’re building compliance training, onboarding modules, or product knowledge videos, our approach is designed to achieve real business outcomes.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":884,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation grabs attention and simplifies complex topics, making learning enjoyable and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boost Retention:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Studies show learners remember visual content better than text alone. Animated videos enhance understanding by combining visuals with auditory elements.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Increase Comprehension:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can break down complex concepts into easy-to-understand steps, making it easier for learners to grasp new information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve Focus:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engaging visuals and sound effects can help learners stay focused and reduce distractions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create a Positive Learning Experience:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can make training more fun and enjoyable, which can lead to increased motivation and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facilitate Collaboration:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can be used to spark discussion and collaboration among learners.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enhance Brand Awareness:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can help to build brand awareness and recognition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Video Animation | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','361-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 04:50:34','2026-03-12 04:50:34','',361,'http://localhost:8080/?p=887',0,'revision','',0),(888,1,'2026-03-12 04:51:16','2026-03-12 04:51:16','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAward Winning Custom Animated Training Videos\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCorporate training must do more than just