d_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation grabs attention and simplifies complex topics, making learning enjoyable and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boost Retention:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Studies show learners remember visual content better than text alone. Animated videos enhance understanding by combining visuals with auditory elements.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Increase Comprehension:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can break down complex concepts into easy-to-understand steps, making it easier for learners to grasp new information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Improve Focus:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engaging visuals and sound effects can help learners stay focused and reduce distractions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create a Positive Learning Experience:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animation can make training more fun and enjoyable, which can lead to increased motivation and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Facilitate Collaboration:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can be used to spark discussion and collaboration among learners.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enhance Brand Awareness:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Animated videos can help to build brand awareness and recognition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAnimated videos make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We focus on your learners and desired results by tailoring our approach to their specific needs and preferences. We create engaging and memorable learning experiences that drive real behavior change.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor example, if you want to improve employee onboarding, we’ll create a series of animated videos that welcome new hires, introduce them to the company culture, and teach them the skills they need to be successful. We’ll use relatable characters and scenarios to make the learning experience enjoyable and relevant.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eAnd that’s not all!\\u003c/b\\u003e We offer a full range of services to help you achieve your training goals from start to finish, including \\u003cb\\u003elive action video production\\u003c/b\\u003e,\\u003cb\\u003e instructional design consulting\\u003c/b\\u003e, and more.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":723,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eAnimated videos\\u003c/em\\u003e make great eLearning tools\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We take pride in having the\\u003cb\\u003e largest portfolio\\u003c/b\\u003e of educational animation examples spanning multiple industries. From healthcare to technology, nonprofits to corporate training, our animations have transformed learning experiences for diverse audiences. Each example showcases our ability to create customized, engaging content that resonates with learners and achieves measurable outcomes. Whether you’re looking for compliance training, onboarding, or product education, our portfolio demonstrates how we bring concepts to life with creativity.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022\\u003eCheck out our award-winning portfolio!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eAligned with Your Learners and Your Brand\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your learners are unique, and so is your brand. At Ninja Tropic, we ensure that every educational video we create reflects both.\\r\\n\\r\\nTailored Visuals: We design animations that match your brand’s colors, style, and tone. Learner-Centric Focus: By understanding your audience, we create videos that address their specific needs and preferences.  Our animations integrate seamlessly with your existing training materials.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":891,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Our <em>Animated Training</em> Process</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eTraining Needs Analysis:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We start by understanding your goals. What skills or knowledge gaps are you trying to address? Who are your learners? What outcomes do you want to see? This analysis ensures your training videos are not just engaging but also aligned with your business objectives.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":555,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eCreate a script for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"A compelling script is the backbone of any great video. Clear Objectives: Every script is written with the end goal in mind—what do you want your learners to achieve? Engaging Language: We write in a tone that resonates with your audience, avoiding jargon and focusing on clarity.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":894,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eDevelop a storyboard for an educational video:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The storyboard is where your vision begins to take shape. Each scene is sketched out with accompanying text to show what learners will see and hear. You review the storyboard to ensure it aligns with your goals and vision. This step helps avoid costly revisions later and ensures everyone is on the same page before production begins.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":895,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eCreate assets and animate!\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our team creates unique characters, backgrounds, and visuals tailored to your brand. Using state-of-the-art tools, we bring your storyboard to life with smooth, professional animation. Professional narrators and soundtracks enhance the learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":896,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eTest your animated educational videos with audiences\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Testing is a critical step in our process. We share the video with a small group of learners to gather feedback. Based on feedback, we fine-tune the video for clarity, engagement, and effectiveness.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":739,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->','Video Animation | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','361-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 05:02:37','2026-03-12 05:02:37','',361,'http://localhost:8080/?p=897',0,'revision','',0),(898,1,'2026-03-12 05:05:12','2026-03-12 05:05:12','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAward Winning Custom Animated Training Videos\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCorporate training must do more than just inform—it must engage, educate, and inspire. That’s where custom 