\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Storytelling | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company','','inherit','closed','closed','','366-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:06:34','2026-03-13 03:06:34','',366,'http://localhost:8080/?p=938',0,'revision','',0),(939,1,'2026-03-13 03:24:17','2026-03-13 03:24:17','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Production','','publish','closed','closed','','video-training-production','','','2026-03-13 03:27:10','2026-03-13 03:27:10','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=939',0,'page','',0),(940,1,'2026-03-13 03:24:17','2026-03-13 03:24:17','','Video Training Production','','inherit','closed','closed','','939-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:24:17','2026-03-13 03:24:17','',939,'http://localhost:8080/?p=940',0,'revision','',0),(941,1,'2026-03-13 03:26:30','2026-03-13 03:26:30','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Production','','inherit','closed','closed','','939-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:26:30','2026-03-13 03:26:30','',939,'http://localhost:8080/?p=941',0,'revision','',0),(943,1,'2026-03-13 03:27:45','0000-00-00 00:00:00',' ','','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-03-13 03:27:45','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=943',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(944,1,'2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-13 03:28:44',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','944','','','2026-03-30 14:35:40','2026-03-30 14:35:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=944',10,'nav_menu_item','',0),(945,1,'2026-03-13 03:38:43','2026-03-13 03:38:43','','CLIENTE-FINAL-04_v1_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','cliente-final-04_v1_mesa-de-trabajo-1-copia','','','2026-03-13 03:38:43','2026-03-13 03:38:43','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CLIENTE-FINAL-04_v1_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(946,1,'2026-03-13 03:38:50','2026-03-13 03:38:50','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:38:50','2026-03-13 03:38:50','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=946',0,'revision','',0),(947,1,'2026-03-13 03:39:48','2026-03-13 03:39:48','','VTS_What-is-video-learning','','inherit','open','closed','','vts_what-is-video-learning','','','2026-03-13 03:39:48','2026-03-13 03:39:48','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_What-is-video-learning.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(948,1,'2026-03-13 03:39:59','2026-03-13 03:39:59','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:39:59','2026-03-13 03:39:59','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=948',0,'revision','',0),(949,1,'2026-03-13 03:41:17','2026-03-13 03:41:17','','VTS_OW_DESK_1','','inherit','open','closed','','vts_ow_desk_1','','','2026-03-13 03:41:17','2026-03-13 03:41:17','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_OW_DESK_1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(950,1,'2026-03-13 03:41:20','2026-03-13 03:41:20','','VTS_OW_DESK_2','','inherit','open','closed','','vts_ow_desk_2','','','2026-03-13 03:41:20','2026-03-13 03:41:20','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_OW_DESK_2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(951,1,'2026-03-13 03:41:22','2026-03-13 03:41:22','','VTS_OW_DESK_3-980x1230','','inherit','open','closed','','vts_ow_desk_3-980x1230','','','2026-03-13 03:41:22','2026-03-13 03:41:22','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_OW_DESK_3-980x1230-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(952,1,'2026-03-13 03:42:27','2026-03-13 03:42:27','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAnimation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 image-hover\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":949,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Walkme\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":950,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":951,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:42:27','2026-03-13 03:42:27','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=952',0,'revision','',0),(953,1,'2026-03-13 03:46:54','2026-03-13 03:46:54','','VTS_Our-case-studies','','inherit','open','closed','','vts_our-case-studies','','','2026-03-13 03:46:54','2026-03-13 03:46:54','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_Our-case-studies.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(954,1,'2026-03-13 03:46:58','2026-03-13 03:46:58','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAnimation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 image-hover\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":949,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Walkme\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":950,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":951,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clinico Path</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Character Animation + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Award-winning teacher at the Mayo Clinic and published author, Dr. Philip Tisdall, MD, had a massive task to achieve. The Clinico Path Group hoped to create whiteboard video training instructing students to use critical reasoning when caring for their patients. With hundreds of 40-minute lectures to morph into stunning and captivating video modules, Dr. Tisdall reached out to the pros at Ninja Tropic. He has been immersing his pathology students in these unique eLearning videos every month since.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Illustrative Minimalist + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical educators know it’s important to keep up with the times. That’s why it’s important to offer only the best learning resources for medical professionals. In fact, new educational methods, like elearning video animation, have the potential to increase student engagement and understanding. This is what made Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi seek out NinjaTropic’s help. Dr. Yabrodi wanted to lead the charge for more innovative learning solutions in the medical field.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego zoo reached out to Ninja Tropic experts to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":953,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_Our-case-studies-486x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-953\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:46:58','2026-03-13 03:46:58','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=954',0,'revision','',0),(955,1,'2026-03-13 03:48:15','2026-03-13 03:48:15','','Video-Animation-2','','inherit','open','closed','','video-animation-2-2','','','2026-03-13 03:48:15','2026-03-13 03:48:15','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Video-Animation-2.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(956,1,'2026-03-13 03:48:47','2026-03-13 03:48:47','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAnimation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 image-hover\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":949,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Walkme\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":950,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":951,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clinico Path</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Character Animation + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Award-winning teacher at the Mayo Clinic and published author, Dr. Philip Tisdall, MD, had a massive task to achieve. The Clinico Path Group hoped to create whiteboard video training instructing students to use critical reasoning when caring for their patients. With hundreds of 40-minute lectures to morph into stunning and captivating video modules, Dr. Tisdall reached out to the pros at Ninja Tropic. He has been immersing his pathology students in these unique eLearning videos every month since.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Illustrative Minimalist + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical educators know it’s important to keep up with the times. That’s why it’s important to offer only the best learning resources for medical professionals. In fact, new educational methods, like elearning video animation, have the potential to increase student engagement and understanding. This is what made Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi seek out NinjaTropic’s help. Dr. Yabrodi wanted to lead the charge for more innovative learning solutions in the medical field.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego zoo reached out to Ninja Tropic experts to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":953,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_Our-case-studies-486x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-953\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got just a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? Busy schedules demand condensed learning, and that’s what Ninja Tropic’s microlearning solutions offer!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":955,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Video-Animation-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-955\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Video Animation</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Are your learners struggling to grasp key co