-align=\"center\">Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"></td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eLMS Implem