7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Cost of <em><strong>LMS Admin as a Service</strong></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our LMS Admin Services are designed with your budget in mind. We offer two transparent, fixed monthly fee plans, so you know exactly what to expect. No surprises. We take on the role of a full-time LMS administrator.  Choose our Standard Plan for comprehensive LMS administration or our Power Plan for advanced course editing and development using tools like Articulate Storyline.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"ninja-pricing-table container\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table ninja-pricing-table container\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Standard Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$1,850</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">Up to 3000 Learners</span>\n    </th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Power Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$2,875</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">3000+ Learners</span>\n    </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>LMS Administration</strong></td><td>Unlimited access to experienced LMS administrators during business hours, ensuring your system runs smoothly and efficiently.</td><td>Includes all Standard features plus integrated LMS administration with content editing support.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Loading</strong></td><td>Quick and accurate course uploads, keeping your content accessible and up-to-date.</td><td>Load and customize courses as needed, ensuring they stay relevant and engaging.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Management</strong></td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Routine Reporting</strong></td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Proactive System Development</strong></td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues.</td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For larger teams, we offer team support for additional support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Hiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost. Additionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners. Ninjatropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1034,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Outsourced LMS Administration Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"With our LMS Admin Services, you’ll have a dedicated LMS administrator \\u0026amp; team member, backed by a team of experts, ready to answer your calls, chats, and emails, ensuring your team’s needs are always met.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1036,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What does your <em>LMS administration entail</em>?</strong><br></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our expert team can handle almost all LMS administrator tasks, allowing you to focus on your core business.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOptimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Optimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\r\\nWe’ll make sure your LMS runs smoothly, building SOPS and helping you get the most out of your platform’s features\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1001,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eStreamline your training program\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We can create and manage learning paths, ensuring your training programs are organized and effective.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1044,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eUser Management and Content Management\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We will handle user enrollment, course updates, and other content-related tasks, saving you valuable time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1046,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReporting \\u0026amp; LMS configuration\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Need detailed reports? We can set up custom reports and ensure your LMS settings are optimized for your needs.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1000,\"_i