 optimized and reduce technical issues.</td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For larger teams, we offer team support for additional support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<d