stands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For larger teams, we offer team support for additional support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Hiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost. Additionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners. Ninjatropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1034,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Outsourced LMS Administration Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"With our LMS Admin Services, you’ll have a dedicated LMS administrator \\u0026amp; team member, backed by a team of experts, ready to answer your calls, chats, and emails, ensuring your team’s needs are always met.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1036,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What does your <em>LMS administration entail</em>?</strong><br></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our expert team can handle almost all LMS administrator tasks, allowing you to focus on your core business.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOptimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Optimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\r\\nWe’ll make sure your LMS runs smoothly, building SOPS and helping you get the most out of your platform’s features\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1001,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eStreamline your training program\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We can create and manage learning paths, ensuring your training programs are organized and effective.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1044,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eUser Management and Content Management\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We will handle user enrollment, course updates, and other content-related tasks, saving you valuable time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1046,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReporting \\u0026amp; LMS configuration\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Need detailed reports? We can set up custom reports and ensure your LMS settings are optimized for your needs.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1000,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eAmazing Support from a dedicated team – check reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Have a question or run into a problem? Our team is available to help, so you’re never left in the dark.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1048,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Reduce <em>Administrative</em> Pressure</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our expert team can handle almost all LMS administrator tasks, allowing you to focus on your core business.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Time and resource savings</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Free up your team to focus on creating great learning experiences, not managing the system. By outsourcing your LMS administration, you reduce the need for extensive in-house training and free up valuable staff time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Flexibility and scalability</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our services can easily adapt to your changing needs, whether you’re a small business or a large organization. As your organization grows, we can scale our services to match, ensuring consistent support and management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Expertise and knowledge</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our LMS experts stay on top of the latest trends and best practices, ensuring your platform is always optimized for performance and user experience. We handle the complexities of LMS management, so you don’t have to.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Continuous support</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re here for you every step of the way, offering ongoing support and guidance. Whether you have a quick question or need assistance with a complex issue, our team is available during business hours to provide prompt and reliable support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong><strong>Platforms <em>We Support</em></strong></strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic’s LMS Admin Services support a wide range of platforms to meet the diverse needs of our clients.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Customer LMS Vendor:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>LearnWorlds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thinkific</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TalentLMS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Absorb LMS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Employee-Centric LMS Vendor:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SAP Litmos</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cornerstone OnDemand</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Docebo</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Canvas LMS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>iSpring Learn</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">This is not an exhaustive list, and we are always expanding our platform<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eThe importance of your \\u003cem\\u003eLMS administration\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_25 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_34 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nYour LMS is the heart of your training and development initiatives. Effective LMS administration ensures that your learning programs run smoothly, your learners have a seamless experience, and you can gather valuable insights to optimize your training strategies. Don’t let administrative tasks hold you back from achieving your learning and development goals.\\r\\n\\r\\nReady to unlock the full potential of your LMS? Contact Ninja Tropic today to learn more about our LMS Admin Services and how we can help you achieve your training objectives.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_26 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1055,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"How to Get Started With Ninja Tropic Video-Based LMS Consultants\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"By now, we’re sure you have questions. Ninja Tropic is an award-winning video eLearning agency and we’re ready to help – we are just a few quick “blanks” away. Fill in the form so we know how to get in touch with you. No sales pitches, no pushy tactics – just real help from a leading LMS consulting company.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','LMS Administration Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','383-revision-v1','','','2026-03-16 04:57:27','2026-03-16 04:57:27','',383,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1058',0,'revision','',0),(1059,1,'2026-03-16 05:01:02','2026-03-16 05:01:02','','PAGE_LMS_Administration_Job_Description_1.1','','inherit','open','closed','','page_lms_administration_job_description_1-1','','','2026-03-16 05:01:02','2026-03-16 05:01:02','',385,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/PAGE_LMS_Administration_Job_Description_1.1.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1060,1,'2026-03-16 05:12:21','2026-03-16 05:12:21','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLMS Management Services: Unlimited Support\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Are you tired of juggling the complexities of your Learning Management System (LMS)? Do you wish you could focus more on creating engaging learning experiences and less on technical troubleshooting? With Ninja Tropic’s LMS Management Services, you can! We offer unlimited support to streamline your LMS and empower your team.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1059,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Management Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"What does LMS management entail? It’s more than just keeping the lights on. It involves:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSystem Administration:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Ensuring your LMS is up-to-date, secure, and running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eUser Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Handling user accounts, enrollments, and permissions.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eCourse Creation \\u0026amp; Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Developing, uploading, and updating course content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eReporting \\u0026amp; Analytics:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Tracking learner progress and course effectiveness.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eTechnical Support:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Providing prompt assistance to both learners and administrators.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":664,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhy Consider Outsourcing LMS Administration?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Imagine this: you have a backlog on developing engaging eLearning content, but your team is constantly bogged down by the mundane and time-consuming task of LMS administration. It’s a crucial role, but it’s customer service-oriented and requires simple niche technical skills. Does this sound familiar? If so, you’re not alone.\\r\\n\\r\\nMany growing organizations face the challenge of managing a shrinking full-time employee (FTE) budget and need to keep their key staff on tasks that provide greater value, such as content creation and curriculum planning.\\r\\n\\r\\nAssigning the LMS admin role to an already busy team member, or limiting them to more value-added tasks, is a common scenario. It’s a role that is simple but important, one that must be delegated.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>LMS Admin <em>Services Plans</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer two flexible plans to fit your needs:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Standard Plan:</strong>&nbsp;Includes comprehensive LMS administration, user management, course loading, and basic reporting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Power Plan:</strong>&nbsp;Adds advanced course editing and development, custom reporting, and priority support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Both plans come with unlimited support and a fixed monthly fee, so you can budget with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"ninja-pricing-table container\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table ninja-pricing-table container\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Standard Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$1,850</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">Up to 3000 Learners</span>\n    </th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Power Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$2,875</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">3000+ Learners</span>\n    </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>LMS Administration</strong></td><td>Unlimited access to experienced LMS administrators during business hours, ensuring your system runs smoothly and efficiently.</td><td>Includes all Standard features plus integrated LMS administration with content editing support.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Loading</strong></td><td>Quick and accurate course uploads, keeping your content accessible and up-to-date.</td><td>Load and customize courses as needed, ensuring they stay relevant and engaging.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Management</strong></td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Routine Reporting</strong></td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Proactive System Development</strong></td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues.</td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Both plans come with unlimited support and a fixed monthly fee, so you can budget with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary Comparison\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_6 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_13 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost.\\r\\n\\r\\nAdditionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content. If you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_7 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_10 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1070,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Roles and Responsibilities\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"LMS administrators play a vital role in the success of your learning programs. They are responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSystem Configuration:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Setting up and maintaining the LMS environment.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eUser Support:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Assisting learners and instructors with technical issues.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eContent Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Uploading and organizing courses, materials, and resources.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eData Analysis:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Tracking learner progress and identifying areas for improvement.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring and training an in-house LMS administrator can be costly and time-consuming. Outsourcing this role to Ninja Tropic is a cost-effective and efficient solution.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1071,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Outsources LMS Management Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Outsourcing your LMS management to Ninja Tropic is a smart investment in your organization’s learning and development initiatives. Here’s what you gain:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eA Dedicated Team\\u003c/strong\\u003e: A team of LMS experts focused solely on your success. This team becomes an extension of your own, providing personalized attention and support.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eProactive Support\\u003c/strong\\u003e: We don’t just react to problems; we actively monitor your LMS, identifying and resolving issues before they impact your learners. This ensures a smooth, uninterrupted learning experience.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e: We understand that every organization is unique. That’s why we tailor our services to your specific needs and goals, ensuring your LMS works optimally for you.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nDon’t let LMS management hold you back. Contact us today to learn more and get a personalized quote.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1074,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"