retain key knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our video training production team brings onboarding to life. We create dynamic and informative videos that help new employees quickly understand their role within the organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We cover a wide range of topics – from compliance training to leadership development. We also offer instructional design strategy consultations to help you create a comprehensive and effective onboarding program that aligns with your organizational goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Partner with Ninja Tropic and give your new hires the best possible start. We’ll create a digital onboarding experience that fosters a sense of belonging, accelerates learning, and sets your employees up for success from day one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Employee Onboarding Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','409-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 15:26:33','2026-03-21 15:26:33','',409,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1127',0,'revision','',0),(1128,1,'2026-03-21 15:26:39','2026-03-21 15:26:39','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eDigital Employee Onboarding Solutions: Engaging eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"It’s exciting to bring new members to the team but the sheer amount of employee onboarding can be overwhelming for any training leader. Corporate core values, employee benefits, and social-type training are just the tip of the iceberg.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn-person onboarding training can be a bit dull (and sucks up a tremendous amount of productive time). Combat employee onboarding training fatigue, make them feel welcome and encourage a connection with the company through interactive v