-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Competency Based Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','412-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 18:58:56','2026-03-21 18:58:56','',412,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1187',0,'revision','',0),(1188,1,'2026-03-21 19:02:41','2026-03-21 19:02:41','<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCustom Competency Based Training Solutions – Award Winning\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1164,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDoes your workforce need training that builds \\u003cem\\u003ereal world skills\\u003c/em\\u003e?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Traditional training methods often focus on content delivery, but competency-based training ensures employees gain the knowledge and skills they need to perform. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we design engaging learning experiences that drive measurable results.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur approach helps organizations bridge skill gaps, boost performance, and achieve business outcomes. We don’t just train employees—we transform them into confident, capable professionals.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eDeveloping Competency-Based Training and Development Programs\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Competency-based training (CBT) focuses on mastery. Employees learn at their own pace, demonstrating competence before moving forward. Unlike passive learning, competency-based training is practical, interactive, and skill-focused.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt Ninja Tropic eLearning, we build competency-based programs designed for modern learners. We prioritize engagement, blending video, gamification, and interactive scenarios. Our custom training solutions align with job roles, ensuring learners develop skills they can immediately apply.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1167,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container ninja-sticky-columns\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container ninja-sticky-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-3\"><strong><strong>How We Build <em>Competency-Based</em> Training:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Needs Analysis:</strong><br>We identify key competencies and performance gaps</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Engaging Learning Paths:</strong></strong><br>We design structured, interactive training journeys.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Enhanced engagement:</strong></strong> <br>Interactive eLearning experiences can make the onboarding process more engaging and memorable. This can help new hires feel more connected to the organization and its culture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Assessment &amp; Feedback:</strong><br>We measure skills through real world applications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong><br>We refine programs based on learner performance.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eUnderstanding Competency-Based Training and Development\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Competency-based training isn’t about hours spent in training. It’s about skill mastery. Employees must demonstrate they can apply what they’ve learned before progressing.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis approach benefits organizations because it ensures employees gain practical, job-ready skills. It also benefits learners by providing personalized, self-paced learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt Ninja Tropic eLearning, we structure training to reinforce knowledge retention and skill application. Our courses integrate real world scenarios, making learning engaging, efficient, and impactful.\",\"_description\":\