et your services online and in office\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our patient education videos go beyond traditional methods. We translate complex medical information into easily digestible visual stories. This not only improves patient understanding but also strengthens their trust in your practice. Whether it’s showcasing treatment options, explaining procedures, or promoting health literacy, our videos serve as powerful tools for both patient education and practice marketing\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eEmpower and engage with patient education videos\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Videos grab attention and make learning fun. Patients can watch at their own pace, review information, and share with family. They’ll feel more involved in their care and make smarter choices.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1249,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"my-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>How can <em>health education</em> videos and content help build stronger patient-provider partnerships?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Health education videos bridge the communication gap between providers and patients. By simplifying medical jargon and visualizing concepts, these videos create a shared understanding. This helps patients make informed decisions about their health and strengthens the collaborative relationship with their healthcare team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Creating Patient Education Materials – <em>Our Process</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Ninja Tropic, we take a personalized approach to video production. We work closely with you to understand your specific needs, target audience, and key messages. Our process involves:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Consultation and Planning:</strong><br>We discuss your goals, identify your target audience, and develop a tailored <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/video-training-strategy/\">video strategy</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong> <strong>Scriptwriting and Storyboarding:</strong></strong><br> We craft clear, concise scripts and visualize the video flow with <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-consultants/\">storyboards</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Production:</strong><br>We handle all aspects of filming, <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/video-animation/\">animation</a>, and voiceover recording.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Editing and Post-Production:</strong><br>We refine the footage, add graphics and animations, and <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/custom-elearning-development/\">ensure the video aligns with your brand</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Delivery and Optimization:</strong><br>We provide the final video in various formats suitable for online sharing and in-office use.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1262,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"800px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Patient-Education-Materials-Our-Process-980x1551-1-647x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1262\" style=\"width:auto;height:800px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eAward-Winning\\u003c/em\\u003e Patient Education Video Examples\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Check out our examples to see how we’ve helped other practices connect with patients through video.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://www.ninjatropic.com/project_category/patient-education/\\u0022\\u003eCheck out Patient Education Videos!\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1263,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mesh\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mesh\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Types of <em>Patient Education</em> Videos</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Instructional:</strong><br>Step-by-step videos are essential for patients to learn new skills and techniques. They can cover everything from self-care routines to medication management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Conceptual</strong></strong>:<br> Animated videos are great for breaking down complex medical information into easy-to-understand concepts. They can explain diseases, treatments, and preventative measures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Expert-hosted:</strong><br>Featuring interviews with healthcare professionals, these videos provide valuable insights and expert advice. They can cover a wide range of topics, from the latest research to treatment options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Procedure</strong><br>These videos help patients prepare for medical procedures by explaining what to expect. They can reduce anxiety and improve patient satisfaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Delivery and Optimization:</strong><br>We provide the final video in various formats suitable for online sharing and in-office use.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1269,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"800px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Creative-Medical-Ed-and-Customized-509x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1269\" style=\"width:auto;height:800px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003ePatient Education Plan Template (for Videos)\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"Ready to create effective patient education videos? Download our free template now and get started!\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Get your Patient Education Template!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003ePatient Education Platform: Customer Success Story\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our platform makes patient education simple. Doctors can quickly create and send personalized learning plans to patients. This empowers patients to take charge of their health, leading to better results and stronger connections with their healthcare team.\\r\\n\\r\\nWant to see how our solution is transforming patient education? Check out our latest Customer Success Story case study!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies-palaestra/\\u0022\\u003eCheck out Case Study!\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1276,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"my-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCompliance Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ready to Transform [gradient]Your Training[/gradient]?\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e25