s Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em>?</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fit\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<p><strong>Investing in product knowledge training offers numerous benefits for your business.</strong> It empowers your team to become product experts, boosting sales, enhancing customer satisfaction, and improving team morale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Boost Sales</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work closely with you to identify your specific safety training needs, including your target audience, training objectives, regulatory requirements, and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Happy Customers:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Fewer Returns:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Efficient Onboarding:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New hires get up to speed faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Increased Customer Satisfaction:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When teams are knowledgeable about products, they can provide better support and assistance, leading to happier customers who are more likely to return and recommend your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Improved Team Morale:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Investing in training shows employees that their development is valued, boosting morale and motivation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><strong><em>Ninja Tropic eLearning</em></strong> can help you achieve these benefits and more. Our expert team will work with you to create tailored product knowledge training programs that meet your specific needs.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Different Types Of Product Knowledge Training for Different Teams</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":1330,\"mediaLink\":\"http://localhost:8080/corporate-training/product-training/icons-48x40-4-1/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Icons-48x40-4-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1330 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p>Sales Teams:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p>Product knowledge training can help sales teams close more deals by equipping them with the tools to effectively address customer concerns and present the product’s value proposition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->','Product Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','431-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 21:36:32','2026-03-21 21:36:32','',431,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1331',0,'revision','',0),(1333,1,'2026-03-21 21:41:27','2026-03-21 21:41:27','a:9:{s:8:\"location\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"param\";s:5:\"block\";s:8:\"operator\";s:2:\"==\";s:5:\"value\";s:13:\"acf/icon-card\";}}}s:8:\"position\";s:6:\"normal\";s:5:\"style\";s:7:\"default\";s:15:\"label_placement\";s:3:\"top\";s:21:\"instruction_placement\";s:5:\"label\";s:14:\"hide_on_screen\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"description\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"show_in_rest\";i:0;s:13:\"display_title\";s:0:\"\";}','Icon card','icon-card','publish','closed','closed','','group_69bf0fabe3ac4','','','2026-03-21 21:44:44','2026-03-21 21:44:44','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?post_type=acf-field-group&#038;p=1333',0,'acf-field-group','',0),(1334,1,'2026-03-21 21:41:27','2026-03-21 21:41:27','a:12:{s:10:\"aria-label\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:12:\"instructions\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"required\";i:0;s:17:\"conditional_logic\";i:0;s:7:\"wrapper\";a:3:{s:5:\"width\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";}s:13:\"default_value\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"allow_in_bindings\";i:0;s:4:\"tabs\";s:3:\"all\";s:7:\"toolbar\";s:4:\"full\";s:12:\"media