ng empowers your team with the customized product knowledge training they need to succeed through engaging and effective training solutions. From interactive online courses to scenario-based simulations, we create tailored programs that boost sales, enhance customer satisfaction, and drive business growth.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1315,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"What is [gradient]Product Knowledge[/gradient] Training?\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Product knowledge training is essential for teams to excel in selling your products. It involves mastering the intricate details, features, benefits, and effective usage of your offerings. By investing in online product knowledge training, you’re empowering your team to become true product experts who can confidently guide customers and build strong relationships. Think of it as equipping your team with the tools they need to shine in their roles and drive business success.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1317,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach to Product Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_pb_gutters1\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_5  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nPosition your sales and marketing teams as product authority figures by pairing appealing graphics and engaging voiceover with the perfect amount of product training content. That’s exactly what we provide. Microlearning for the on-demand skills essential for personal, product, and company success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What are the Key Benefits Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em>?</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fit\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<p><strong>Investing in product knowledge training offers numerous benefits for your business.</strong>&nbsp;It empowers your team to become product experts, boosting sales, enhancing customer satisfaction, and improving team morale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Boost Sales</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work closely with you to identify your specific safety training needs, including your target audience, training objectives, regulatory requirements, and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Happy Customers:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Fewer Returns:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Efficient Onboarding:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New hires get up to speed faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Increased Customer Satisfaction:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When teams are knowledgeable about products, they can provide better support and assistance, leading to happier customers who are more likely to return and recommend your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Improved Team Morale:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Investing in training shows employees that their development is valued, boosting morale and motivation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><strong><em>Ninja Tropic eLearning</em></strong>&nbsp;can help you achieve these benefits and more. Our expert team will work with you to create tailored product knowledge training programs that meet your specific needs.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Different Types Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em> for Different Teams</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSales Teams\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"Product knowledge training can help sales teams close more deals by equipping them with the tools to effectively address customer concerns and present the product’s value proposition.\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1330,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eMarketing Teams:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nProduct knowledge training can help marketi