’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Leadership Development Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','438-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:05:24','2026-03-21 23:05:24','',438,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1426',0,'revision','',0),(1428,1,'2026-03-21 23:06:47','2026-03-21 23:06:47','','Workplace-Harassment-Training','','inherit','open','closed','','workplace-harassment-training-2','','','2026-03-21 23:06:47','2026-03-21 23:06:47','',438,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Workplace-Harassment-Training.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1429,1,'2026-03-21 23:06:49','2026-03-21 23:06:49','','Soft-Skills-Training','','inherit','open','closed','','soft-skills-training-2','','','2026-03-21 23:06:49','2026-03-21 23:06:49','',438,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Soft-Skills-Training.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1430,1,'2026-03-21 23:07:36','2026-03-21 23:07:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eLeadership Development Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Great leadership can grow a company from the ground up, but when leadership is thrown into their role with little direction, things can go south quickly. Morale decreases, production halts, and the company’s bottom line plummets when newly-appointed leadership is unaware of how to actually lead a team. Prepare your new leaders with meaningful leadership development training and equip them with the tools needed for whole-company prosperity.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1420,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1422,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LDT_Effective-e1678296214885-1024x589.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1422\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><em>Effective Leaders</em> Develop Themselves While Developing Others</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we jump (with both feet) into a digitally-centered world without looking back, clear and impactful marketing and communication strategies play a crucial role in the success of businesses. It’s not enough to create a revolutionary product or service and expect customers to find, and flock to it with unquestionable force – it must be marketed and communicated to customers in ever-evolving ways. With one finger on the pulse of customer preferences, marketing and communication teams require continual training to remain competitive in the age of e-commerce – with absolute clarity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Evolution of industry trends demands evolution of training methodology. Through a visual, engaging approach to learning solutions, microlearning provides the perfect storm of effectiveness and productivity where marketing and communication team members benefit from fast, focused training that is jam-packed with content that sets them up for success. Less unproductive time with multiplied impact creates the perfect combo for marketing and communication employee development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our Approach\\r\\nWe believe in great leadership and that starts with great instruction. With 77% of businesses reporting that their leadership is lacking, it’s time to evolve in the way we teach leaders to guide their team. The old traditional methods of instruction are no longer effective and learning leaders have been searching for new methodology. We’ve got the solution.\\r\\n\\r\\nExecutives have little time left in the day for personal and leadership development that’s dull and doesn’t demonstrate the tools or how to use them. Packing content into short, visually-appealing, scenario-based learning solutions could be the path to a productive team and supportive leadership.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Cybersecurity Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"USA Swimming\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1423,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Dale Carnegie\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1425,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Small Business Administration\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1424,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSoft Skills Training\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Need eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning offers the flexibility to learn anywhere, anytime, giving your team the freedom to learn on their own terms and at their own pace.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1429,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eWorkplace Harassment Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s the ideal solution for hands-on learners!\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":1428,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Leadership Development Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','438-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:07:36','2026-03-21 23:07:36','',438,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1430',0,'revision','',0),(1431,1,'2026-03-21 23:17:23','2026-03-21 23:17:23','','Cybersecurity-Awareness-Training-for-Employees-2_BloE2-4-1','','inherit','open','closed','','cybersecurity-awareness-training-for-employees-2_bloe2-4-1','','','2026-03-21 23:17:23','2026-03-21 23:17:23','',446,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Cybersecurity-Awareness-Training-for-Employees-2_BloE2-4-1.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1433,1,'2026-03-21 23:20:44','2026-03-21 23:20:44','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCybersecurity Awareness Training for Employees\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"The dangers to your business don’t stop at safety issues, legalities, and a changing market – business owners and leadership must also dodge online hackers who have become more savvy as technology advances.\\r\\n\\r\\nCybersecurity awareness training is a must-have for every business to fend off attackers and keep your organization and customer data out of malicious hands – maintaining your reputation as a trusted business partner.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1431,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Cybersecurity Awareness Training?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"So many business owners avoid cybersecurity,,, until they’ve been hacked and it’s entirely too late. Cybersecurity awareness training arms your team with the knowledge and skills to spot, report, and avoid a catastrophic data breach.\\r\\n\\r\\nCybersecurity awareness training is just one more layer of protection against organizational vulnerabilities because let’s face it – humans are… well, human.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1422,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LDT_Effective-e1678296214885-1024x589.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1422\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Protect Your Business with <em>CyberSecurity Training</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a world of remote work, there are a slew of risks for organizations including phishing, weak network security, social engineering, and compromised passwords. Prepare your business for any potential attacks with a high-level of education for every employee, contractor, and intern.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Humans are both fallible and valuable so make sure they are your shield of protection against devastating cyber attacks with engaging video-based cybersecurity awareness training that includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How to stay safe from threats while working remotely</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Password creation tips</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How to spot and report phishing attempts</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Installing a firewall to block shady websites</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Protecting your emails with an automatic spam blocker</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Cybersecurity Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','446-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:20:44','2026-03-21 23:20:44','',446,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1433',0,'revision','',0),(1434,1,'2026-03-21 23:21: