art\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Cybersecurity Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','446-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:31:31','2026-03-21 23:31:31','',446,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1449',0,'revision','',0),(1450,1,'2026-03-21 23:32:58','2026-03-21 23:32:58','','DIVERSITY-AND-INCLUSION-TRAINING-2-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','diversity-and-inclusion-training-2-copia','','','2026-03-21 23:32:58','2026-03-21 23:32:58','',449,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DIVERSITY-AND-INCLUSION-TRAINING-2-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1452,1,'2026-03-21 23:34:38','2026-03-21 23:34:38','','WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','what-is-diversity-2-copia','','','2026-03-21 23:34:38','2026-03-21 23:34:38','',449,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1453,1,'2026-03-21 23:34:42','2026-03-21 23:34:42','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eBest Diversity \\u0026 Inclusion Training eLearning Company\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Diversity, equity, and inclusion training is an integral piece of education that benefits every employee at every corporation but developing it can feel overwhelming and confusing. How do you ensure that every team member feels represented and included? You hire the pros.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic is an award-winning video-based education development and consulting company that has perfected the art of DEI training development and delivery to make sure your team understands what diversity, equity, and inclusion mean, how to integrate crucial behaviors and mentalities into daily operations and produce the best of the best from every single human.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1450,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is <em>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion</em> Training</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to understand how diversity, equity, and inclusion fit into your company, it’s essential to define each.<br>Diversity describes the things or characteristics that make people awesomely different from others, varied in talents and experience, and just who they are as a human. It could include things like gender, sexual orientation, ethnicity, age, religion, socioeconomic status, disability, and veteran status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equity is often confused with equality (which means treating everyone equally) but is a bit different in its definition. Equity refers to ensuring that every person during the hiring process and daily operations of the company – begins at the same starting line.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It removes existing barriers. For example, a wheelchair handicapable person cannot perform their best if offered a standard desk height and the walkways within the company are not wide enough for a wheelchair to comfortably travel the office. In short, equity is fairness, justice, and impartiality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inclusion expresses a welcoming environment for all which promotes each team member to feel comfortable sharing their ideas, contributions, and gifts with support and respect. Without inclusion, employees may not feel valued and do not offer their best during collaborative assignments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>DEI training instructs all members of the team to treat others in accordance with these key behaviors to ensure a great working environment for all, a top-shelf level of productivity, and a reduced attrition rate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1452,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1452\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Diversity And Inclusion Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','449-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:34:42','2026-03-21 23:34:42','',449,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1453',0,'revision','',0),(1455,1,'2026-03-21 23:35:52','2026-03-21 23:35:52','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eBest Diversity \\u0026 Inclusion Training eLearning Company\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Diversity, equity, and inclusion training is an integral piece of education that benefits every employee at every corporation but developing it can feel overwhelming and confusing. How do you ensure that every team member feels represented and included? You hire the pros.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic is an award-winning video-based education development and consulting company that has perfected the art of DEI training development and delivery to make sure your team understands what diversity, equity, and inclusion mean, how to integrate crucial behaviors and mentalities into daily operations and produce the best of the best from every single human.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1450,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is <em>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion</em> Training</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to understand how diversity, equity, and inclusion fit into your company, it’s essential to define each.<br>Diversity describes the things or characteristics that make people awesomely different from others, varied in talents and experience, and just who they are as a human. It could include things like gender, sexual orientation, ethnicity, age, religion, socioeconomic status, disability, and veteran status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equity is often confused with equality (which means treating everyone equally) but is a bit different in its definition. Equity refers to ensuring that every person during the hiring process and daily operations of the company – begins at the same starting line.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It removes existing barriers. For example, a wheelchair handicapable person cannot perform their best if offered a standard desk height and the walkways within the company are not wide enough for a wheelchair to comfortably travel the office. In short, equity is fairness, justice, and impartiality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inclusion expresses a welcoming environment for all which promotes each team member to feel comfortable sharing their ideas, contributions, and gifts with support and respect. Without inclusion, employees may not feel valued and do not offer their best during collaborative assignments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>DEI training instructs all members of the team to treat others in accordance with these key behaviors to ensure a great working environment for all, a top-shelf level of productivity, and a reduced attrition rate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1452,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1452\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eWhy You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\r\\nNot only does an inclusive and culturally diverse workplace create that positive working environment for all team members, when each employee feels valued, it attracts high-quality talent, provides equal opportunities for everyone, and motivates e