heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.\\r\\nCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Software Simulation','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:56:39','2026-03-21 23:56:39','',451,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1466',0,'revision','',0),(1468,1,'2026-03-21 23:57:01','2026-03-21 23:57:01','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.\\r\\nCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Educational Simulation Software?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Taking a real-to-life software simulation and embedding it into training offers learners the experience of a practical approach without risk to the company. Making mistakes and finding success in a simulation-type environment offers a unique learning experience unmatched by traditional training methodology.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith such impeccable positive learning statistics measured with educational simulation software as a training technique, it’s a win-win for both the organization and its team members.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Software Simulation','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:57:01','2026-03-21 23:57:01','',451,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1468',0,'revision','',0),(1470,1,'2026-03-21 23:59:01','2026-03-21 23:59:01','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.\\r\\nCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Educational Simulation Software?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Taking a real-to-life software simulation and embedding it into training offers learners the experience of a practical approach without risk to the company. Making mistakes and finding success in a simulation-type environment offers a unique learning experience unmatched by traditional training methodology.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith such impeccable positive learning statistics measured with educational simulation software as a training technique, it’s a win-win for both the organization and its team members.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Use <em>Simulation Software</em> for Training &amp; Education</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether opting for an augmented or virtual reality experience, gamified simulation, or a simple test drive of the software in a video-based eLearning format, specific applications and methods are varied and should be more targeted to the unique type of software and systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Depending on the process from safety to tech, integrating hands-on experiences for your learners greatly increases content retention and in turn, the company’s success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Virtual<br><em>Training and Simulation </em>Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The benefits of using virtual training and simulation training for your attendees are vast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This learning and training practice allows for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Improved confidence of the learner<br>🔸 Hands-on practice without risk<br>🔸 Increased safety and knowledge<br>🔸 True-to-life experiences<br>🔸 Immediate feedback without manual intervention to guide success<br>🔸 Gaining measurable success data and knowledge retention</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Software Simulation','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 23:59:01','2026-03-21 23:59:01','',451,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1470',0,'revision','',0),(1472,1,'2026-03-22 00:00:05','2026-03-22 00:00:05','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instru