ing format.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1545,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Top-eLearning-Content-Providers-2024_Cyan-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1545\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2024</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top eLearning Content Provider<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Top eLearning Content Provider<br>For four consecutive years, we have been recognized as Top eLearning Providers by eLearning Industry. We are honored and thrilled to continue supporting companies in training and developing their internal and external teams.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1549,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2023_dha_winner_print_copia-980x814-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1549\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2023</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Digital Health Awards Winner<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">We are honored to announce that we have been recognized and awarded in the prestigious 2023 Digital Health Awards. Categories such as content, design, creativity, and user experience were taken into account, ensuring that only the most exceptional solutions earned a place at the top.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1550,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/INMOBI2023-980x692-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1550\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2023</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Gold – Learning &amp; Development<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">We won Gold in the Learning and Development category from Brandon Hall in 2023. We are honored by this award and proud of our contributions to the medical industry and patient education. Our commitment to supporting the eLearning industry remains unwavering.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1563,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/INMOBI2023-980x692-2-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1563\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2022</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Best Learning &amp; Development Program<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Gold in Best L&amp;D category for developing an Interactive Mobile Marketing Training Program generating $4M in deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1564,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/7-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1564\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2022</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Silver – Learning &amp; Development<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Awarded Silver for our work with Genome Medical on an interactive Articulate Rise course for patient education.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1550,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/INMOBI2023-980x692-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1550\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>202</strong>2</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Best Safety Training Program<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Gold in Best L&amp;D for developing an Interactive Safety Training Program for The Wonderful Company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1567,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/1-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1567\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2021</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top Soft Skills Training Provider<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Recognized as a Top Content Provider for Soft Skills Training, cultivating strong communication and listening skills worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1569,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1569\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2021</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top Provider – Remote Workforce</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Named Top Content Provider for Remote Workforce Development for flexible solutions as remote work became the norm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1570,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/3-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1570\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2021</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top Provider – Custom eLearning<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Awarded for personalization of learning solutions catered to the specific needs of each client.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1571,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/4-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1571\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>202</strong>1</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top Provider – Microlearning<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Named Top Content Provider for Microlearning, catering to the evolution of learner needs and modern attention spans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1572,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/5-copia-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1572\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2020</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top Microlearning Content Provider<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Honored in 2020 for assisting learning leaders adapt to an ever-changing virtual world with engaging microlearning solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Awards','','inherit','closed','closed','','471-revision-v1','','','2026-03-29 17:42:43','2026-03-29 17:42:43','',471,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1580',0,'revision','',0),(1581,1,'2026-03-29 17:43:16','2026-03-29 17:43:16','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCreate True Business Impact\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Microlearning is a revolutionary learning solution that caters to the diminishing attention span of the average human. With short-form video entertainment and condensed copy scattered across the internet, knowledge consumers no longer have the time or will to sit through umpteen hours of boring, motionless training modules – either in person or online.\\r\\n\\r\\nMicrolearning breaks down complex content into smaller, easily-digestible chunks and delivers them to learners using visually entertaining graphics, engaging voiceover, and impressive animation.\\r\\n\\r\\nMicrolearning is the perfect method for learning leaders searching for a training solution for employees on rotating shift work, those with non-traditional positions, students with flexible schedules, and executives with highly-demanding jobs. Smaller sessions fit into everyone’s busy schedule AND boast dramatically higher retention and implementation rates in today’s digitally-focused world.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1514,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Hear from our happy customers\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Associations','','inherit','closed','closed','','474-revision-v1','','','2026-03-29 17:43:16','2026-03-29 17:43:16','',474,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1581',0,'revision','',0),(1583,1,'2026-03-29 17:43:58','2026-03-29 17:43:58','','Rectangle-292-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','rectangle-292-copia','','','2026-03-29 17:43:58','2026-03-29 17:43:58','',474,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-292-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1584,1,'2026-03-29 17:48:06','2026-03-29 17:48:06','','Choosing-the-Right-LMS-A-Guide-to-Making-an-Informed_Blo10-3','','inherit','open','closed','','choosing-the-right-lms-a-guide-to-making-an-informed_blo10-3','','','2026-03-29 17:48:06','2026-03-29 17:48:06','',474,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Choosing-the-Right-LMS-A-Guide-to-Making-an-Informed_Blo10-3.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1585,1,'2026-03-29 17:48:13','2026-03-29 17:48:13','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCreate True Business Impact\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Creating a buzz around your nonprofit association or your cause (or attracting donors to support it) can be a challenge when passing ou