\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-1-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1648\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"25%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1649,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-350-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1649\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"25%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1651,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1651\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"25%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1650,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-3-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1650\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Universities','','inherit','closed','closed','','477-revision-v1','','','2026-03-30 13:49:08','2026-03-30 13:49:08','',477,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1652',0,'revision','',0),(1654,1,'2026-03-30 13:50:36','2026-03-30 13:50:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCreate True Business Impact\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Creating a buzz around your nonprofit association or your cause (or attracting donors to support it) can be a challenge when passing out flyers, taking out an ad in the local newspaper, or posting on social media. Getting a few viewers at a time just isn’t enough.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith the ever-diminishing attention span of adults worldwide, it’s crucial to grab and keep attention while educating the public about your mission. The answer: interactive and animated video-based modules.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1583,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Contact us\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We get it.</strong>&nbsp;Association education teams face unique challenges. You need to deliver high-quality training to diverse audiences, often with limited budgets and tight deadlines. You’re juggling member engagement, certification programs, and maybe even expanding new revenue streams through new online courses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning is here to help.</strong>&nbsp;We specialize in creating custom eLearning solutions for associations just like yours. We understand your need for engaging, effective online learning that meets your specific goals and resonates with your members.&nbsp;<strong>Our deep roots in the nonprofit and association space have given us a unique understanding of the challenges and opportunities facing these organizations.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;Over 70% of our end learners are external, and our clients love us because of our key focus on delivering effective, scalable learning experiences that engage, educate, and inspire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1584,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Choosing-the-Right-LMS-A-Guide-to-Making-an-Informed_Blo10-3-1024x577.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1584\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ninja-box py-6 px-6 container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"stretch\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ninja-box py-6 px-6 container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our approach</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Here’s how we can help your association thrive:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boost Member Engagement:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We design interactive, learner-centric courses that keep members coming back for more. Say goodbye to boring elearning content and hello to dynamic learning experiences that foster a vibrant online community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Streamline Certification Programs:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simplify your certification process with our comprehensive eLearning solutions. We can help you develop, deliver, and track online training that meets your certification requirements and enhances the value of your programs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Generate New Revenue Streams:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn your valuable knowledge into a sustainable income source. We’ll help you create premium online courses that attract new members and generate revenue through subscriptions, certifications, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Maximize Your Budget:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work closely with you to develop cost-effective solutions that deliver exceptional results. Our rapid eLearning development process can get your courses online quickly without compromising quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"4rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our custom <em>eLearning Solutions</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":672,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/73.-iconos-video-accesibility-980x980-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-672\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Online Course Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From initial concept to final delivery, we handle the entire course development process. We create courses that are dynamic, easy to navigate, and aligned with content monetization best practices.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Instructional Design</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great instructional design is the backbone of any eLearning course. Our team of expert designers creates engaging learning experiences that are both effective and learner-centric.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":557,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5.-Art-of-Scripting-480x480-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-557\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":672,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/73.-iconos-video-accesibility-980x980-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-672\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rapid eLearning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Need a quick solution? We specialize in rapid eLearning development that gets your courses online fast. Whether it’s adapting existing elearning content or creating something new, we deliver speed without compromising on quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br><strong>eLearning Video Production</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Video is one of the most engaging ways to deliver elearning content. We produce high-quality eLearning videos that capture attention and drive retention. Whether you need explainer videos or full video lessons, we’ve got you covered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1607,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/64.-iconos-Post-production-01-980x980-1-300x300.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1607\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1608,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/22.-consider-the-ROI-980x980-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1608\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Certificate-Based Training Support</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ll help you develop, deliver, and monetize online training that elevates your certificate programs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><br><strong>Simulated Learning Environments</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to give your learners hands-on experience without real-world risks? Our simulated learning environments allow learners to practice skills in a safe, virtual space.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1046,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/135.-softwaretraining-480x480-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1046\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1372,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-3-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1372\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Compliance/Competency</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many organizations need to ensure their training meets specific compliance or competency standards. We specialize in creating eLearning that helps your learners stay compliant with industry regulations and improve their skillsets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><br><strong>Content Translation and Localization</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reach a broader audience with content translation and localization. We help you adapt your eLearning materials for learners in different languages and cultures, ensuring your content is accessible to all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1609,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/169.-languages-980x980-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1609\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"stretch\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Case Studies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Our work speaks for itself. Check out our case studies to see how we’ve helped organizations like yours achieve their training goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"4rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1615,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ASS_The-Nature-Conservancy-01-1280x720-1-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1615\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">The Nature Conservancy<br></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1616,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ASS_American-Rental-Association-1280x720-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1616\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">American Rental Association</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1617,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ASS_CUNA-1280x720-1-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1617\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Cuna</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1618,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"shadow\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large shadow\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UNITAR-1280x720-1-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1618\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Unitar</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Custom eLearning Solutions for<em> Content Monetization</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">If you’re looking to turn your learning content into a revenue stream, we can help. We design courses that not only educate but also provide opportunities for monetization through subscriptions, certifications, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We understand that content monetization is a complex process, and there are many different ways to approach it. That’s why we take the time to understand your specific goals and create a customized plan to help you achieve them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Here are some of the ways we can help you monetize your eLearning content:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"container\">🔸 <strong>Subscriptions:</strong><br>We can help you create subscription-based courses that give learners access to a library of content for a recurring fee.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Certifications:</strong><br>We can help you develop certification programs that can be sold to learners who want to demonstrate their knowledge and skills.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Individual courses:</strong><br>We can help you create individual courses that can be sold as standalone products.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Corporate training:</strong><br>We can help you create corporate training programs that can be sold to businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We have a deep understanding of the best practices for content monetization. We know what it takes to create high-quality courses that are in demand and that learners are willing to pay for. We also know how to market and promote your courses to reach the right audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003eIndustries We Serve\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We serve nonprofits, associations, healthcare, and more. Our clients include learning managers and education directors who need scalable, effective eLearning solutions that align with their unique missions.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/carousel {\"name\":\"acf/carousel\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Trusted by\",\"_title\":\"field_6976c912ae7f2\",\"carousel_items_0_image\":102,\"_carousel_items_0_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_0_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_0_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_0_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_0_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_1_image\":109,\"_carousel_items_1_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_1_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_1_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_1_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_1_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_2_image\":106,\"_carousel_items_2_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_2_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_2_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_2_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_2_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_3_image\":107,\"_carousel_items_3_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_3_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_3_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_3_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_3_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_4_image\":108,\"_carousel_items_4_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_4_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_4_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_4_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_4_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_5_image\":103,\"_carousel_items_5_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_5_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_5_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_5_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_5_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_6_image\":104,\"_carousel_items_6_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_6_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_6_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_6_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_6_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_7_image\":105,\"_carousel_items_7_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_7_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_7_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_7_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_7_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items_8_image\":101,\"_carousel_items_8_image\":\"field_6976c951ae7f4\",\"carousel_items_8_title\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_8_title\":\"field_6976c960ae7f5\",\"carousel_items_8_link\":\"\",\"_carousel_items_8_link\":\"field_6976c96bae7f6\",\"carousel_items\":9,\"_carousel_items\":\"field_6976c93eae7f3\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Question, <em>Answered</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Much Does It Cost to Create eLearning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning development depends on various factors, including the complexity of the project, the desired production value, and the specific features and functionalities you require. We pride ourselves on being industry leaders in terms of cost-effectiveness due to our specialization in eLearning, our strategic use of AI technologies, and our efficient team structure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our courses typically range from $5,000 to $50,000 for an hour of content. However, it’s important to note that these are estimates, and the final cost will depend on your specific needs and requirements. We’ll work closely with you to understand your budget and create a solution that aligns with your goals and financial constraints.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Long Does It Take to Develop a Custom eLearning Course?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Timelines for eLearning development can vary depending on the complexity of the project, but we typically estimate anywhere from 7 weeks to 4 months. It depends on factors like the amount of content, the level of interactivity, and the need for custom features. We’ll provide you with a detailed timeline at the beginning of the project.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"We understand that associations and nonprofit organizations are looking to maximize the results of their efforts and investments, and that’s exactly what we strive to provide for our clients. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact the team at Ninja Tropic\\u003c/strong\\u003e to set up a free consultation and let’s chat about all the ways an interactive eLearning solution can drive your organization forward – and crush your goals.\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Associations','','inherit','closed','closed','','474-revision-v1','','','2026-03-30 13:50:36','2026-03-30 13:50:36','',474,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1654',0,'revision','',0),(1655,1,'2026-03-30 13:50:38','2026-03-30 13:50:38','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eUniversity-Level Education With eLearning Benefits\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"It can be a bit of a shock when new college students transition from interactive K12 learning methods to large-scale college lectures but integrating video-based solutions for your University students grabs their attention and aids in educational content retention.\\r\\n\\r\\nEngaging animation, captivating voiceover, and stunning graphics combine to complement your professor’s knowledge and expertise to provide a well-rounded, high-quality education. Use it to welcome new students to campus with video-based orientation or just introduce your University President’s message to the student body but eLearning is the pathway to student preference.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1639,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Contact us\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ninja-box px-6 py-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"stretch\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ninja-box px-6 py-6\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1641,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/U_INDIANA-UNIVERSITY-scaled-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"