s-text-align-center\">Which style and format is best for your video? Your video’s content, your audience, your desired branding, and many other factors will come into play when selecting both the style and format of your training video. Ninja Tropic is here to help: check out our article about <em><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-elearning-training-video-script-writing-instructional-design-best-practices/\">eLearning &amp; Training Video Script Writing</a> </em>for an overview of the different style options you have, and take a look at <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-training-video-script-template-for-corporate-elearning/\"><em>Training Video Script Templates for Corporate eLearning</em></a> for sample scripts to help you get started.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1729,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-14-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1729\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"className\":\"mb-3\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-3\"><strong>#4. Choose a script template</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Once you’ve selected your script’s style and format, you can select an appropriate template (or create your own)! Ninja Tropic has plenty of resources to help you with this phase of the process: read our article <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-4-sample-elearning-scripts-for-training-videos/\"><em>Sample eLearning Scripts for Training Videos</em></a> to read some sample scripts and gain some inspiration, or view our general <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-training-video-script-example/\"><em>Training Video Script Example</em></a>. Take inspiration from these and make your own script that meets your needs: the possibilities are endless!<br><br><strong><br></strong><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Tools Narrations','','inherit','closed','closed','','496-revision-v1','','','2026-04-03 18:59:39','2026-04-03 18:59:39','',496,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1740',0,'revision','',0),(1742,1,'2026-04-03 19:00:41','2026-04-03 19:00:41','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eMicrolearning\\u003cem\\u003e Video Narration Tool\\u003c/em\\u003e Voiceover Length Estimate\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1704,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":\"\",\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\">Write Better<em> eLearning Narration Scripts</em> With Our Timer Tool</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic’s Video Script Timer is a free tool that provides you the estimated narration length of your video script, your script’s word count, access to a free narrator, and an audio generator . . . all in one! Here’s how it works:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1715,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-9.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1715\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Copy and paste your script into the tool</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1714,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-8.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1714\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. Select if you would like your script read at a slower than average, average, or above-average pace</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1713,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-10.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1713\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. The script timer generates your script word count and the estimated time of your video</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1712,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-11.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1712\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. Select your audio narration (you can select between several voices) and download your free script narration</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container my-6 py-6\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container my-6 py-6\">With this useful tool, you will know exactly how long your e-learning video will be (and––should you choose to use the generated audio––you’ll save money and time on hiring a narrator). Because the video script timer tells you your video’s length, it keeps your project on track: you will avoid unexpected costs or delays from a script that runs longer than your allotted time or budget.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<iframe class=\"container\" src=\"https://heroic-narwhal-59997c.netlify.app/\" height=\"1880\" width=\"1920\"></iframe>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp: