\u0022 data-edge=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"Text and captions should meet the standard contrast ratio of 4.5:1 or greater.* Learn more on the \\u003cem\\u003eWeb Accessibility Initiative (WAI)\\u003c/em\\u003e webpage explaining what contrast ratio checker results mean.\\r\\n\\r\\nHow did you do? If your combination is not compliant, then you can continue adjusting the colors and fonts until the tool indicates that you have created a combination that is acceptable. Use these fonts and colors on your next website or for your online learning materials.\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Tools ADA Color','','inherit','closed','closed','','499-revision-v1','','','2026-04-03 20:51:32','2026-04-03 20:51:32','',499,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1774',0,'revision','',0),(1776,1,'2026-04-03 20:55:14','2026-04-03 20:55:14','','Proof-of-commitment-to-an-important-cause-2','','inherit','open','closed','','proof-of-commitment-to-an-important-cause-2','','','2026-04-03 20:55:14','2026-04-03 20:55:14','',499,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Proof-of-commitment-to-an-important-cause-2.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1777,1,'2026-04-03 20:55:52','2026-04-03 20:55:52','','Video-Training-Strategy-2-1','','inherit','open','closed','','video-training-strategy-2-1','','','2026-04-03 20:55:52','2026-04-03 20:55:52','',499,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Video-Training-Strategy-2-1.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1778,1,'2026-04-03 20:55:58','2026-04-03 20:55:58','','Video-Training-Strategy_3','','inherit','open','closed','','video-training-strategy_3','','','2026-04-03 20:55:58','2026-04-03 20:55:58','',499,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Video-Training-Strategy_3.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1779,1,'2026-04-03 20:56:07','2026-04-03 20:56:07','<!-- wp:acf/page-headi