de (or choose a color using the tool’s color picker). To adjust the color, you can use tool’s Lightness slider.\\r\\n\\r\\n#3 Select your fonts and font sizes.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1765,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eThe Color Checker Will\\r\\nThen \\u003cem\\u003eDo the Following\\u003c/em\\u003e:\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"#1 Determine which colors your website/learning materials uses (or will use). The colors are classified using RGB hexadecimal format (for example, #FD3 or #F7DA39).\\r\\n\\r\\n#2 Select a foreground and background color using the RGB hexadecimal code (or choose a color using the tool’s color picker). To adjust the color, you can use tool’s Lightness slider.\\r\\n\\r\\n#3 Select your fonts and font sizes.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1768,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eCheck Your Color Contrast for Accessibility Compliance\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"Text and captions should meet the standard contrast ratio of 4.5:1 or greater.* Learn more on the \\u003cem\\u003eWeb Accessibility Initiative (WAI)\\u003c/em\\u003e webpage explaining what contrast ratio checker results mean.\\r\\n\\r\\nHow did you do? If your combination is not compliant, then you can continue adjusting the colors and fonts until the tool indicates that you have created a combination that is acceptable. Use these fonts and colors on your next website or for your online learning materials.\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Benefits of the ADA Color Checker Tool</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Why use the tool checker? ADA and WCAG compliance offers the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1776,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail is-rounded\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Proof-of-commitment-to-an-important-cause-2-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1776\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-4\">#1. Proof of Commitment to an Important Cause</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By demonstrating your commitment to inclusive online learning materials, you are providing a compassionate support to an appreciative group of sight-challenged learners. Groups who benefit from this include those who are color blind, have a limited color range, or have moderately low vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1777,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Video-Training-Strategy-2-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1777\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-4\">#2. Reach a Broader Audience</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By demonstrating your commitment to inclusive online learning materials, you are providing a compassionate support to an appreciative group of sight-challenged learners. Groups who benefit from this include those who are color blind, have a limited color range, or have moderately low vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column px-4 py-4 ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1778,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Video-Training-Strategy_3-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1778\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-4\">#3. A Modern Approach</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By demonstrating your commitment to inclusive online learning materials, you are providing a compassionate support to an appreciative group of sight-challenged learners. Groups who benefit from this include those who are color blind, have a limited color range, or have moderately low vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/cta-box {\"name\":\"acf/cta-box\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eLearn more about ADA color compliance with the following resources:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b7663fa36a8\",\"description\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBlogs:\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\nUSING 508 ACCESSIBILITY TOOLS FOR COLOR CONTRAST IN ELEARNING VIDEOS\\r\\nUSING A 508 COMPLIANCE CHECKLIST FOR VIDEO LEARNING\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eReferences:\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\nWCAG Color Contrast Checker\\r\\nUNDERSTANDING – WCAG20\\r\\n\\r\\n* For quick reference: \\u003cem\\u003eWCAG 2.0 level AA r\\u003c/em\\u003eequires a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for normal text and 3:1 for large text. \\u003cem\\u003eWCAG 2.1\\u003c/em\\u003e requires a minimum contrast ratio of 3:1 for graphics and user interface components (for example, form input borders). WCAG Level AAA requires a minimum contrast ratio of 7:1 for normal text and 4.5:1 for large text.\",\"_description\":\"field_69b76659a36a9\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69b76663a36aa\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflo