collection of icons, imagery, and data visualizations that give learners an easy-to-understand overview of a topic. They are a popular style for eLearning as they help learners quickly grasp complex information and improve their comprehension. Infographics can be used to convey statistics, procedures, timelines, and other types of information that may be difficult to understand through text alone. They can help to reduce cognitive overload, making it easier for learners to process and retain information. Infographics are also a powerful branding tool for eLearning companies as they can be customized to match the brand’s visual identity and style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223861/0b300da0aa?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/821223861/0b300da0aa?fl=pl&amp;fe=sh\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Option A</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1910,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Infographic-Option-A-cropped.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1910\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1911,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q1-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1911\"/></figure