2:14:29','2026-04-05 22:14:29','',1882,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1883',0,'revision','',0),(1884,1,'2026-04-05 22:14:41','2026-04-05 22:14:41','<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":4,\"className\":\"custom-sidebar-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Friendly Corporate</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is a design style that takes a more casual and playful approach than traditional corporate design. It incorporates characters with exaggerated features, adding personality and warmth to the learning experience. Friendly Corporate is effective for conveying a professional image while still keeping the content approachable and engaging. The use of Friendly Corporate can help to create a more relatable and personable learning experience that allows for expressive emotion in a business-oriented style. It can also be used to reinforce key concepts and ideas by making them more memorable.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223757/e843063760?fl=pl\\u0026fe=cm\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"