gn-center\">Comicbook</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is a design style that utilizes sequential narration to tell stories and engage learners. The design incorporates characters, scenarios, and line art that can range from sketchy to highly detailed. Comicbook is particularly effective for learners who respond well to visual storytelling. The use of Comicbook can help to make learning more engaging and immersive. It can also be used to create a more memorable learning experience that reinforces key concepts and ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223509/915e863c64?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/821223509/915e863c64?fl=pl&amp;fe=sh\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Option A</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1957,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ComicBook-Option-A.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1957\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1958,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"