\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Kid-Friendly Characters</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is a design style that is commonly used in eLearning for children. It includes characters with rounded big eyes that children can easily relate to, as well as other iconography such as animals and objects. This style can be adapted from adult styles to suit children’s needs and age range. For this audience, the use of Kid-Friendly Characters can help to create a more engaging and fun learning experience for children. It can also be used to reinforce key concepts and ideas by making them more memorable and relatable. Kid-Friendly is a broad range! As you would expect, teenagers are very different from 3rd graders. We often adapt adult styles for this audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223911/e2c9a1a77d?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/821223911/e2c9a1a77d?fl=pl&amp;fe=sh\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Icons and elements</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1974,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Kid-Friendly-cropped.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1974\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1975,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q13_2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1975\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1976,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q13_3.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1976\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">See Our Portfolio</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','tools-moodboard-kid-friendly-characters','','inherit','closed','closed','','1888-revision-v1','','','2026-04-06 03:39:14','2026-04-06 03:39:14','',1888,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1977',0,'revision','',0),(1979,1,'2026-04-06 03:40:47','2026-04-06 03:40:47','','Minimalist-Abstract-A','','inherit','open','closed','','minimalist-abstract-a','','','2026-04-06 03:40:47','2026-04-06 03:40:47','',1890,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Minimalist-Abstract-A.gif',0,'attachment','image/gif',0),(1980,1,'2026-04-06 03:40:57','2026-04-06 03:40:57','','q14_2','','inherit','open','closed','','q14_2','','','2026-04-06 03:40:57','2026-04-06 03:40:57','',1890,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q14_2.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1981,1,'2026-04-06 03:42:09','2026-04-06 03:42:09','','Minimalist-Abstract-Opcion-B','','inherit','open','closed','','minimalist-abstract-opcion-b','','','2026-04-06 03:42:09','2026-04-06 03:42:09','',1890,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Minimalist-Abstract-Opcion-B.gif',0,'attachment','image/gif',0),(1982,1,'2026-04-06 03:42:17','2026-04-06 03:42:17','','q15_2','','inherit','open','closed','','q15_2','','','2026-04-06 03:42:17','2026-04-06 03:42:17','',1890,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q15_2.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1983,1,'2026-04-06 03:42:26','2026-04-06 03:42:26','','q15_3','','inherit','open','closed','','q15_3','','','2026-04-06 03:42:26','2026-04-06 03:42:26','',1890,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q15_3.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1984,1,'2026-04-06 03:42:29','2026-04-06 03:42:29','<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":4,\"className\":\"custom-sidebar-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Minimalist-Abstract</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is a design style that is characterized by its simplicity and use of basic shapes and limited color palettes. It is an effective style for eLearning as it conveys complex information in a clear and concise manner. Minimalist-Abstract can be used to create a minimalist and modern look that is visually appealing and easy to understand. In instructional design, the use of Minimalist-Abstract can help to make learning more efficient and effective by focusing on the most important information and concepts.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821224019/fedea4895c?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/821224019/fedea4895c?fl=pl&amp;fe=sh\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4em\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4em\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Option A</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1979,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Minimalist-Abstract-A.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1979\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1980,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/q14_2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1980\"/></figure>\n<!-- /